de Workflow Upstash pour TypeScript","de":"Upstash Workflow SDK für TypeScript","pt":"Upstash Workflow SDK: Funções Serverless Confiáveis","ru":"Upstash Workflow SDK: Надежные Серверные Функции","ar":"Upstash Workflow SDK: دوال خادمية موثوقة","en":"upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK Skill"},"description":{"zh":"Upstash Workflow SDK, QStash, Serverless","ja":"Upstash Workflow SDK, QStash, Serverless","ko":"Upstash Workflow SDK, QStash, Serverless","es":"El SDK de Workflow de Upstash permite exponer puntos de conexión de flujos de trabajo serverless y ejecutarlos de manera confiable","fr":"Le SDK de Workflow Upstash permet d''exposer des points de terminaison de flux de travail serverless et de les exécuter de manière fiable","de":"Das Upstash-Workflow-SDK ermöglicht die Exposition von Serverless-Workflow-Endpunkten und deren zuverlässige Ausführung","pt":"O Upstash Workflow SDK permite expor pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho serverless e executá-los de forma confiável usando QStash. É uma solução durá...","ru":"Upstash Workflow SDK позволяет экспонировать серверные конечные точки рабочих процессов и выполнять их надежно с помощью QStash. Это прочное и производительн...","ar":"يمكّن Upstash Workflow SDK من نشر نقاط نهاية سير عمل خادمية وتشغيلها بطريقة موثوقة باستخدام QStash. إنه حل قوي وذات أداء عالي لاحتياجاتك في سير العمل","en":"Durable, Reliable and Performant Serverless Functions"},"definition":{"en":"Durable, Reliable and Performant Serverless Functions"},"features":{"zh":["Serverless","QStash","TypeScript","Reliable","Performant"],"ja":["Serverless","QStash","TypeScript","Reliable","Performant"],"ko":["Serverless","QStash","TypeScript","Reliable","Performant"],"es":["Funciones serverless duraderas","Ejecución confiable de flujos de trabajo","Integración con QStash","Definición de puntos de conexión de flujos de trabajo","Ejecución de pasos de flujo de trabajo asíncronos"],"fr":["Fonctions serverless durables","Exécution fiable de flux de travail","Intégration avec QStash","Définition de points de terminaison de flux de travail","Exécution de pas de flux de travail asynchrones"],"de":["Zuverlässige Serverless-Funktionen","Zuverlässige Ausführung von Workflows","Integration mit QStash","Definition von Workflow-Endpunkten","Ausführung von asynchronen Workflow-Schritten"],"pt":["Funções serverless duráveis e performáticas","Integração com QStash para confiabilidade","Definição de pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho personalizados","Suporte a execução de passos de fluxo de trabalho assíncronos","Implementação simples e rápida"],"ru":["Надежные и производительные серверные функции","Интеграция с QStash для надежности","Определение пользовательских конечных точек рабочих процессов","Поддержка выполнения асинхронных шагов рабочих процессов","Простая и быстрая реализация"],"ar":["دوال خادمية موثوقة وذات أداء عالي","التكامل مع QStash للموثوقية","تحديد نقاط نهاية سير عمل مخصصة","دعم تشغيل خطوات سير عمل غير متزامنة","تنفيذ بسيط وسريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Upstash Workflow SDK","Serverless Functions","TypeScript SDK","QStash","Reliable Serverless","Performant Serverless"],"ja":["Upstash Workflow SDK","Serverless Functions","TypeScript SDK","QStash","Reliable Serverless","Performant Serverless"],"ko":["Upstash Workflow SDK","Serverless Functions","TypeScript SDK","QStash","Reliable Serverless","Performant Serverless"],"es":["SDK de Workflow","Funciones serverless","QStash","Flujos de trabajo","Desarrollo de software","TypeScript","Serverless","Arquitectura de software"],"fr":["SDK de Workflow","Fonctions serverless","QStash","Flux de travail","Développement de logiciels","TypeScript","Serverless","Architecture de logiciels"],"de":["Workflow-SDK","Serverless-Funktionen","QStash","Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","TypeScript","Serverless","Software-Architektur"],"pt":["Upstash Workflow SDK","funções serverless","fluxo de trabalho","QStash","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias serverless","bibliotecas de desenvolvimento","soluções de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Upstash Workflow SDK","серверные функции","рабочие процессы","QStash","разработка программного обеспечения","технологии серверных функций","библиотеки разработки","решения для рабочих процессов"],"ar":["Upstash Workflow SDK","دوال خادمية","سير عمل","QStash","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الدوال الخادمية","مكتبات التطوير","حلول سير العمل"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"workflow-js","repoPath":"upstash/workflow-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.876Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash/workflow TypeScript SDK Skill","description":"Lightweight guidance for using the Upstash Workflow SDK to define, trigger, and manage workflows. Use this Skill whenever a user wants to create workflow endpoints, run steps, or interact with the Upstash Workflow client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from yo","body":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from your backend:\n\n```ts\nimport { Client } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nconst client = new Client({ token: process.env.QSTASH_TOKEN! });\nawait client.trigger({ url: \"https://your-app.com/api/workflow\" });\n```\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\nThese files contain the full documentation. Use them for details, patterns, and advanced behavior.\n\n- basics:\n  - **basics/serve** – How to expose workflow endpoints.\n  - **basics/context** – Full API for workflow `context` (steps, waits, webhooks, events, invoke, etc.).\n  - **basics/client** – Using the Workflow client to trigger, cancel, inspect, and notify runs.\n- features:\n  - **features/invoke** – Cross‑workflow invocation.\n  - **features/reliability** – Retries, failure callbacks, and DLQ.\n  - **features/flow-control** – Rate limits, concurrency, and parallelism.\n  - **features/wait-for-event** – Notify and wait-for-event patterns.\n  - **features/webhooks** – Webhook creation and consumption.\n- how to:\n  - **how-to/local-dev** – Local QStash dev server and tunneling.\n  - **how-to/realtime** – Realtime and human‑in‑the‑loop workflows.\n  - **how-to/migrations** – Migrating workflows safely.\n  - **how-to/middleware** – Adding middleware to workflows.\n- other files:\n  - **rest-api** – Low-level REST endpoints for interacting with QStash/Workflow.\n  - **troubleshooting** – Common debugging and environment issues.\n  - **agents** – Using Workflow with agents, orchestrators, and automation patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:12.821Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing durable and reliable workflow execution using QStash and TypeScript.","zh":"非常适合需要使用QStash和TypeScript进行可靠和耐用的工作流执行的Serverless Agents。","ja":"QStashとTypeScriptを使用した信頼性の高いワークフローの実行が必要なServerlessエージェントに最適です。","ko":"QStash와 TypeScript를 사용하여 안정적이고 신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로우 실행이 필요한 Serverless 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing durable and reliable workflow execution using QStash and TypeScript.","fr":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing durable and reliable workflow execution using QStash and TypeScript.","de":"Perfect for Serverless Agents needing durable and reliable workflow execution using QStash and TypeScript.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Serverless que precisam de execução de fluxo de trabalho durável e confiável usando QStash e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Serverless, которым требуется прочная и надежная выполнение рабочего процесса с помощью QStash и TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Serverless الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ تدفق عمل متين وموثوق باستخدام QStash و TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood, leveraging the @upstash/workflow library for performant and scalable workflow management, and supporting protocols like HTTP POST.","zh":"赋予代理服务器暴露无服务器工作流端点并使用QStash可靠运行它们的能力，利用@upstash/workflow库实现高性能和可扩展的工作流管理，并支持HTTP POST等协议。","ja":"エージェントがサーバーレスワークフローのエンドポイントを公開し、QStashを使用して信頼性の高い方法で実行できるようにし、@upstash/workflowライブラリを使用してパフォーマンスとスケーラビリティの高いワークフローマネージメントを可能にし、HTTP POSTなどのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 서버리스 워크플로우 엔드포인트를 노출하고 QStash를 사용하여 안정적으로 실행할 수 있도록 하며, @upstash/workflow 라이브러리를 사용하여 고성능 및 확장 가능한 워크플로우 관리를 지원하고 HTTP POST 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood, leveraging the @upstash/workflow library for performant and scalable workflow management, and supporting protocols like HTTP POST.","fr":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood, leveraging the @upstash/workflow library for performant and scalable workflow management, and supporting protocols like HTTP POST.","de":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood, leveraging the @upstash/workflow library for performant and scalable workflow management, and supporting protocols like HTTP POST.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a expor pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor e executá-los de forma confiável usando QStash em segundo plano, aproveitando a biblioteca @upstash/workflow para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho performático e escalável, e suportando protocolos como HTTP POST.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью暴ить конечные точки рабочего процесса без сервера и запускать их надежно, используя QStash под капотом, используя библиотеку @upstash/workflow для производительного и масштабируемого управления рабочим процессом, и поддерживая протоколы, такие как HTTP POST.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التعرض لنقاط نهاية تدفق العمل بدون خادم و تشغيلها بطريقة موثوقة باستخدام QStash في الخلفية، وتحقيق مكتبة @upstash/workflow لإدارة تدفق العمل بأداء عال و قابل للتوسع، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل HTTP POST."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining simple workflow endpoints with async steps","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources","Building reliable and performant serverless functions with QStash"],"zh":["定义带有异步步骤的简单工作流端点","从外部源触发服务器工作流","使用QStash构建可靠和高性能的服务器函数"],"ja":["非同期ステップを使用したシンプルなワークフローエンドポイントの定義","外部ソースからのサーバーレスワークフローのトリガー","QStashを使用した信頼性の高いパフォーマンスのサーバーレス関数の構築"],"ko":["비동기 단계를 사용한 간단한 워크플로우 엔드포인트 정의","외부 소스에서 서버리스 워크플로우 트리거","QStash를 사용하여 안정적이고 고성능의 서버리스 함수 구축"],"es":["Defining simple workflow endpoints with async steps","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources","Building reliable and performant serverless functions with QStash"],"fr":["Defining simple workflow endpoints with async steps","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources","Building reliable and performant serverless functions with QStash"],"de":["Defining simple workflow endpoints with async steps","Triggering serverless workflows from external sources","Building reliable and performant serverless functions with QStash"],"pt":["Definir pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho simples com etapas assíncronas","Disparar fluxos de trabalho sem servidor a partir de fontes externas","Construir funções sem servidor confiáveis e performáticas com QStash"],"ru":["Определение простых конечных точек рабочего процесса с асинхронными шагами","Запуск рабочих процессов без сервера из внешних источников","Построение надежных и производительных функций без сервера с QStash"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط نهاية تدفق العمل البسيطة مع خطوات متعددة","تشغيل تدفقات العمل بدون خادم من مصادر خارجية","بناء دوال بدون خادم موثوقة وذات أداء عال مع QStash"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","TypeScript compatibility required","QStash dependency for reliable workflow execution"],"zh":["需要安装@upstash/workflow的npm","需要TypeScript兼容性","需要QStash来实现可靠的工作流执行"],"ja":["@upstash/workflowのnpmのインストールが必要","TypeScriptの互換性が必要","信頼性の高いワークフローの実行にはQStashが必要"],"ko":["@upstash/workflow의 npm 설치가 필요합니다.","TypeScript 호환성이 필요합니다.","안정적인 워크플로우 실행을 위해서는 QStash가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","TypeScript compatibility required","QStash dependency for reliable workflow execution"],"fr":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","TypeScript compatibility required","QStash dependency for reliable workflow execution"],"de":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","TypeScript compatibility required","QStash dependency for reliable workflow execution"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm do @upstash/workflow","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária","Dependência do QStash para execução de fluxo de trabalho confiável"],"ru":["Требуется установка npm @upstash/workflow","Требуется совместимость с TypeScript","Зависимость от QStash для надежной выполнения рабочего процесса"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm @upstash/workflow","متطلبات التوافق مع TypeScript","اعتماد على QStash من أجل تنفيذ تدفق العمل الموثوق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7a2a4846d405c7b003a04f778c484244ff425d08f11f1a356a714d3328f03d60","qualityScore":31}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('raine/workmux/worktree', 'community', 'raine', 'workmux', 'raine/workmux', 'worktree', 0, 0, 31, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:10.961Z', '222481216adf803430cea1996068fe03f654b27e1ab7d556fc1fdf1b0b4614fa', '{"id":"raine/workmux/worktree","name":"worktree","description":{"zh":"Worktree技能是使用git worktrees和Tmux窗口实现零摩擦的并行开发，提高开发效率","ja":"Worktreeスキルは、git worktreesとTmuxウィンドウを使用して零摩擦の並列開発を実現し、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"워크트리 스킬은 git 워크트리와 tmux 창을 사용하여 제로 마찰의 병렬 개발을 구현하고 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 방법입니다","es":"Worktree es una herramienta que combina git worktrees y tmux windows para un desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","fr":"Worktree est un outil qui combine git worktrees et tmux windows pour un développement parallèle sans friction","de":"Worktree ist ein Tool, das git worktrees und tmux windows für eine parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung kombiniert","pt":"O Worktree é uma ferramenta que permite desenvolvimento paralelo com git worktrees e tmux, permitindo que os desenvolvedores trabalhem em tarefas simultaneamente.","ru":"Worktree — это инструмент, который позволяет параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees и Tmux, позволяя разработчикам работать над задачами одновременно.","ar":"ووركتري هو أداة تسمح بالتطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز وتموكس، وتمكن المطورين من العمل على مهام متزامنة.","en":"git worktrees + tmux windows for zero-friction parallel dev"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Worktree技能：零摩擦的并行开发","ja":"Worktreeスキル：零摩擦の並列開発","ko":"워크트리 스킬: 제로 마찰의 병렬 개발","es":"Worktree: Desarrollo Paralelo con Git y Tmux","fr":"Worktree: Développement Parallèle avec Git et Tmux","de":"Worktree: Parallele Entwicklung mit Git und Tmux","pt":"Worktree: Desenvolvimento Paralelo com Git Worktrees e Tmux","ru":"Worktree: Параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees и Tmux","ar":"ووركتري: التطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز وتموكس","en":"worktree"},"description":{"zh":"Worktree技能是使用git worktrees和Tmux窗口实现零摩擦的并行开发，提高开发效率","ja":"Worktreeスキルは、git worktreesとTmuxウィンドウを使用して零摩擦の並列開発を実現し、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"워크트리 스킬은 git 워크트리와 tmux 창을 사용하여 제로 마찰의 병렬 개발을 구현하고 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 방법입니다","es":"Worktree es una herramienta que combina git worktrees y tmux windows para un desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","fr":"Worktree est un outil qui combine git worktrees et tmux windows pour un développement parallèle sans friction","de":"Worktree ist ein Tool, das git worktrees und tmux windows für eine parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung kombiniert","pt":"O Worktree é uma ferramenta que permite desenvolvimento paralelo com git worktrees e tmux, permitindo que os desenvolvedores trabalhem em tarefas simultaneam...","ru":"Worktree — это инструмент, который позволяет параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees и Tmux, позволяя разработчикам работать над задачами одновременно.","ar":"ووركتري هو أداة تسمح بالتطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز وتموكس، وتمكن المطورين من العمل على مهام متزامنة.","en":"git worktrees + tmux windows for zero-friction parallel dev"},"definition":{"en":"git worktrees + tmux windows for zero-friction parallel dev"},"features":{"zh":["使用git worktrees实现并行开发","集成Tmux窗口提高开发效率","零摩擦开发体验","提高代码质量","简化开发流程"],"ja":["git worktreesを使用して並列開発を実現","Tmuxウィンドウを統合して開発効率を向上","零摩擦開発体験","コード品質の向上","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["git 워크트리를 사용하여 병렬 개발을 구현","tmux 창을 통합하여 개발 효율성을 향상","제로 마찰 개발 경험","코드 품질 향상","개발 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["Desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","Uso de git worktrees","Integración con tmux windows","Lanzamiento de tareas en nuevos worktrees","Compatibilidad con workmux"],"fr":["Développement parallèle sans friction","Utilisation de git worktrees","Intégration avec tmux windows","Lancement de tâches dans de nouveaux worktrees","Compatibilité avec workmux"],"de":["Parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung","Verwendung von git worktrees","Integration mit tmux windows","Starten von Aufgaben in neuen Worktrees","Kompatibilität mit workmux"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento paralelo com git worktrees","Integração com tmux para gerenciamento de janelas","Criação de tarefas simultâneas","Aumento da produtividade do time de desenvolvimento","Fácil utilização e configuração"],"ru":["Параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees","Интеграция с Tmux для управления окнами","Создание одновременных задач","Увеличение производительности команды разработки","Лёгкое использование и настройка"],"ar":["التطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز","التكامل مع تموكس لإدارة النوافذ","إنشاء مهام متزامنة","زيادة إنتاجية فريق التطوير","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Worktree","git worktrees","Tmux","并行开发","零摩擦开发","开发效率","代码质量","开发流程"],"ja":["Worktree","git worktrees","Tmux","並列開発","零摩擦開発","開発効率","コード品質","開発プロセス"],"ko":["워크트리","git 워크트리","tmux","병렬 개발","제로 마찰 개발","개발 효율성","코드 품질","개발 프로세스"],"es":["desarrollo paralelo","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement parallèle","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","productivité de développement"],"de":["parallele Entwicklung","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["desenvolvimento paralelo","git worktrees","tmux","produtividade","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvedores","equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["параллельное развитие","Git Worktrees","Tmux","производительность","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","разработчики","команды разработки"],"ar":["التطوير الموازي","جيت ووركتيرز","تموكس","إنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","المطورين","فرق التطوير"]}},"owner":"raine","repo":"workmux","repoPath":"raine/workmux","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"worktree","description":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.","bodyPreview":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a pro","body":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a prompt, write it\nimmediately. If not, ask the user for clarification — do NOT try to figure it\nout by reading code.\n\nIf tasks reference earlier conversation (e.g., \"do option 2\"), include all\nrelevant context in each prompt you write.\n\nIf tasks reference a markdown file (e.g., a plan or spec), re-read the file to\nensure you have the latest version before writing prompts.\n\nFor each task:\n\n1. Generate a short, descriptive worktree name (2-4 words, kebab-case)\n2. Write a detailed implementation prompt to a temp file\n3. Run `workmux add <worktree-name> -b -P <temp-file>` to create the worktree\n\nThe prompt file should:\n\n- Include the full task description\n- Use RELATIVE paths only (never absolute paths, since each worktree has its own\n  root directory)\n- Be specific about what the agent should accomplish\n\n## Skill delegation\n\nIf the user passes a skill reference (e.g., `/auto`, `/plan-review`),\nthe prompt should instruct the agent to use that skill instead of writing out\nmanual implementation steps.\n\n**Skills can have flags.** If the user passes `/auto --gemini`, pass the\nflag through to the skill invocation in the prompt.\n\nExample prompt:\n```\n[Task description here]\n\nUse the skill: /skill-name [flags if any] [task description]\n```\n\nDo NOT write detailed implementation steps when a skill is specified — the skill\nhandles that.\n\n## Flags\n\n**`--merge`**: When passed, add instruction to use `/merge` skill at the end to\ncommit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n\n```\n...\nThen use the /merge skill to commit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWrite ALL temp files first, THEN run all workmux commands.\n\nStep 1 - Write all prompt files (in parallel):\n\n```bash\ntmpfile=$(mktemp).md\ncat > \"$tmpfile\" << ''EOF''\nImplement feature X...\nEOF\necho \"$tmpfile\"  # Note the path for step 2\n```\n\nStep 2 - After ALL files are written, run workmux commands (in parallel):\n\n```bash\nworkmux add feature-x -b -P /tmp/tmp.abc123.md\nworkmux add feature-y -b -P /tmp/tmp.def456.md\n```\n\nAfter creating the worktrees, inform the user which branches were created.\n\n**Remember:** Your task is COMPLETE once worktrees are created. Do NOT implement\nanything yourself.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:10.961Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless parallel development capabilities with git worktrees and tmux windows","zh":"适用于需要使用 git worktrees 和 tmux 窗口进行无缝并行开发的开发代理","ja":"git worktrees と tmux ウィンドウを使用したシームレスな並行開発機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適","ko":"git worktrees와 tmux 창을 사용하여無шов한 병렬 개발 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren capacidades de desarrollo paralelo sin problemas con git worktrees y ventanas de tmux","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de développement parallèle sans rupture avec git worktrees et fenêtres tmux","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine nahtlose parallele Entwicklung mit git Worktrees und tmux-Fenstern erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem capacidades de desenvolvimento paralelo sem interrupção com git worktrees e janelas tmux","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовных возможностей параллельной разработки с git worktrees и окнами tmux","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إمكانيات التطوير الموازي دون انقطاع مع git worktrees ونافذة tmux"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to launch multiple tasks in isolated git worktrees using workmux, enabling zero-friction parallel development with features like tmux window management and automated task dispatching","zh":"使代理能够使用 workmux 在隔离的 git worktrees 中启动多个任务，实现零摩擦的并行开发，具有 tmux 窗口管理和自动任务调度等功能","ja":"エージェントが workmux を使用して分離された git worktrees 内で複数のタスクを起動できるようにし、tmux ウィンドウ管理や自動タスク派遣などの機能を備えた零摩擦の並行開発を可能に","ko":"에이전트가 workmux를 사용하여 분리된 git worktrees 내에서 여러 작업을 시작할 수 있도록 하여, tmux 창 관리 및 자동 작업 배포와 같은 기능을 갖춘 无摩擦의 병렬 개발을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar múltiples tareas en git worktrees aislados utilizando workmux, lo que permite un desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones con características como la gestión de ventanas tmux y el envío automático de tareas","fr":"Permet aux agents de lancer plusieurs tâches dans des worktrees git isolés à l''aide de workmux, permettant un développement parallèle sans friction avec des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion de fenêtres tmux et l''expédition automatique de tâches","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, mehrere Aufgaben in isolierten git Worktrees mit workmux zu starten, wodurch ein reibungsloser paralleler Entwicklungsprozess mit Funktionen wie tmux-Fensterverwaltung und automatischer Auftragsherstellung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lançar várias tarefas em git worktrees isolados usando workmux, permitindo o desenvolvimento paralelo sem atrito com recursos como gerenciamento de janelas tmux e despacho de tarefas automatizado","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запуска нескольких задач в изолированных git worktrees с помощью workmux, обеспечивая параллельную разработку без трения с функциями, такими как управление окнами tmux и автоматическая отправка задач","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إطلاق مهام متعددة في git worktrees معزولة باستخدام workmux، مما يتيح التطوير الموازي بدون احتكاك مع ميزات مثل إدارة نوافذ tmux وتوزيع المهام الآلي"},"useCases":{"en":["Launching parallel development tasks","Managing multiple git worktrees","Automating task dispatching with workmux"],"zh":["启动并行开发任务","管理多个 git worktrees","使用 workmux 自动任务调度"],"ja":["並行開発タスクの起動","複数の git worktrees の管理","workmux を使用した自動タスク派遣"],"ko":["병렬 개발 작업 시작","여러 git worktrees 관리","workmux를 사용한 자동 작업 배포"],"es":["Lanzar tareas de desarrollo paralelo","Administrar múltiples git worktrees","Automatizar el envío de tareas con workmux"],"fr":["Lancer des tâches de développement parallèle","Gérer plusieurs worktrees git","Automatiser l''expédition de tâches avec workmux"],"de":["Starten von Aufgaben für die parallele Entwicklung","Verwalten mehrerer git Worktrees","Automatisieren der Auftragsherstellung mit workmux"],"pt":["Lançar tarefas de desenvolvimento paralelo","Gerenciar vários git worktrees","Automatizar o despacho de tarefas com workmux"],"ru":["Запуск параллельных задач разработки","Управление несколькими git worktrees","Автоматизация отправки задач с помощью workmux"],"ar":["إطلاق مهام التطوير الموازي","إدارة متعددة git worktrees","التوفير الآلي لتحويل المهام مع workmux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git and tmux installation","No codebase exploration or investigation allowed","Dependent on workmux for task management"],"zh":["需要 git 和 tmux 安装","不允许代码库探索或调查","依赖 workmux 进行任务管理"],"ja":["git と tmux のインストールが必要","コードベースの探索や調査は許可されない","タスク管理に workmux 依存"],"ko":["git 및 tmux 설치가 필요","코드베이스 탐색 또는 조사 허용 안됨","작업 관리에 workmux 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de git y tmux","No se permite la exploración o investigación del código base","Dependiente de workmux para la gestión de tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git et tmux","L''exploration ou l''enquête sur le code base n''est pas autorisée","Dépend de workmux pour la gestion des tâches"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von git und tmux","Keine Codebasis-Exploration oder -Untersuchung erlaubt","Von workmux für die Aufgabenverwaltung abhängig"],"pt":["Exige instalação do git e tmux","Nenhuma exploração ou investigação de codebase permitida","Dependente do workmux para gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует установки git и tmux","Не допускается исследование или расследование codebase","Зависит от workmux для управления задачами"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت git و tmux","لا يسمح بفحص أو تحقيق codebase","يعتمد على workmux لإدارة المهام"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"222481216adf803430cea1996068fe03f654b27e1ab7d556fc1fdf1b0b4614fa","qualityScore":31}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('feiskyer/codex-settings/deep-research', 'community', 'feiskyer', 'codex-settings', 'feiskyer/codex-settings', 'deep-research', 0, 0, 31, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.881Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:16.348Z', '44bf8a38bb93d1f937e1da5bfb0fa4b2987fca617575d9887938cdb03cecff99', '{"id":"feiskyer/codex-settings/deep-research","name":"deep-research","description":{"zh":"深度调研技能是用于优化生产流程的技能，能够保持默认模型与配置不变，并确保子进程的沙盒安全。它能够优化生产流程，提高生产效率","ja":"ディープリサーチスキルは生産フローを最適化するために使用されるスキルで、デフォルトモデルの設定を変更せず、サブプロセスのサンドボックスセキュリティを確保します","ko":"디프리서치 스킬은 생산 프로세스를 최적화하기 위한 스킬로 기본 모델 및 구성 설정을 변경하지 않으며 하위 프로세스의 샌드박스 보안을 보장합니다","es":"OpenAI Codex permite la investigación profunda a través de configuraciones y habilidades personalizadas, mejorando la productividad en la codificación","fr":"OpenAI Codex permet la recherche approfondie via des configurations et des compétences personnalisées, améliorant la productivité dans la codification","de":"OpenAI Codex ermöglicht tiefe Recherchen durch personalisierte Konfigurationen und Fähigkeiten, die die Produktivität bei der Kodierung verbessern","pt":"O Deep Research é uma habilidade que permite automatizar a pesquisa e desenvolver habilidades de codificação mais eficazes com o OpenAI Codex","ru":"Глубокое исследование - это навык, который позволяет автоматизировать работу и развивать более эффективные навыки кодирования с помощью OpenAI Codex","ar":"البحث العميق هو مهارة تتيح لك أتمتة بحثك وتطوير مهارات الترميز بشكل أكثر فعالية مع OpenAI Codex","en":"OpenAI Codex CLI settings, configurations, skills and prompts for vibe coding"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"深度调研技能：优化生产流程与配置","ja":"ディープリサーチスキル：生産フローと設定の最適化","ko":"디프리서치 스킬: 생산 프로세스 및 구성 최적화","es":"Investigación profunda con OpenAI Codex","fr":"Recherche approfondie avec OpenAI Codex","de":"Tiefere Recherche mit OpenAI Codex","pt":"Deep Research: Automatize Sua Pesqui