ge avec Screenly","Accès à l''API Screenly pour le développement","Tutoriels pour les développeurs d''applications Edge","Intégration avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","Développement d''applications Edge avec React et Node.js"],"de":["Beispiele für Edge-Apps mit Screenly","Zugriff auf die Screenly-API für die Entwicklung","Anleitungen für Entwickler von Edge-Apps","Integration mit KI-Tools","Entwicklung von Edge-Apps mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["Exemplos de uso da Screenly","Integração com API","Desenvolvimento de soluções de edge","Uso de ferramentas de IA","Criação de aplicativos inovadores"],"ru":["Примеры использования Screenly","Интеграция с API","Разработка решений Edge","Использование ИИ Агентов","Создание инновационных приложений"],"ar":["أمثلة على استخدام Screenly","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تنمية حلول Edge","استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء تطبيقات مبتكرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Create An Edge App","Screenly","Screenly API","边缘应用开发","React开发","Node.js开发","CLI工具","Python开发","AI智能代理"],"ja":["Create An Edge App","Screenly","Screenly API","エッジアプリ開発","React開発","Node.js開発","CLIツール","Python開発","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Create An Edge App","Screenly","Screenly API","에지 애플리케이션 개발","React開発","Node.js開発","CLI도구","Python開発","AI에이전트"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de aplicaciones de Edge","Screenly API","alternativas a Screenly","Screenly vs otros","instalación de Screenly","guía de configuración de Screenly","cómo usar Screenly","qué es la creación de aplicaciones de Edge"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''applications Edge","API Screenly","alternatives à Screenly","Screenly vs autres","installation de Screenly","guide de configuration de Screenly","comment utiliser Screenly","qu''est-ce que la création d''applications Edge"],"de":["KI-Tools","Entwicklung von Edge-Apps","Screenly-API","Alternativen zu Screenly","Screenly vs andere","Installation von Screenly","Konfigurationsanleitung für Screenly","wie man Screenly verwendet","was ist die Erstellung von Edge-Apps"],"pt":["como usar Screenly","o que é edge computing","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para Screenly","guia de instalação da Screenly","Screenly vs outras ferramentas","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de edge","uso de API para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Screenly","что такое эдж-компьютинг","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","альтернативы Screenly","руководство по установке Screenly","Screenly vs другие инструменты","разработка приложений Edge","использование API для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Screenly","ما هو الحوسبة الحجرية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل Screenly","دليل تثبيت Screenly","Screenly مقابل أدوات أخرى","تنمية تطبيقات Edge","استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للمطورين"]}},"owner":"Screenly","repo":"Playground","repoPath":"Screenly/Playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-an-edge-app","description":"The recommended way to create an Edge App","bodyPreview":"# Creating an Edge App\n\n## When Creating an Edge App\n\n- Scaffold the new Edge App using the `bun create` template from inside the `edge-apps/` directory:\n  ```bash\n  bun create edge-app-template --no-git <app-name>\n  ```\n  - The app name should follow the `kebab-case` naming convention.\n- After scaffolding, add an `id` field to `screenly.yml` and `screenly_qc.yml` before running `bun run dev`.\n- **Consult Figma designs** before starting implementation.\n  - Ensure the [Figma MCP server](https://m","body":"# Creating an Edge App\n\n## When Creating an Edge App\n\n- Scaffold the new Edge App using the `bun create` template from inside the `edge-apps/` directory:\n  ```bash\n  bun create edge-app-template --no-git <app-name>\n  ```\n  - The app name should follow the `kebab-case` naming convention.\n- After scaffolding, add an `id` field to `screenly.yml` and `screenly_qc.yml` before running `bun run dev`.\n- **Consult Figma designs** before starting implementation.\n  - Ensure the [Figma MCP server](https://mcp.figma.com/mcp) is set up in Claude Code.\n  - Use the Figma MCP server to access design specifications, mockups, and UI requirements.\n  - Extract design tokens such as colors, spacing, typography, and component specifications from Figma.\n  - Ensure the implementation matches the approved designs in Figma before proceeding with development.\n\n## Reference Apps\n\nFor reference on more complex implementations, consult:\n\n- QR Code (`edge-apps/qr-code/`) — simple, low-footprint example\n- Menu Board (`edge-apps/menu-board/`) — more complex layout\n- CAP Alerting (`edge-apps/cap-alerting/`) — advanced settings and data fetching\n\nAll apps depend on the `@screenly/edge-apps` library (`workspace:../edge-apps-library`) and use `edge-apps-scripts` for tooling.\n\n### About the Manifest Files\n\n- Add any app-specific settings under the `settings` key, sorted alphabetically.\n- More information about manifest files can be found in the [Edge Apps documentation in the `Screenly/cli` repository](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Screenly/cli/refs/heads/master/docs/EdgeApps.md).\n\n### About `index.html`\n\n- Organize HTML code into templates and Web Components as the app grows in complexity.\n- Use HTML content templates first for simpler structures.\n- Consider using Web Components for more complex UI components that require encapsulation and reusability.\n\n### About `README.md`\n\n- Include instructions on how to create, build, test, format, lint, and deploy the app.\n- Do not add details like the directory structure, as the code frequently changes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:40.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Edge App Developers needing streamlined application scaffolding and Screenly API integration.","zh":"非常适合需要简化应用程序脚手架和Screenly API集成的Edge App开发人员。","ja":"Edge App開発者がアプリケーションのスキャフォールディングを簡素化し、Screenly APIを統合する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Edge App 개발자가 애플리케이션 스캐폴딩을 간소화하고 Screenly API를 통합해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de aplicaciones de Edge que necesitan una creación de aplicaciones estructuradas y una integración con la API de Screenly.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''applications Edge ayant besoin d''une création d''applications rationalisée et d''une intégration à l''API Screenly.","de":"Perfekt für Edge-App-Entwickler, die eine strukturierte Anwendungsskelettierung und eine Integration in die Screenly-API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de aplicativos Edge que precisam de estrutura de aplicativos simplificada e integração com a API da Screenly.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков приложений Edge, которым необходима упрощенная структура приложений и интеграция с API Screenly.","ar":"المثالي لمطوري تطبيقات Edge الذين يحتاجون إلى هيكلة تطبيق مبسطة وتكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Screenly."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold new Edge Apps using the `bun create` template, integrate with Screenly''s API, and consult Figma designs for implementation, utilizing kebab-case naming conventions and `screenly.yml` configurations.","zh":"赋予代理人使用`bun create`模板创建新的Edge Apps、集成Screenly的API并参考Figma设计以实现，利用kebab-case命名约定和`screenly.yml`配置。","ja":"`bun create`テンプレートを使用して新しいEdge Appsを作成し、ScreenlyのAPIを統合し、Figmaデザインを参照して実装することができるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、kebab-case命名規則と`screenly.yml`構成を使用します。","ko":"새로운 Edge Apps를 `bun create` 템플릿을 사용하여 생성하고, Screenly의 API를 통합하고, Figma 디자인을 참조하여 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하며, kebab-case命名 규칙과 `screenly.yml` 구성을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos Edge Apps utilizando la plantilla `bun create`, integrarse con la API de Screenly y consultar diseños de Figma para la implementación, utilizando convenciones de nomenclatura en kebab-case y configuraciones de `screenly.yml`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouvelles applications Edge en utilisant le modèle `bun create`, d''intégrer avec l''API Screenly et de consulter les conceptions Figma pour la mise en œuvre, en utilisant des conventions de dénomination en kebab-case et des configurations `screenly.yml`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Edge-Apps mit der Vorlage `bun create` zu erstellen, sich in die Screenly-API zu integrieren und Figma-Entwürfe für die Implementierung zu konsultieren, unter Verwendung von Kebab-Case-Namenskonventionen und `screenly.yml`-Konfigurationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos aplicativos Edge usando o modelo de `bun create`, integrar com a API da Screenly e consultar projetos do Figma para implementação, utilizando convenções de nomenclatura em kebab-case e configurações de `screenly.yml`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые приложения Edge с помощью шаблона `bun create`, интегрироваться с API Screenly и консультироваться с проектами Figma для реализации, используя соглашения об именовании в kebab-case и конфигурации `screenly.yml`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات Edge جديدة باستخدام قالب `bun create` ، وتكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Screenly ، والاستشارة إلى التصاميم الفيجية لتنفيذها ، باستخدام اتفاقيات تسمية الحالة الكبаб وضبطات `screenly.yml`."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Edge Apps with `bun create`","Configuring Screenly API integrations","Implementing Figma designs in Edge App development"],"zh":["使用`bun create`创建新的Edge Apps","配置Screenly API集成","在Edge App开发中实现Figma设计"],"ja":["`bun create`を使用して新しいEdge Appsを作成する","Screenly APIの統合を設定する","Edge App開発でFigmaデザインを実装する"],"ko":["`bun create`를 사용하여 새로운 Edge Apps를 생성하는 것","Screenly API 통합을 설정하는 것","Edge App 개발에서 Figma 디자인을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevos Edge Apps con `bun create`","Configuración de integraciones de la API de Screenly","Implementación de diseños de Figma en el desarrollo de aplicaciones Edge"],"fr":["Création de nouvelles applications Edge avec `bun create`","Configuration des intégrations de l''API Screenly","Mise en œuvre des conceptions Figma dans le développement d''applications Edge"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Edge-Apps mit `bun create`","Konfiguration von Screenly-API-Integrationen","Implementierung von Figma-Entwürfen in der Edge-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Criação de novos aplicativos Edge com `bun create`","Configuração de integrações com a API da Screenly","Implementação de projetos do Figma no desenvolvimento de aplicativos Edge"],"ru":["Создание новых приложений Edge с помощью `bun create`","Настройка интеграций с API Screenly","Реализация проектов Figma в разработке приложений Edge"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات Edge جديدة مع `bun create`","ضبط تكاملات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Screenly","تنفيذ التصاميم الفيجية في تطوير تطبيقات Edge"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `bun` installation","Must follow kebab-case naming convention","Needs access to Screenly API and Figma designs"],"zh":["需要`bun`安装","必须遵循kebab-case命名约定","需要访问Screenly API和Figma设计"],"ja":["`bun`のインストールが必要","kebab-case命名規則に従う必要がある","Screenly APIとFigmaデザインへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["`bun` 설치가 필요하다","kebab-case命名 규칙을 따라야 한다","Screenly API와 Figma 디자인에 접근할 수 있어야 한다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de `bun`","Debe seguir la convención de nomenclatura en kebab-case","Necesita acceso a la API de Screenly y a los diseños de Figma"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de `bun`","Doit suivre la convention de dénomination en kebab-case","Nécessite l''accès à l''API Screenly et aux conceptions Figma"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von `bun`","Muss der Kebab-Case-Namenskonvention folgen","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Screenly-API und Figma-Entwürfe"],"pt":["Exige instalação de `bun`","Deve seguir convenção de nomenclatura em kebab-case","Necessita acesso à API da Screenly e aos projetos do Figma"],"ru":["Требует установки `bun`","Должно следовать соглашению об именовании в kebab-case","Требует доступа к API Screenly и проектам Figma"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت `bun`","يجب اتباع اتفاقية تسمية الحالة الكبаб","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Screenly والتصاميم الفيجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1cefe8a16e7489b368893c63be6be98e7eb8d2dea595ee6ae193c68ad4d045cd","qualityScore":31}');
