ription":{"zh":"rspank-sftrace是一种快速的Rust基于JavaScript打包器，兼容webpack API，能够提升开发效率","ja":"rspank-sftraceは高速のRustベースのJavaScriptバンドラーで、webpack APIと互換性があります","ko":"rspank-sftrace는 빠른 러스트 기반 자바스크립트 번들러로 웹팩 API와 호환됩니다","es":"rspack-sftrace es un empaquetador de JavaScript rápido basado en Rust con API compatible con webpack","fr":"rspack-sftrace est un bundleur JavaScript rapide basé sur Rust avec API compatible avec webpack","de":"rspack-sftrace ist ein schneller JavaScript-Bundler basierend auf Rust mit webpack-kompatibler API","pt":"Rspack-SFTrace é um empacotador JavaScript rápido baseado em Rust com API compatível com Webpack.","ru":"Rspack-SFTrace - быстрый JavaScript бандлер на основе Rust с API, совместимым с Webpack.","ar":"Rspack-SFTrace هو حزمة JavaScript سريع مبني على Rust مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Webpack.","en":"The fast Rust-based JavaScript bundler with webpack-compatible API 🦀️"},"definition":{"en":"The fast Rust-based JavaScript bundler with webpack-compatible API 🦀️"},"features":{"zh":["快速的Rust基于JavaScript打包","兼容webpack API","提升开发效率","支持多种JavaScript框架","易于使用和配置"],"ja":["高速のRustベースのJavaScriptバンドリング","webpack APIと互換性","開発効率の向上","複数のJavaScriptフレームワークをサポート","使用と設定が容易"],"ko":["빠른 러스트 기반 자바스크립트 번들링","웹팩 API와 호환성","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 자바스크립트 프레임워크 지원","사용과 설정이 간단"],"es":["Empaquetador de JavaScript rápido","API compatible con webpack","Basado en Rust","Mejora del rendimiento","Compatibilidad con módulos ES"],"fr":["Bundleur JavaScript rapide","API compatible avec webpack","Basé sur Rust","Amélioration des performances","Compatibilité avec les modules ES"],"de":["Schneller JavaScript-Bundler","API kompatibel mit webpack","Basierend auf Rust","Leistungsverbesserung","Kompatibilität mit ES-Modulen"],"pt":["Empacotador JavaScript rápido baseado em Rust","API compatível com Webpack","Suporte a módulos ES","Minificação e compactação de código","Suporte a plugins"],"ru":["Быстрый JavaScript бандлер на основе Rust","API, совместимый с Webpack","Поддержка модулей ES","Минификация и сжатие кода","Поддержка плагинов"],"ar":["حزمة JavaScript سريع مبني على Rust","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Webpack","دعم وحدات ES","تحسين وتقليل حجم الكود","دعم البرامج المساعدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用rspank-sftrace","什么是rspank-sftrace","rspank-sftrace替代品","rspank-sftrace和webpack的区别","rspank-sftrace安装","rspank-sftrace设置指南","JavaScript打包工具","Rust基于JavaScript打包器"],"ja":["rspank-sftraceの使い方","rspank-sftraceとは","rspank-sftraceの代替","rspank-sftraceとwebpackの違い","rspank-sftraceのインストール","rspank-sftraceの設定ガイド","JavaScriptバンドルツール","RustベースのJavaScriptバンドラー"],"ko":["rspank-sftrace 사용법","rspank-sftrace是什么","rspank-sftrace 대체","rspank-sftrace와 웹팩의 차이","rspank-sftrace 설치","rspank-sftrace 설정 가이드","자바스크립트 번들링 도구","러스트 기반 자바스크립트 번들러"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cómo usar rspack-sftrace","empaquetador de JavaScript rápido","alternativas a webpack","rspack-sftrace vs webpack","instalación de rspack-sftrace","guía de configuración de rspack-sftrace"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","comment utiliser rspack-sftrace","bundleur JavaScript rapide","alternatives à webpack","rspack-sftrace vs webpack","installation de rspack-sftrace","guide de configuration de rspack-sftrace"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man rspack-sftrace verwendet","schneller JavaScript-Bundler","Alternativen zu webpack","rspack-sftrace vs webpack","Installation von rspack-sftrace","Konfigurationsanleitung für rspack-sftrace"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","empacotador javascript","webpack","rust","como usar rspack-sftrace","alternativas ao webpack","rspack-sftrace vs webpack"],"ru":["ии агенты","инструменты для сборки javascript","webpack","rust","как использовать rspack-sftrace","альтернативы webpack","rspack-sftrace vs webpack"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تجميع JavaScript","webpack","rust","كيفية استخدام rspack-sftrace","بديل ل-webpack","rspack-sftrace مقابل webpack"]}},"owner":"web-infra-dev","repo":"rspack","repoPath":"web-infra-dev/rspack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rspack-sftrace","description":"Use sftrace, which is based on LLVM Xray instrumentation, to trace all Rust function calls. This can be used for performance analysis and troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# Rspack Sftrace\n\n## Overview\n\nUse sftrace (LLVM XRay) to trace rspack''s Rust function calls and convert them to perfetto protobuf format for performance analysis and troubleshooting.\n\nDefault workflow: run inside the target example directory (for example `examples/react`) and store all trace artifacts in that directory (not `/tmp`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Build sftrace tools\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/quininer/sftrace\ncd sftrace\ncargo build --release\nmkdir \"$(./target/release/sftrace rec","body":"# Rspack Sftrace\n\n## Overview\n\nUse sftrace (LLVM XRay) to trace rspack''s Rust function calls and convert them to perfetto protobuf format for performance analysis and troubleshooting.\n\nDefault workflow: run inside the target example directory (for example `examples/react`) and store all trace artifacts in that directory (not `/tmp`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Build sftrace tools\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/quininer/sftrace\ncd sftrace\ncargo build --release\nmkdir \"$(./target/release/sftrace record --print-solib-install-dir)\"\ncp ./target/release/libsftrace.so \"$(./target/release/sftrace record --print-solib-install-dir)/\"\n```\n\n### 2) Build sftrace-enabled profiling binding (once per code change)\n\n```sh\nSFTRACE=1 pnpm build:binding:profiling\n```\n\n### 3) Optional: Generate a filter file from symbols\n\n`sftrace filter` works on function symbols from an object file (for rspack, the binding `.node` file).\n\n```sh\n# Enter the target example directory first\ncd examples/react\n\n# Prefer the locally built profiling binding from the monorepo\nBINDING_NODE=\"$(realpath ../../crates/node_binding/rspack.linux-x64-gnu.node)\"\n\n# Regex mode\nsftrace filter -p \"$BINDING_NODE\" -r ''finish_modules|FlagDependencyExportsPlugin'' -o sftrace.filter\n\n# List mode (one regex per line)\n# sftrace filter -p \"$BINDING_NODE\" --list symbols.list -o sftrace.filter\n```\n\nIf your binding file name differs by platform, replace the `.node` path accordingly.\n\n### 4) Record sftrace (example: build in `examples/react`)\n\nRun from the target example directory and keep outputs local to that example.\n\n```sh\ncd examples/react\n\nTRACE_DIR=\"sftrace-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\"\nmkdir -p \"$TRACE_DIR\"\n\n# Full trace\nsftrace record -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.log\" -- pnpm build\n\n# Filtered trace (requires sftrace.filter from step 3)\nsftrace record -f sftrace.filter -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.log\" -- pnpm build\n```\n\n### 5) Analyze sf.log\n\nConvert sftrace log to perfetto protobuf format.\n\n```sh\ncd examples/react\nTRACE_DIR=\"sftrace-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS\" # replace with your run directory\nsftrace convert \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.log\" -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.pb.gz\"\n```\n\n### 6) Optional: Visualization using [viztracer](https://github.com/gaogaotiantian/viztracer)\n\n```sh\nvizviewer --use_external_processor \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.pb.gz\"\n```\n\nUse this only for visualization.\n\n## Filtering Notes\n\n- `sftrace filter` matches function symbols by regex/list. It is not a first-class crate-path/module-path filter.\n- Filtering does not automatically keep all descendants. If a child function symbol does not match your filter, it may disappear from the trace.\n- Cross-thread relationships (for example via rayon) are not reconstructed as a single uninterrupted call chain.\n- For complete call stacks, record without filter (or with a broad filter) and narrow down during analysis.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:12.223Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced Rust-based JavaScript bundling and tracing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级基于Rust的JavaScript打包和跟踪功能的性能优化代理。","ja":"パフォーマンス最適化エージェントが高度なRustベースのJavaScriptバンドルとトレース機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Rust 기반의 JavaScript 번들링 및 추적 기능이 필요한 성능 최적화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que necesitan capacidades de empaquetado y trazado avanzadas basadas en Rust para JavaScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation des performances nécessitant des capacités de regroupement et de traçage avancées basées sur Rust pour JavaScript.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungs-Optimierungs-Agents, die erweiterte Rust-basierte JavaScript-Bündel- und Verfolgungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de empacotamento e rastreamento baseados em Rust para JavaScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации производительности, которым необходимы расширенные возможности упаковки и отслеживания на основе Rust для JavaScript.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحسّنين للأداء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحزيم وتبعية JavaScript بالإعتماد على Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trace rspack''s Rust function calls using sftrace (LLVM XRay) and convert them to perfetto protobuf format for performance analysis and troubleshooting, leveraging webpack-compatible API and Rust-based efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪rspamk的Rust函数调用使用sftrace（LLVM XRay）并将其转换为perfetto protobuf格式以进行性能分析和故障排除，利用webpack兼容的API和Rust基于的效率。","ja":"エージェントに、sftrace（LLVM XRay）を使用してrspamkのRust関数呼び出しをトレースし、パフォーマンス分析およびトラブルシューティングのためにperfetto protobuf形式に変換する機能を提供し、webpack互換のAPIおよびRustベースの効率性を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 sftrace（LLVM XRay）를 사용하여 rspack의 Rust 함수 호출을 추적하고 성능 분석 및 문제 해결을 위해 perfetto protobuf 형식으로 변환할 수 있도록 강화하고, webpack 호환 API 및 Rust 기반 효율성을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear las llamadas a funciones de Rust de rspack utilizando sftrace (LLVM XRay) y convertirlas al formato de protocolo de datos perfetto para análisis y depuración de rendimiento, aprovechando la API compatible con webpack y la eficiencia basada en Rust.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traçer les appels de fonction Rust de rspack en utilisant sftrace (LLVM XRay) et de les convertir au format de protocole de données perfetto pour l''analyse et la résolution des problèmes de performances, en exploitant l''API compatible avec webpack et l''efficacité basée sur Rust.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, rspacks Rust-Funktionaufrufe mithilfe von sftrace (LLVM XRay) zu verfolgen und in das perfetto-Protobuf-Format für Leistungsanalyse und Fehlerbehebung umzuwandeln, indem es die webpack-kompatible API und die Rust-basierte Effizienz nutzt.","pt":"Habilita agentes a rastrear chamadas de funções Rust do rspack usando sftrace (LLVM XRay) e convertê-las para formato perfetto protobuf para análise e solução de problemas de desempenho, aproveitando API compatível com webpack e eficiência baseada em Rust.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать вызовы функций Rust в rspack с помощью sftrace (LLVM XRay) и преобразовывать их в формат perfetto protobuf для анализа производительности и устранения неполадок, используя API, совместимый с webpack, и эффективность на основе Rust.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تتبع نداءات دالة الرست من rspack باستخدام sftrace (LLVM XRay) وتحويلها إلى تنسيق بروتوكول perfetto لتحليل الأداء ومعالجة المشاكل، مستفيداً من واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع webpack والكفاءة المعتمدة على الرست."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracing rspack''s Rust function calls for performance bottlenecks","Converting trace artifacts to perfetto protobuf format for visualization","Debugging JavaScript bundling issues with sftrace and rspack"],"zh":["跟踪rspamk的Rust函数调用以查找性能瓶颈","将跟踪工件转换为perfetto protobuf格式以进行可视化","使用sftrace和rspamk调试JavaScript打包问题"],"ja":["パフォーマンスのボトルネックを特定するためにrspamkのRust関数呼び出しをトレースする","トレース成果物をperfetto protobuf形式に変換して視覚化する","sftraceとrspamkを使用してJavaScriptバンドル問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["성능 병목 현상을 찾기 위해 rspack의 Rust 함수 호출을 추적하는 것","추적 아티팩트를 perfetto protobuf 형식으로 변환하여 시각화하는 것","sftrace와 rspack를 사용하여 JavaScript 번들링 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Rastrear las llamadas a funciones de Rust de rspack para identificar cuellos de botella de rendimiento","Convertir artefactos de trazado al formato de protocolo de datos perfetto para visualización","Depurar problemas de empaquetado de JavaScript con sftrace y rspack"],"fr":["Traçer les appels de fonction Rust de rspack pour identifier les goulets d''étranglement des performances","Convertir les artefacts de traçage au format de protocole de données perfetto pour la visualisation","Déboguer les problèmes de regroupement de JavaScript avec sftrace et rspack"],"de":["Rspacks Rust-Funktionaufrufe zur Identifizierung von Leistungsengpässen verfolgen","Verfolgungsartefakte in das perfetto-Protobuf-Format für die Visualisierung umwandeln","JavaScript-Bündelungsprobleme mit sftrace und rspack debuggen"],"pt":["Rastrear chamadas de funções Rust do rspack para gargalos de desempenho","Converter artefatos de rastreamento para formato perfetto protobuf para visualização","Depurar problemas de empacotamento JavaScript com sftrace e rspack"],"ru":["Отслеживать вызовы функций Rust в rspack для узких мест производительности","Преобразовывать артефакты отслеживания в формат perfetto protobuf для визуализации","Отлаживать проблемы упаковки JavaScript с помощью sftrace и rspack"],"ar":["تتبع نداءات دالة الرست من rspack لضيق نطاق الأداء","تحويل مكونات التتبع إلى تنسيق بروتوكول perfetto للتصوير","تصحيح مشاكل تحزيم JavaScript باستخدام sftrace و rspack"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and LLVM XRay installation","Limited to tracing rspack''s Rust function calls","Stores trace artifacts in the target example directory"],"zh":["需要安装Rust和LLVM XRay","仅限于跟踪rspamk的Rust函数调用","将跟踪工件存储在目标示例目录中"],"ja":["RustおよびLLVM XRayのインストールが必要","rspamkのRust関数呼び出しのトレースのみに限定される","トレース成果物を対象の例ディレクトリに保存する"],"ko":["Rust 및 LLVM XRay 설치가 필요함","rspamk의 Rust 함수 호출 추적만으로 제한됨","추적 아티팩트를 대상 예제 디렉토리에 저장함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Rust y LLVM XRay","Limitado a la trazado de las llamadas a funciones de Rust de rspack","Almacena los artefactos de trazado en el directorio de ejemplo de destino"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Rust et de LLVM XRay","Limité à la traçage des appels de fonction Rust de rspack","Stocke les artefacts de traçage dans le répertoire d''exemple cible"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Rust und LLVM XRay","Begrenzt auf die Verfolgung von rspacks Rust-Funktionaufrufen","Speichert die Verfolgungsartefakte im Zielbeispielverzeichnis"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Rust e LLVM XRay","Limitado ao rastreamento de chamadas de funções Rust do rspack","Armazena artefatos de rastreamento no diretório de exemplo de destino"],"ru":["Требует установки Rust и LLVM XRay","Ограничен отслеживанием вызовов функций Rust в rspack","Хранит артефакты отслеживания в целевом примере каталога"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت الرست و LLVM XRay","محدود بتتبع نداءات دالة الرست من rspack","يخزن مكونات التتبع في دليل المثال المستهدف"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3d86205c8082a7879d0388747c81ff4faadfe365d96b14feaa03490809f508ca","qualityScore":31}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wevm/wagmi/wagmi-development', 'community', 'wevm', 'wagmi', 'wevm/wagmi', 'wagmi-development', 0, 0, 31, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z', '2026-03-02T02:26:13.136Z', '8b7190836badca89cbf5c0714ccc3c71c9813869dd2c2af50e75d961c58ded51', '{"id":"wevm/wagmi/wagmi-development","name":"wagmi-development","description":{"zh":"Wagmi开发提供Reactive primitives，用于构建强大的以太坊应用，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"Wagmi開発は、強力なEthereumアプリを構築するためのReactive primitivesを提供し、開発者の生産性を向上させます","ko":"Wagmi 개발은 강력한 이더리움 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 사용되는 Reactive primitives를 제공하여 개발자의 생산성을 향상합니다","es":"wagmi es un conjunto de primitivos reactivos para aplicaciones Ethereum, diseñado para mejorar la experiencia del desarrollador.","fr":"wagmi est un ensemble de primitives réactives pour les applications Ethereum, conçu pour améliorer l''expérience du développeur.","de":"wagmi ist eine Sammlung von reaktiven Primitiven für Ethereum-Apps, entwickelt um die Erfahrung des Entwicklers zu verbessern.","pt":"O desenvolvimento wagmi fornece primitivos reativos para aplicações Ethereum, permitindo a criação de soluções escaláveis e eficientes.","ru":"Разработка приложений Ethereum с помощью примитивов wagmi обеспечивает создание реактивных и масштабируемых решений.","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات Ethereum باستخدام примитивات wagmi يوفر حلولاً مت phảnسنة وفعّالة","en":"Reactive primitives for Ethereum apps"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能开发工具 - Wagmi开发","ja":"AIエージェント - Wagmi開発","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Wagmi 개발","es":"Herramientas de wagmi para desarrolladores","fr":"Outils de développement wagmi pour les applications Ethereum","de":"wagmi-Entwicklungstools für Ethereum-Apps","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Desenvolvimento wagmi para Ethereum","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Примитивы для приложений Ethereum с wagmi","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: تطوير wagmi لتطبيقات Ethereum","en":"wagmi-development"},"description":{"zh":"Wagmi开发提供Reactive primitives，用于构建强大的以太坊应用，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"Wagmi開発は、強力なEthereumアプリを構築するためのReactive primitivesを提供し、開発者の生産性を向上させます","ko":"Wagmi 개발은 강력한 이더리움 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 사용되는 Reactive primitives를 제공하여 개발자의 생산성을 향상합니다","es":"wagmi es un conjunto de primitivos reactivos para aplicaciones Ethereum, diseñado para mejorar la experiencia del desarrollador.","fr":"wagmi est un ensemble de primitives réactives pour les applications Ethereum, conçu pour améliorer l''expérience du développeur.","de":"wagmi ist eine Sammlung von reaktiven Primitiven für Ethereum-Apps, entwickelt um die Erfahrung des Entwicklers zu verbessern.","pt":"O desenvolvimento wagmi fornece primitivos reativos para aplicações Ethereum, permitindo a criação de soluções escaláveis e eficientes.","ru":"Разработка приложений Ethereum с помощью примитивов wagmi обеспечивает создание реактивных и масштабируемых решений.","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات Ethereum باستخدام примитивات wagmi يوفر حلولاً مت phảnسنة وفعّالة","en":"Reactive primitives for Ethereum apps"},"definition":{"en":"Reactive primitives for Ethereum apps"},"features":{"zh":["提供Reactive primitives","用于构建强大的以太坊应用","提高开发者效率","支持Ethereum开发","提供灵活的开发选项"],"ja":["Reactive primitivesを提供","強力なEthereumアプリを構築","開発者の生産性を向上","Ethereum開発をサポート","柔軟な開発オプションを提供"],"ko":["Reactive primitives 제공","강력한 이더리움 애플리케이션 구축","개발자의 생산성 향상","이더리움 개발 지원","유연한 개발 옵션 제공"],"es":["Primitivos reactivos para aplicaciones Ethereum","Mejora de la experiencia del desarrollador","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Primitives réactives pour les applications Ethereum","Amélioration de l''expérience du développeur","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Support pour plusieurs plateformes","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Reaktive Primitiven für Ethereum-Apps","Verbesserung der Erfahrung des Entwicklers","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Primitivos reativos para aplicações Ethereum","Desenvolvimento de soluções escaláveis","Integração com ferramentas de IA","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento","Documentação e suporte técnico"],"ru":["Реактивные примитивы для приложений Ethereum","Разработка масштабируемых решений","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ Агентов","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки","Документация и техническая поддержка"],"ar":["بريمتيفات تفاعلية لتطبيقات Ethereum","تطوير حلول مت phảnسنة","تكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم لعدة بيئات تطوير","توثيق ودعم فني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Wagmi开发","Reactive primitives","以太坊应用开发","AI智能开发工具","如何使用Wagmi","Wagmi安装","Wagmi开发指南"],"ja":["Wagmi開発","Reactive primitives","Ethereumアプリ開発","AIエージェント","Wagmiの使い方","Wagmiインストール","Wagmi開発ガイド"],"ko":["Wagmi 개발","Reactive primitives","이더리움 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트","Wagmi 사용법","Wagmi 설치","Wagmi 개발 가이드"],"es":["wagmi","desarrollo de aplicaciones Ethereum","herramientas de desarrollo","primitivos reactivos","mejora de la experiencia del desarrollador","cómo usar wagmi","alternativas a wagmi","guía de instalación de wagmi"],"fr":["wagmi","développement d''applications Ethereum","outils de développement","primitives réactives","amélioration de l''expérience du développeur","comment utiliser wagmi","alternatives à wagmi","guide d''installation de wagmi"],"de":["wagmi","Entwicklung von Ethereum-Apps","Entwicklungstools","reaktive Primitiven","Verbesserung der Erfahrung des Entwicklers","wie man wagmi verwendet","Alternativen zu wagmi","Installationsanleitung für wagmi"],"pt":["como usar wagmi","o que é wagmi","wagmi vs web3","instalar wagmi","guia de configuração wagmi","desenvolvimento de aplicações Ethereum","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento","primitivos reativos para Ethereum"],"ru":["как использовать wagmi","что такое wagmi","wagmi vs web3","установить wagmi","руководство по настройке wagmi","разработка приложений Ethereum","инструменты ИИ Агентов для разработки","реактивные примитивы для Ethereum"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام wagmi","ما هو wagmi","wagmi vs web3","تثبيت wagmi","دليل إعداد wagmi","تطوير تطبيقات Ethereum","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير","بريمتيفات تفاعلية لتطبيقات Ethereum"]}},"owner":"wevm","repo":"wagmi","repoPath":"wevm/wagmi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.920Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wagmi-development","description":"Creates Wagmi features across all layers - core actions, query options, framework bindings. Use when adding new actions, hooks, or working across packages/core, packages/react, packages/vue.","bodyPreview":"# Wagmi Development\n\nFull-stack patterns for adding Wagmi features. This skill covers Viem-based actions only (not Wagmi config actions).\n\n## Layer Overview\n\n1. **Core Action** (`packages/core/src/actions/`) - Base functionality wrapping Viem\n2. **Query Options** (`packages/core/src/query/`) - TanStack Query integration\n3. **Framework Bindings** - React (`packages/react/src/hooks/`), Vue (`packages/vue/src/composables/`)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Action\n\n### Structure\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  type MyActionError","body":"# Wagmi Development\n\nFull-stack patterns for adding Wagmi features. This skill covers Viem-based actions only (not Wagmi config actions).\n\n## Layer Overview\n\n1. **Core Action** (`packages/core/src/actions/`) - Base functionality wrapping Viem\n2. **Query Options** (`packages/core/src/query/`) - TanStack Query integration\n3. **Framework Bindings** - React (`packages/react/src/hooks/`), Vue (`packages/vue/src/composables/`)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Core Action\n\n### Structure\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  type MyActionErrorType as viem_MyActionErrorType,\n  type MyActionParameters as viem_MyActionParameters,\n  type MyActionReturnType as viem_MyActionReturnType,\n  myAction as viem_myAction,\n} from ''viem/actions''\n\nimport type { Config } from ''../createConfig.js''\nimport type { ChainIdParameter, ConnectorParameter } from ''../types/properties.js''\nimport type { Compute } from ''../types/utils.js''\nimport { getAction } from ''../utils/getAction.js''\n\nexport type MyActionParameters<config extends Config = Config> = Compute<\n  ChainIdParameter<config> & viem_MyActionParameters\n>\n\nexport type MyActionReturnType = viem_MyActionReturnType\n\nexport type MyActionErrorType = viem_MyActionErrorType\n\n/** https://wagmi.sh/core/api/actions/myAction */\nexport async function myAction<config extends Config>(\n  config: config,\n  parameters: MyActionParameters<config>,\n): Promise<MyActionReturnType> {\n  const { chainId, ...rest } = parameters\n  const client = config.getClient({ chainId })\n  const action = getAction(client, viem_myAction, ''myAction'')\n  return action(rest)\n}\n```\n\n### Key Rules\n\n- **Viem imports**: Prefix with `viem_` (e.g., `viem_getBalance`)\n- **Client access**: \n  - Read-only: `config.getClient({ chainId })`\n  - Wallet: `await getConnectorClient(config, { chainId, connector, account })`\n  - Mixed: Use `getConnectorClient` for account, `getClient` for action (see `estimateGas.ts`)\n- **Parameters**: Add `ChainIdParameter<config>` always. Add `ConnectorParameter` for wallet actions.\n- **Type params**: Mirror Viem''s type params for inference. Use `const` modifier for literal inference (abi, args).\n- **Spread**: Omit wagmi-specific props (`chainId`, `connector`) when calling Viem action.\n\n### Testing\n\n**Runtime tests** (`action.test.ts`):\n```ts\nimport { abi, address, config } from ''@wagmi/test''\nimport { expect, test } from ''vitest''\nimport { myAction } from ''./myAction.js''\n\ntest(''default'', async () => {\n  await expect(myAction(config, { /* required params */ })).resolves.toMatchInlineSnapshot(`...`)\n})\n\ntest(''parameters: chainId'', async () => { /* test chainId param */ })\n\ntest(''behavior: error case'', async () => { /* test error handling */ })\n```\n\n**Type tests** (`action.test-d.ts`) - only if action has type inference:\n```ts\nimport { config } from ''@wagmi/test''\nimport { expectTypeOf, test } from ''vitest''\nimport { myAction } from ''./myAction.js''\n\ntest(''default'', async () => {\n  const result = await myAction(config, { /* params */ })\n  expectTypeOf(result).toEqualTypeOf<ExpectedType>()\n})\n```\n\n**Type benchmarks** (`action.bench-d.ts`) - only if action has type inference:\n```ts\nimport { attest } from ''@ark/attest''\nimport { test } from ''vitest''\nimport type { MyActionParameters } from ''./myAction.js''\n\ntest(''default'', () => {\n  type Result = MyActionParameters<typeof abi.erc20, ''balanceOf''>\n  const res = {} as Result\n  attest.instantiations([12345, ''instantiations''])\n  attest(res.args).type.toString.snap(`readonly [account: \\`0x\\${string}\\`]`)\n})\n```\n\n**Wallet action tests**: Connect before, disconnect after:\n```ts\ntest(''default'', async () => {\n  await connect(config, { connector })\n  await expect(myAction(config, { /* params */ })).resolves.toMatchInlineSnapshot(`...`)\n  await disconnect(config, { connector })\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Query Options\n\nQuery (read-only) or Mutation (wallet) options for TanStack Query.\n\n### Query Structure\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  type MyActionErrorType,\n  type MyActionParameters,\n  type MyActionReturnType,\n  myAction,\n} from ''../actions/myAction.js''\nimport type { Config } from ''../createConfig.js''\nimport type { ScopeKeyParameter } from ''../types/properties.js''\nimport type { QueryOptions, QueryParameter } from ''../types/query.js''\nimport type { Compute, ExactPartial } from ''../types/utils.js''\nimport { filterQueryOptions, structuralSharing } from ''./utils.js''\n\nexport type MyActionOptions<\n  config extends Config,\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n> = Compute<ExactPartial<MyActionParameters<config>> & ScopeKeyParameter> &\n  QueryParameter<MyActionQueryFnData, MyActionErrorType, selectData, MyActionQueryKey<config>>\n\nexport function myActionQueryOptions<\n  config extends Config,\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n>(\n  config: config,\n  options: MyActionOptions<config, selectData> = {},\n): MyActionQueryOptions<config, selectData> {\n  return {\n    ...options.query,\n    enabled: Boolean(options.requiredParam && (options.query?.enabled ?? true)),\n    queryFn: async (context) => {\n      const [, { scopeKey: _, ...parameters }] = context.queryKey\n      if (!parameters.requiredParam) throw new Error(''requiredParam is required'')\n      const result = await myAction(config, {\n        ...(parameters as MyActionParameters),\n        requiredParam: parameters.requiredParam,\n      })\n      return result ?? null\n    },\n    queryKey: myActionQueryKey(options),\n    structuralSharing, // include when returning complex objects/arrays\n  }\n}\n\nexport type MyActionQueryFnData = Compute<MyActionReturnType>\nexport type MyActionData = MyActionQueryFnData\n\nexport function myActionQueryKey<config extends Config>(\n  options: Compute<ExactPartial<MyActionParameters<config>> & ScopeKeyParameter> = {},\n) {\n  return [''myAction'', filterQueryOptions(options)] as const\n}\n\nexport type MyActionQueryKey<config extends Config> = ReturnType<typeof myActionQueryKey<config>>\n\nexport type MyActionQueryOptions<\n  config extends Config,\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n> = QueryOptions<MyActionQueryFnData, MyActionErrorType, selectData, MyActionQueryKey<config>>\n```\n\n### Mutation Structure\n\n```ts\nimport type { MutationOptions, MutationParameter } from ''../types/query.js''\n\nexport type MyActionOptions<config extends Config, context = unknown> = MutationParameter<\n  MyActionData,\n  MyActionErrorType,\n  MyActionVariables<config>,\n  context\n>\n\nexport function myActionMutationOptions<config extends Config, context>(\n  config: config,\n  options: MyActionOptions<config, context> = {},\n): MyActionMutationOptions<config> {\n  return {\n    ...options.mutation,\n    mutationFn: async (variables) => {\n      return myAction(config, variables)\n    },\n    mutationKey: [''myAction''],\n  }\n}\n\nexport type MyActionMutationOptions<config extends Config> = MutationOptions<\n  MyActionData,\n  MyActionErrorType,\n  MyActionVariables<config>\n>\n```\n\n### Key Rules\n\n- **ExactPartial vs UnionExactPartial**: Use `ExactPartial` for simple types, `UnionExactPartial` for complex unions (contract actions)\n- **enabled**: Based on required params being truthy\n- **structuralSharing**: Include when action returns objects/arrays\n- **filterQueryOptions**: Filters common non-serializable props. Skip props like `onReplaced` manually in query key.\n- **Query key**: Always `[''actionName'', filterQueryOptions(options)]`\n\n### Testing\n\n```ts\nimport { config } from ''@wagmi/test''\nimport { expect, test } from ''vitest''\nimport { myActionQueryOptions } from ''./myAction.js''\n\ntest(''default'', () => {\n  expect(myActionQueryOptions(config, {})).toMatchInlineSnapshot(`\n    {\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"queryFn\": [Function],\n      \"queryKey\": [\"myAction\", {}],\n    }\n  `)\n})\n\ntest(''enabled'', () => {\n  expect(myActionQueryOptions(config, { requiredParam: ''value'' }).enabled).toBe(true)\n})\n\ntest(''queryFn: calls query fn'', async () => {\n  const options = myActionQueryOptions(config, { requiredParam: ''value'' })\n  const result = await options.queryFn({ queryKey: options.queryKey } as any)\n  expect(result).toMatchInlineSnapshot(`...`)\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Framework Bindings\n\n### React Query Hook\n\n```ts\n''use client''\nimport type { Config, MyActionErrorType, ResolvedRegister } from ''@wagmi/core''\nimport type { Compute } from ''@wagmi/core/internal''\nimport {\n  type MyActionData,\n  type MyActionOptions,\n  myActionQueryOptions,\n} from ''@wagmi/core/query''\nimport type { ConfigParameter } from ''../types/properties.js''\nimport { type UseQueryReturnType, useQuery } from ''../utils/query.js''\nimport { useChainId } from ''./useChainId.js''\nimport { useConfig } from ''./useConfig.js''\n\nexport type UseMyActionParameters<\n  config extends Config = Config,\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n> = Compute<MyActionOptions<config, selectData> & ConfigParameter<config>>\n\nexport type UseMyActionReturnType<selectData = MyActionData> =\n  UseQueryReturnType<selectData, MyActionErrorType>\n\n/** https://wagmi.sh/react/api/hooks/useMyAction */\nexport function useMyAction<\n  config extends Config = ResolvedRegister[''config''],\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n>(\n  parameters: UseMyActionParameters<config, selectData> = {},\n): UseMyActionReturnType<selectData> {\n  const config = useConfig(parameters)\n  const chainId = useChainId({ config })\n  const options = myActionQueryOptions(config, {\n    ...parameters,\n    chainId: parameters.chainId ?? chainId,\n    query: parameters.query,\n  })\n  return useQuery(options)\n}\n```\n\n### React Mutation Hook\n\n```ts\n''use client''\nimport { useMutation } from ''@tanstack/react-query''\nimport type { Config, ResolvedRegister, MyActionErrorType } from ''@wagmi/core''\nimport {\n  type MyActionData,\n  type MyActionMutate,\n  type MyActionMutateAsync,\n  type MyActionOptions,\n  type MyActionVariables,\n  myActionMutationOptions,\n} from ''@wagmi/core/query''\nimport type { ConfigParameter } from ''../types/properties.js''\nimport type { UseMutationReturnType } from ''../utils/query.js''\nimport { useConfig } from ''./useConfig.js''\n\nexport type UseMyActionParameters<config extends Config = Config, context = unknown> =\n  MyActionOptions<config, context> & ConfigParameter<config>\n\nexport type UseMyActionReturnType<config extends Config = Config, context = unknown> =\n  UseMutationReturnType<\n    MyActionData,\n    MyActionErrorType,\n    MyActionVariables<config>,\n    context,\n    MyActionMutate<config, context>,\n    MyActionMutateAsync<config, context>\n  >\n\n/** https://wagmi.sh/react/api/hooks/useMyAction */\nexport function useMyAction<\n  config extends Config = ResolvedRegister[''config''],\n  context = unknown,\n>(\n  parameters: UseMyActionParameters<config, context> = {},\n): UseMyActionReturnType<config, context> {\n  const config = useConfig(parameters)\n  const options = myActionMutationOptions(config, parameters)\n  const mutation = useMutation(options)\n  type Return = UseMyActionReturnType<config, context>\n  return {\n    ...mutation,\n    mutate: mutation.mutate as Return[''mutate''],\n    mutateAsync: mutation.mutateAsync as Return[''mutateAsync''],\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Vue Composable (Query)\n\n```ts\nimport type { Config, MyActionErrorType, ResolvedRegister } from ''@wagmi/core''\nimport type { Compute } from ''@wagmi/core/internal''\nimport {\n  type MyActionData,\n  type MyActionOptions,\n  myActionQueryOptions,\n} from ''@wagmi/core/query''\nimport { computed } from ''vue''\nimport type { ConfigParameter } from ''../types/properties.js''\nimport type { DeepMaybeRef } from ''../types/ref.js''\nimport { deepUnref } from ''../utils/cloneDeep.js''\nimport { type UseQueryReturnType, useQuery } from ''../utils/query.js''\nimport { useChainId } from ''./useChainId.js''\nimport { useConfig } from ''./useConfig.js''\n\nexport type UseMyActionParameters<\n  config extends Config = Config,\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n> = Compute<DeepMaybeRef<MyActionOptions<config, selectData> & ConfigParameter<config>>>\n\nexport type UseMyActionReturnType<selectData = MyActionData> =\n  UseQueryReturnType<selectData, MyActionErrorType>\n\n/** https://wagmi.sh/vue/api/composables/useMyAction */\nexport function useMyAction<\n  config extends Config = ResolvedRegister[''config''],\n  selectData = MyActionData,\n>(\n  parameters: UseMyActionParameters<config, selectData> = {},\n): UseMyActionReturnType<selectData> {\n  const params = computed(() => deepUnref(parameters))\n  const config = useConfig(params)\n  const chainId = useChainId({ config })\n  const options = computed(() =>\n    myActionQueryOptions(config as any, {\n      ...params.value,\n      chainId: params.value.chainId ?? chainId.value,\n      query: params.value.query,\n    }),\n  )\n  return useQuery(options as any) as any\n}\n```\n\n### Framework Rules\n\n| Rule | React | Vue |\n|------|-------|-----|\n| Top directive | `''use client''` | None |\n| Parameters wrapper | `Compute<...>` | `Compute<DeepMaybeRef<...>>` |\n| Reactivity | Direct | `computed()` + `deepUnref()` |\n| Doc URL | `wagmi.sh/react/api/hooks/` | `wagmi.sh/vue/api/composables/` |\n\n**Shared rules:**\n- `ResolvedRegister[''config'']`: Use in function signature only, not type defs\n- No `enabled`/`structuralSharing` in hooks: Handled by queryOptions\n\n### Testing\n\n**Query hook test-d.ts**:\n```ts\nimport { abi } from ''@wagmi/test''\nimport { expectTypeOf, test } from ''vitest''\nimport { useMyAction } from ''./useMyAction.js''\n\ntest(''select data'', () => {\n  const result = useMyAction({\n    /* params */\n    query: {\n      select(data) {\n        expectTypeOf(data).toEqualTypeOf<ExpectedDataType>()\n        return data\n      },\n    },\n  })\n  expectTypeOf(result.data).toEqualTypeOf<ExpectedDataType>()\n})\n```\n\n**Mutation hook test-d.ts**:\n```ts\nimport { expectTypeOf, test } from ''vitest''\nimport { useMyAction } from ''./useMyAction.js''\n\ntest(''context'', () => {\n  const { mutate } = useMyAction({\n    mutation: {\n      onMutate(variables) {\n        expectTypeOf(variables).toMatchTypeOf<{ /* expected shape */ }>()\n        return { foo: ''bar'' }\n      },\n      onError(error, variables, context) { /* test types */ },\n      onSuccess(data, variables, context) { /* test types */ },\n      onSettled(data, error, variables, context) { /* test types */ },\n    },\n  })\n\n  mutate({ /* params */ }, {\n    onSuccess(data, variables, context) { /* test inference */ },\n  })\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Exports\n\nAdd to `exports/index.ts` in respective package:\n\n```ts\n// packages/core/src/exports/index.ts\nexport {\n  type MyActionParameters,\n  type MyActionReturnType,\n  type MyActionErrorType,\n  myAction,\n} from ''../actions/myAction.js''\n\n// packages/core/src/exports/query.ts\nexport {\n  type MyActionData,\n  type MyActionOptions,\n  type MyActionQueryFnData,\n  type MyActionQueryKey,\n  type MyActionQueryOptions,\n  myActionQueryKey,\n  myActionQueryOptions,\n} from ''../query/myAction.js''\n\n// packages/react/src/exports/index.ts\nexport {\n  type UseMyActionParameters,\n  type UseMyActionReturnType,\n  useMyAction,\n} from ''../hooks/useMyAction.js''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\n# Format\npnpm format\n\n# Type check (all or filtered)\npnpm check:types\npnpm --filter @wagmi/core check:types\npnpm --filter wagmi check:types\n\n# Test (all or filtered)\npnpm test\npnpm test --project core\npnpm test --project react\n\n# Update test snapshots\npnpm vitest -u\n\n# Type benchmarks\npnpm bench:types\n\n# Viem version mismatch in test snapshots\npnpm version:update:viem\n\n# Build (all or filtered)\npnpm run clean && pnpm build\npnpm --filter @wagmi/core build\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:13.136Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack AI Agents needing advanced Ethereum app development capabilities with Wagmi.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Wagmi进行高级Ethereum应用开发的全栈AI代理","ja":"Wagmiを使用した高级なEthereumアプリケーション開発が必要なフルスタックAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Wagmi를 사용하여 고급 Ethereum 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 풀스택 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial de Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de aplicaciones Ethereum avanzadas con Wagmi.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Full-Stack ayant besoin de capacités de développement d''applications Ethereum avancées avec Wagmi.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-KI-Agenten, die erweiterte Ethereum-App-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit Wagmi benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Full-Stack que precisam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de aplicativos Ethereum com Wagmi.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки приложений Ethereum с помощью Wagmi.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين متعددة الطبقات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير تطبيقات Ethereum مع Wagmi."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build reactive primitives for Ethereum apps using Wagmi, integrating TanStack Query for robust data fetching and providing framework bindings for React and Vue.","zh":"赋予代理使用Wagmi构建Ethereum应用的反应性原语的能力，集成了TanStack Query进行强大的数据获取，并为React和Vue提供框架绑定","ja":"Wagmiを使用してEthereumアプリケーションのリアクティブなプリミティブを構築するエージェントの能力を提供し、TanStack Queryを統合してデータ取得を強化し、ReactとVue向けのフレームワークバインディングを提供","ko":"Wagmi를 사용하여 Ethereum 애플리케이션의 반응형 원시 값을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, TanStack Query를 통합하여 데이터 가져오기를 강화하며, React 및 Vue를 위한 프레임워크 바인딩을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir primitivas reactivas para aplicaciones Ethereum utilizando Wagmi, integrando TanStack Query para una recopilación de datos robusta y proporcionando enlaces de framework para React y Vue.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des primitives réactives pour les applications Ethereum en utilisant Wagmi, en intégrant TanStack Query pour une récupération de données robuste et en fournissant des liaisons de framework pour React et Vue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, reaktive Primitive für Ethereum-Apps mit Wagmi zu erstellen, indem es TanStack Query für robuste Datenabruf und Framework-Bindings für React und Vue integriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir primitivos reativos para aplicativos Ethereum usando Wagmi, integrando TanStack Query para busca de dados robusta e fornecendo vinculações de framework para React e Vue.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать реактивные примитивы для приложений Ethereum с помощью Wagmi, интегрируя TanStack Query для надежной загрузки данных и предоставляя привязки фреймворка для React и Vue.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء البريميتيفات التفاعلية لتطبيقات Ethereum باستخدام Wagmi، وتكامل TanStack Query للبحث عن البيانات بشكل قوي وتوفير ربط الإ