le pero poderoso para desarrolladores","fr":"Ship est un cadre d''évaluation de code simple mais puissant pour les développeurs","de":"Ship ist ein einfaches aber leistungsstarkes Bewertungsframework für Entwickler","pt":"O ship é um framework de avaliação de código simples mas poderoso para desenvolvedores, permitindo uma abordagem code-first","ru":"Ship - это простая но мощная оценочная платформа для разработчиков, предлагающая code-first подход","ar":"ship هو إطار تقييم код بسيط وقوي لمنشئي التطبيقات، يسمح بمقاربة code-first","en":"Simple but powerful code-first eval framework"},"definition":{"en":"Simple but powerful code-first eval framework"},"features":{"zh":["代码优先评估","快速评估和改进代码","支持多种编程语言","简单易用","提高开发效率"],"ja":["コードファースト評価","コードの迅速な評価と改善","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート","シンプルで使いやすい","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["코드 우선 평가","코드의 빠른 평가와 개선","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원","간단하고 사용하기 쉬움","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Marco de evaluación de código ligero","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Ejecución de código eficiente","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Cadre d''évaluation de code léger","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Exécution de code efficace","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Leichtes Bewertungsframework","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Effiziente Code-Ausführung","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Abordagem code-first","Estrutura de avaliação de código simples","Suporte a linguagens de programação múltiplas","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Execução de código eficiente"],"ru":["Code-first подход","Простая оценочная платформа","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Эффективный запуск кода"],"ar":["مقاربة code-first","إطار تقييم رمز بسيط","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير شائعة","تشغيل رمز فعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 ship","什么是代码优先评估","ship 替代品","ship 与其他工具的比较","ship 安装","ship 设置指南","代码评估框架","开发工具"],"ja":["ship の使い方","コードファースト評価とは","ship の代替","ship と他のツールの比較","ship のインストール","ship の設定ガイド","コード評価フレームワーク","開発ツール"],"ko":["ship 사용법","코드 우선 평가란","ship 대체品","ship과 다른 도구의 비교","ship 설치","ship 설정 가이드","코드 평가 프레임워크","개발 도구"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","framework de evaluación de código","cómo usar Ship","Ship alternativa","Ship vs otros frameworks","instalación de Ship","guía de configuración de Ship"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","cadre d''évaluation de code","comment utiliser Ship","alternative à Ship","Ship vs autres cadres","installation de Ship","guide de configuration de Ship"],"de":["KI-Tools","Bewertungsframework","wie man Ship verwendet","Ship-Alternative","Ship vs andere Frameworks","Ship-Installation","Ship-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["como usar ship","o que é ship","ship vs outras ferramentas","instalar ship","guia de configuração do ship","desenvolvimento de software com ship","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","ship para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ship","что такое ship","ship vs другие инструменты","установить ship","руководство по настройке ship","разработка программного обеспечения с ship","инструменты ии для разработчиков","ship для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ship","ما هو ship","ship مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ship","دليل إعداد ship","تطوير البرمجيات مع ship","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمنشئي التطبيقات","ship لمنشئي التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"camronh","repo":"EZVals","repoPath":"camronh/EZVals","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.923Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ship","description":"Ship dev to main. Creates a release with version bump, changelog, and tag.","bodyPreview":"Follow these steps in order:\n\n## 1. Confirm on Dev\n\n- Verify we''re on the `dev` branch\n- If not, stop and ask\n\n## 2. Run Tests\n\n- Run tests and ensure all tests pass. (Use `-n auto` to run tests in parallel)\n- If tests fail, STOP and report the failures\n\n## 3. Version Bump\n\n- Read `docs/changelog.mdx` to see what''s in the `## Unreleased` section\n- Suggest the next version (based on existing versions in the changelog)\n- Update `docs/changelog.mdx`: change `## Unreleased` to `## <version> - <today","body":"Follow these steps in order:\n\n## 1. Confirm on Dev\n\n- Verify we''re on the `dev` branch\n- If not, stop and ask\n\n## 2. Run Tests\n\n- Run tests and ensure all tests pass. (Use `-n auto` to run tests in parallel)\n- If tests fail, STOP and report the failures\n\n## 3. Version Bump\n\n- Read `docs/changelog.mdx` to see what''s in the `## Unreleased` section\n- Suggest the next version (based on existing versions in the changelog)\n- Update `docs/changelog.mdx`: change `## Unreleased` to `## <version> - <today''s date>`\n- Update `pyproject.toml` version to match\n- Run `uv lock` to sync the lock file with the new version\n- Summarize the changes for this version in a human friendly way. Focus on impactful changes and user facing changes.\n\n## 4. Update Skill Version\n\n- Update the version comment in `ezvals/skills/evals/SKILL.md` (the `<!-- Version: X.X.X -->` line) to match the release version\n- The skill version **MUST** match the release tag — the Sync Skill to Marketplace workflow will fail otherwise\n\n## 5. Commit & Push Dev\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"release <version>\"\ngit push origin dev\n```\n\n## 6. Merge to Main\n\n```bash\ngit checkout main\ngit pull origin main\ngit merge dev\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## 7. Tag & Push\n\n```bash\ngit tag v<version>\ngit push origin v<version>\n```\n\n## 8. Return to Dev\n\n```bash\ngit checkout dev\n```\n\n## PyPI Publishing (Automatic)\n\nPublishing to PyPI is handled automatically by GitHub Actions:\n\n- **Dev builds** (`.github/workflows/publish-dev.yml`): Every push to `main` publishes a dev version (`0.0.0.dev{timestamp}`) to PyPI\n- **Release builds** (`.github/workflows/publish.yml`): Pushing a tag like `v0.1.0` triggers a release publish to PyPI\n\nYou don''t need to manually run `uv publish` - just push the tag and the workflow handles it.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If tests fail → stop and report\n- If merge conflicts occur → stop and ask for help\n- If not on dev → stop and ask\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:31.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Management Agents requiring streamlined versioning and testing workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要简化版本控制和测试工作流程的代码管理Agent。","ja":"バージョン管理とテストワークフローを効率化する必要があるコード管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"간소화된 버전 관리 및 테스트 워크플로우가 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Código que requieren flujos de trabajo de control de versiones y pruebas optimizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Code nécessitant des flux de travail de versioning et de tests rationalisés.","de":"Ideal für Code Management Agents, die optimierte Versionierungs- und Test-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que exigem fluxos de trabalho de versionamento e teste simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов управления кодом, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов управления версиями и тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة التعليمات البرمجية الذين يتطلبون تبسيط سير عمل إدارة الإصدارات والاختبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate testing, version bumping, and changelog updates using a code-first eval framework, leveraging parallel testing with `-n auto` and semantic versioning.","zh":"赋能Agent使用代码优先的评估框架自动化测试、版本升级和更新日志更新，利用`-n auto`进行并行测试和语义化版本控制。","ja":"コードファーストの評価フレームワークを活用し、`-n auto`を使用した並列テストとセマンティックバージョニングにより、エージェントがテストの自動化、バージョンのバンプ、変更履歴の更新を自動化できるようにします。","ko":"코드 중심 평가 프레임워크를 활용하여 `-n auto`로 병렬 테스트와 시맨틱 버저닝을 사용해 테스트 자동화, 버전 범핑 및 변경 로그 업데이트를 자동화하여 에이전트의 능력을 확장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las pruebas, el incremento de versiones y las actualizaciones del registro de cambios utilizando un framework de evaluación code-first, aprovechando las pruebas en paralelo con `-n auto` y el versionado semántico.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests, l''incrémentation des versions et les mises à jour du journal des modifications en utilisant un framework d''évaluation code-first, tirant parti des tests parallèles avec `-n auto` et du versioning sémantique.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tests, Version Bumping und Changelog-Updates mit einem code-first eval Framework zu automatisieren, unter Nutzung von Parallel-Testing mit `-n auto` und Semantic Versioning.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar testes, atualizações de versão e atualizações de changelog usando uma estrutura de avaliação code-first, aproveitando testes paralelos com `-n auto` e versionamento semântico.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать тестирование, обновление версий и обновления журнала изменений с использованием code-first фреймворка оценки, используя параллельное тестирование с `-n auto` и семантическое версионирование.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أتمتة الاختبار، وزيادة رقم الإصدار، وتحديثات سجل التغييرات باستخدام إطار تقييم code-first، والاستفادة من الاختبار المتوازي باستخدام `-n auto` وإدارة الإصدارات الدلالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test suites with parallel execution","Generating and updating changelogs based on unreleased features","Versioning codebases with semantic versioning guidelines"],"zh":["使用并行执行自动化测试套件","基于未发布功能生成和更新更新日志","使用语义化版本控制指南对代码库进行版本控制"],"ja":["並列実行によるテストスイートの自動化","未リリース機能に基づく変更履歴の生成と更新","セマンティックバージョニングガイドラインによるコードベースのバージョン管理"],"ko":["병렬 실행으로 테스트 스위트 자동화","출시되지 않은 기능을 기반으로 변경 로그 생성 및 업데이트","시맨틱 버저닝 가이드라인으로 코드베이스 버전 관리"],"es":["Automatización de suites de pruebas con ejecución en paralelo","Generación y actualización de registros de cambios basados en características no publicadas","Versionado de bases de código con pautas de versionado semántico"],"fr":["Automatisation des suites de tests avec exécution parallèle","Génération et mise à jour des journaux de modifications basés sur des fonctionnalités non publiées","Versioning des codebases avec les directives de versioning sémantique"],"de":["Automatisierung von Test-Suites mit paralleler Ausführung","Generierung und Aktualisierung von Changelogs basierend auf unveröffentlichten Features","Versionierung von Codebases nach Semantic Versioning Richtlinien"],"pt":["Automatização de conjuntos de testes com execução paralela","Geração e atualização de changelogs com base em funcionalidades não lançadas","Versionamento de bases de código com diretrizes de versionamento semântico"],"ru":["Автоматизация наборов тестов с параллельным выполнением","Создание и обновление журналов изменений на основе невыпущенных функций","Версионирование кодовых баз с использованием руководств по семантическому версионированию"],"ar":["أتمتة مجموعات الاختبار مع التنفيذ المتوازي","إنشاء وتحديث سجلات التغيير بناءً على الميزات غير المطلقة","إصدار قواعد التعليمات البرمجية باستخدام إرشادات إدارة الإصدارات الدلالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git branch management","Needs access to `docs/changelog.mdx` file","Assumes existing test suite setup"],"zh":["需要Git分支管理","需要访问`docs/changelog.mdx`文件","假定已存在测试套件设置"],"ja":["Gitブランチ管理が必要","`docs/changelog.mdx`ファイルへのアクセスが必要","既存のテストスイートの設定が前提"],"ko":["Git 브랜치 관리 필요","`docs/changelog.mdx` 파일에 대한 액세스 필요","기존 테스트 스위트 설정 가정"],"es":["Requiere gestión de ramas de Git","Necesita acceso al archivo `docs/changelog.mdx`","Presume una configuración existente de la suite de pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite une gestion des branches Git","Requiert l''accès au fichier `docs/changelog.mdx`","Suppose une configuration existente de la suite de tests"],"de":["Erfordert Git Branch Management","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei `docs/changelog.mdx`","Setzt eine bestehende Test-Suite Einrichtung voraus"],"pt":["Requer gerenciamento de ramificações do Git","Necessita de acesso ao arquivo `docs/changelog.mdx`","Assume uma configuração existente de conjunto de testes"],"ru":["Требует управления ветками Git","Требует доступа к файлу `docs/changelog.mdx`","Предполагает наличие существующей настройки набора тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب إدارة فروع Git","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى ملف `docs/changelog.mdx`","يفترض وجود إعداد مجموعة اختبار موجود"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"11c68aa150254e53d13d2475e7f8848d9616762b6d352f2d19c821620a6834a7","qualityScore":31}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Nivl/melvin.la/i18n-translation', 'community', 'Nivl', 'melvin.la', 'Nivl/melvin.la', 'i18n-translation', 0, 0, 31, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.931Z', '2026-03-02T02:31:03.835Z', '6ad321b822d3b409d22fc0743bc8aa107ddd5abd668834d7b8a249ac7b4122c6', '{"id":"Nivl/melvin.la/i18n-translation","name":"i18n-translation","description":{"zh":"i18n-translation是网站国际化的关键技术，本文介绍其来源和应用","ja":"i18n-translationはWebサイトの国際化に不可欠な技術です","ko":"i18n-translation은 웹사이트 국제화를 위한 핵심 기술입니다","es":"i18n-translation es una habilidad de agente de inteligencia artificial que permite la traducción de sitios web","fr":"i18n-translation est une compétence d''agent d''intelligence artificielle qui permet la traduction de sites web","de":"i18n-translation ist eine Fähigkeit von künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten, die die Übersetzung von Webseiten ermöglicht","pt":"As ferramentas de tradução i18n são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de aplicações globais. Elas permitem que os desenvolvedores criem soluções personalizadas para diferentes regiões e idiomas.","ru":"ИИ Агенты для международной транскрипции являются важнейшим инструментом для разработки глобальных приложений. Они позволяют разработчикам создавать индивидуальные решения для различных регионов и языков.","ar":"أدوات الترجمة i18n هي أدوات أساسية لتطوير التطبيقات العالمية. تمكن المطورين من إنشاء حلول مخصصة للمناطق واللغات المختلفة.","en":"Sources of my website."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理_i18n-translation工具","ja":"AIエージェント_i18n-translationソリューション","ko":"AI 에이전트_i18n-translation 개발 도구","es":"Herramientas de Traducción i18n para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils de Traduction i18n pour Développeurs","de":"i18n-Übersetzungs-Tools für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de Tradução i18n para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Международной Транскрипции","ar":"أدوات الترجمة i18n للبرمجة","en":"i18n-translation"},"description":{"zh":"i18n-translation是网站国际化的关键技术，本文介绍其来源和应用","ja":"i18n-translationはWebサイトの国際化に不可欠な技術です","ko":"i18n-translation은 웹사이트 국제화를 위한 핵심 기술입니다","es":"i18n-translation es una habilidad de agente de inteligencia artificial que permite la traducción de sitios web","fr":"i18n-translation est une compétence d''agent d''intelligence artificielle qui permet la traduction de sites web","de":"i18n-translation ist eine Fähigkeit von künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten, die die Übersetzung von Webseiten ermöglicht","pt":"As ferramentas de tradução i18n são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de aplicações globais. Elas permitem que os desenvolvedores criem soluções personaliz...","ru":"ИИ Агенты для международной транскрипции являются важнейшим инструментом для разработки глобальных приложений. Они позволяют разработчикам создавать индивиду...","ar":"أدوات الترجمة i18n هي أدوات أساسية لتطوير التطبيقات العالمية. تمكن المطورين من إنشاء حلول مخصصة للمناطق واللغات المختلفة.","en":"Sources of my website."},"definition":{"en":"Sources of my website."},"features":{"zh":["支持多语言翻译","自动适配不同语言环境","提高网站国际化水平","增强用户体验","简化开发流程"],"ja":["多言語翻訳をサポート","自動的に異なる言語環境に適応","Webサイトの国際化レベルを向上","ユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化","開発プロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["다중 언어翻訳 지원","自動으로 다른 언어 환경에 적응","웹사이트 국제화 수준 향상","사용자 경험 강화","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Compatibilidad con múltiples idiomas","Integración con sitios web y aplicaciones","Soporte para formatos de archivo de traducción","Facilidad de uso y configuración","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec de multiples langues","Intégration avec les sites web et les applications","Prise en charge des formats de fichiers de traduction","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js"],"de":["Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen","Integration mit Webseiten und Anwendungen","Unterstützung für Übersetzungsdateiformate","Einfache Bedienung und Konfiguration","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Personalização de regiões","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Ferramentas de tradução CLI","Compatibilidade com diferentes formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Поддержка нескольких языков","Настройка регионов","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Инструменты транскрипции CLI","Совместимость с различными форматами файлов"],"ar":["دعم اللغات المتعددة","تخصيص المناطق","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","أدوات الترجمة CLI","التوافق مع صيغ الملفات المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用i18n-translation","什么是i18n-translation","i18n-translation工具","i18n-translation与国际化","i18n-translation开发指南","i18n-translation安装教程"],"ja":["AIエージェントとは","i18n-translationの使い方","i18n-translationツール","i18n-translationと国際化","i18n-translation開発ガイド","i18n-translationインストール方法"],"ko":["AI 에이전트란","i18n-translation 사용 방법","i18n-translation 개발 도구","i18n-translation과 국제화","i18n-translation 개발 가이드","i18n-translation 설치 방법"],"es":["i18n-translation","herramientas de traducción","traducción de sitios web","agente de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de aplicaciones","react i18n","node js i18n","cómo usar i18n-translation","alternativas a i18n-translation"],"fr":["i18n-translation","outils de traduction","traduction de sites web","agent d''intelligence artificielle","développement d''applications","react i18n","node js i18n","comment utiliser i18n-translation","alternatives à i18n-translation"],"de":["i18n-translation","übersetzungs-tools","webseiten-übersetzung","künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","anwendungs-entwicklung","react i18n","node js i18n","wie man i18n-translation verwendet","alternativen zu i18n-translation"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de tradução i18n","o que é tradução i18n","ferramentas de tradução i18n para react","ferramentas de tradução i18n vs google translate","instalação de ferramentas de tradução i18n","guia de configuração de ferramentas de tradução i18n"],"ru":["как использовать инструменты международной транскрипции","что такое международная транскрипция","инструменты транскрипции для react","инструменты транскрипции vs google translate","установка инструментов транскрипции","руководство по настройке инструментов транскрипции"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الترجمة i18n","ما هي الترجمة i18n","أدوات الترجمة i18n لرياكت","أدوات الترجمة i18n مقابل جوجل ترجمة","تثبيت أدوات الترجمة i18n","دليل إعداد أدوات الترجمة i18n"]}},"owner":"Nivl","repo":"melvin.la","repoPath":"Nivl/melvin.la","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.931Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"i18n-translation","description":"Translate the Next.js web application to different languages using next-intl. Use this skill when the user requests to add a new language, translate content to an existing locale, update translation strings, fix missing translations, or work with internationalization (i18n) features including locale configuration, message files, and blog content translation.","bodyPreview":"# i18n Translation Skill\n\nTranslate the Next.js web application to different languages using `next-intl`.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/\n├── src/\n│   ├── i18n/\n│   │   ├── locales.ts           # Locale definitions and types\n│   │   ├── request.ts           # next-intl request configuration\n│   │   └── routing.ts           # Routing configuration\n│   ├── app/\n│   │   └── [locale]/            # Locale-based routes\n│   │       └── layout.tsx       # Layout with font configuration\n│   └── bundled_s","body":"# i18n Translation Skill\n\nTranslate the Next.js web application to different languages using `next-intl`.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/\n├── src/\n│   ├── i18n/\n│   │   ├── locales.ts           # Locale definitions and types\n│   │   ├── request.ts           # next-intl request configuration\n│   │   └── routing.ts           # Routing configuration\n│   ├── app/\n│   │   └── [locale]/            # Locale-based routes\n│   │       └── layout.tsx       # Layout with font configuration\n│   └── bundled_static/\n│       └── content/blog/        # Blog content by article and locale\n│           └── [article]/\n│               ├── en.mdx\n│               ├── fr.mdx\n│               └── ...\n└── messages/\n    ├── en.json                  # English (source of truth)\n    ├── en.d.json.ts             # TypeScript definitions\n    ├── fr.json                  # French translations\n    ├── es.json                  # Spanish translations\n    ├── ja.json                  # Japanese translations\n    ├── ko.json                  # Korean translations\n    ├── zh.json                  # Chinese Simplified translations\n    └── zh-tw.json               # Chinese Traditional translations\n```\n\n## Supported Locales\n\nCurrent supported locales are defined in `src/i18n/locales.ts`:\n- `en` - English (source of truth)\n- `fr` - French\n- `es` - Spanish\n- `ja` - Japanese\n- `ko` - Korean\n- `zh` - Chinese Simplified\n- `zh-tw` - Chinese Traditional\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Adding a New Locale\n\nFollow these steps to add a new language to the application:\n\n1. **Update locale definitions** in `src/i18n/locales.ts`:\n   - Add the new locale code to the `locales` array\n   - Example: `export const locales = [''en'', ''fr'', ''es'', ''ko'', ''zh'', ''zh-tw'', ''ja''] as const;`\n\n2. **Add language to LanguageSwitcher** in `src/components/layout/NavBar/LanguageSwitcher.tsx`:\n   - Add a new entry to the `languages` array with the locale key, native language label, and `isAI` flag\n   - **CRITICAL**: Set `isAI: true` for all AI-generated translations (all new languages added via this skill)\n   - **CRITICAL**: The `languages` array MUST be ordered alphabetically by the `key` field (locale code)\n   - Example:\n     ```typescript\n     {\n       key: ''ja'',\n       label: ''日本語'',\n       isAI: true,\n     }\n     ```\n   - This adds an \"AI\" superscript indicator in the language dropdown to inform users the translation is AI-generated\n\n3. **Create message file** at `messages/[locale].json`:\n   - Copy the structure from `messages/en.json` (source of truth)\n   - Translate all strings to the target language\n   - Maintain the same JSON structure and key names\n\n4. **Translate blog content**:\n   - For each article in `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/`\n   - Create a new `[locale].mdx` file (e.g., `ja.mdx`)\n   - Translate the MDX content including frontmatter and body\n   - Keep frontmatter structure consistent (title, slug, excerpt, etc.)\n\n5. **Configure fonts** (if needed):\n   - Check if the language requires a specific Noto font (e.g., `Noto Sans JP` for Japanese)\n   - If needed, import the font in `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx`\n   - Add the font variable to `src/app/globals.css`\n   - Note: Latin-specific fonts (like Baikal) have dedicated variables (e.g., `--font-condensed-latin`) for design-specific usage\n\n6. **Update this skill documentation** (`.agents/skills/i18n-translation/SKILL.md`):\n   - Add the new locale to the \"Supported Locales\" section\n   - Maintain alphabetical order by locale code for consistency\n   - Example: `- ''ja'' - Japanese`\n\n7. **Restart development server** for changes to take effect\n\n### Translating Existing Strings\n\nTo translate strings that are already defined in English:\n\n1. **Locate the key** in `messages/en.json`\n2. **Find the same key** in the target locale file (e.g., `messages/fr.json`)\n3. **Translate the value** while preserving:\n   - JSON structure\n   - Key names\n   - Variable placeholders (e.g., `{count}`, `{name}`)\n   - HTML entities if present\n\n### Adding New Translation Strings\n\nWhen new UI text is added to the application:\n\n1. **Add to English source** (`messages/en.json`):\n   - Use nested keys for organization (e.g., `\"HomePage\": { \"title\": \"...\" }`)\n   - Choose clear, descriptive key names\n\n2. **Add to all other locale files**:\n   - Add the same key structure to every `messages/[locale].json`\n   - Translate the value appropriately for each language\n\n3. **Use in components**:\n   ```typescript\n   import { useTranslations } from ''next-intl'';\n   \n   export function MyComponent() {\n     const t = useTranslations(''HomePage'');\n     return <h1>{t(''title'')}</h1>;\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify consistency** using `pnpm i18n:check` command\n\n### Translating Blog Articles\n\nBlog articles are stored as MDX files organized by article and locale:\n\n1. **Navigate to** `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/`\n2. **Create or edit** the locale-specific MDX file (e.g., `fr.mdx`)\n3. **Translate frontmatter**:\n   ```yaml\n   ---\n   title: \"Titre de l''article\"\n   slug: \"slug-url\"\n   excerpt: \"Courte description\"\n   image: \"cover.avif\"\n   ogImage: \"cover.jpg\"\n   createdAt: \"2025-07-03\"\n   updatedAt: \"2025-07-03\"\n   ---\n   ```\n\n4. **Translate body content**:\n   - Translate all markdown content\n   - Keep code blocks and syntax intact\n   - Maintain heading structure and links\n\n5. **Restart dev server** after making changes for them to take effect\n\n### Fixing Missing Translations\n\nTo identify and fix missing translations:\n\n1. **Run consistency check**: `pnpm i18n:check`\n2. **Review errors** showing missing keys or locale files\n3. **Add missing translations** to the appropriate locale files\n4. **Ensure structure matches** `messages/en.json`\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Translation Quality\n\n- Maintain **natural phrasing** in the target language, not literal translations\n- Preserve **tone and voice** consistent with the brand\n- Keep **technical terms** consistent (e.g., \"API\", \"GitHub\")\n- Use **proper capitalization** and punctuation for the target language\n- Consider **cultural context** for idioms and expressions\n\n### JSON Structure\n\n- Always preserve the **nested key structure** from English\n- Use **double quotes** for JSON strings\n- Maintain **proper indentation** (2 spaces)\n- Keep keys in the **same order** as the English file for easier comparison\n- Do not include **comments** in JSON files\n\n### Font Configuration\n\n- Latin scripts (English, French, Spanish): Use default fonts\n- CJK languages (Chinese, Japanese, Korean): Configure Noto CJK fonts\n- Right-to-left languages (Arabic, Hebrew): Ensure RTL support is configured\n- Use `--font-condensed-latin` variable for design-specific Latin fonts regardless of locale\n\n### Blog Content\n\n- Translate **all frontmatter fields** except dates and image paths\n- Keep **slug values** in the target language for SEO\n- Maintain **markdown formatting** (headings, lists, links)\n- Preserve **code blocks** without translation\n- Keep **image paths** and **links** functional\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter making translation changes:\n\n1. Run linting: `pnpm run lint --fix`\n2. Check i18n consistency: `pnpm i18n:check`\n3. Run tests: `pnpm run test:unit`\n4. Restart dev server: `pnpm run dev`\n5. Verify changes in browser for each affected locale\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### Missing Translation Keys\n\n**Symptom**: Console warnings about missing translation keys  \n**Solution**: Add the missing key to all locale files with appropriate translations\n\n### Inconsistent JSON Structure\n\n**Symptom**: i18n:check fails with structure errors  \n**Solution**: Ensure all locale files have the same nested key structure as `en.json`\n\n### Blog Content Not Updating\n\n**Symptom**: Changes to MDX files not reflected in the app  \n**Solution**: Restart the development server (`pnpm run dev`)\n\n### Font Not Displaying Correctly\n\n**Symptom**: Characters appear with wrong font or as boxes  \n**Solution**: Verify the correct Noto font is imported and configured in `layout.tsx` and `globals.css`\n\n### Build Failures After Translation\n\n**Symptom**: Build fails with MDX processing errors  \n**Solution**: Check MDX frontmatter syntax and ensure all required fields are present\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands\n- `pnpm i18n:check` - Check translation consistency\n- `pnpm run dev` - Start dev server (restart after blog changes)\n- `pnpm run build` - Production build (validates all content)\n\n### File Locations\n- Locale definitions: `src/i18n/locales.ts`\n- Language switcher: `src/components/layout/NavBar/LanguageSwitcher.tsx`\n- Message files: `messages/[locale].json`\n- Blog content: `src/bundled_static/content/blog/[article]/[locale].mdx`\n- Font config: `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx` and `src/app/globals.css`\n\n### Key Patterns\n```typescript\n// In components\nconst t = useTranslations(''SectionName'');\nconst text = t(''keyName'');\n\n// Message structure\n{\n  \"SectionName\": {\n    \"keyName\": \"Translated text\"\n  }\n}\n\n// LanguageSwitcher entry for new locale\n{\n  key: ''ja'',           // Locale code (array MUST be sorted alphabetically by this key)\n  label: ''日本語'',      // Native language name\n  isAI: true,          // Always true for AI-generated translations\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:31:03.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multilingual Support Agents needing seamless Next.js web application translation using next-intl.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 next-intl 实现无缝多语言支持的 Next.js 网页应用程序翻译的多语言支持代理。","ja":"next-intl を使用して Next.js ウェブアプリケーションの無停止多言語対応を実現する必要があるマルチリンガルサポートエージェントに最適です。","ko":"next-intl을 사용하여 Next.js 웹 애플리케이션의 무중단 다국어 지원을实现해야 하는 다국어 지원 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de soporte multilingüe que necesitan una traducción sin problemas de aplicaciones web Next.js utilizando next-intl.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de support multilingues ayant besoin d''une traduction sans accroc des applications web Next.js en utilisant next-intl.","de":"Perfekt für multilinguale Supportagenten, die eine nahtlose Übersetzung von Next.js-Webanwendungen mit next-intl benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Suporte Multilíngue que precisam de tradução de aplicativos web Next.js sem interrupções usando next-intl.","ru":"Идеально для многоязычных агентов поддержки, которым требуется бесшовный перевод веб-приложений Next.js с помощью next-intl.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الدعم المتعددة اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى ترجمة تطبيقات الويب Next.js بسلاسة باستخدام next-intl."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate web applications into multiple languages using next-intl, providing locale definitions and routing configurations, and enabling locale-based routes with customized layouts.","zh":"赋予代理翻译网页应用程序到多种语言的能力，使用 next-intl 提供区域定义和路由配置，并启用基于区域的路由和自定义布局。","ja":"エージェントが next-intl を使用して、ロケール定義やルーティング設定を提供し、ロケールベースのルーティングとカスタマイズされたレイアウトを可能にすることで、Web アプリケーションを複数の言語に翻訳する機能を提供します。","ko":"next-intl을 사용하여 에이전트가 웹 애플리케이션을 여러 언어로 번역할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 지역 정의 및 라우팅 구성과 지역 기반 라우팅 및 사용자 지정 레이아웃을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir aplicaciones web a varios idiomas utilizando next-intl, proporcionando definiciones de locales y configuraciones de enrutamiento, y habilitando rutas basadas en locales con diseños personalizados.","fr":"Habilite les agents à traduire des applications Web dans plusieurs langues en utilisant next-intl, en fournissant des définitions de locale et des configurations de routage, et en activant les itinéraires basés sur les locales avec des mises en page personnalisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webanwendungen in mehrere Sprachen zu übersetzen, indem next-intl verwendet wird, um Locale-Definitionen und Routing-Konfigurationen bereitzustellen und Locale-basierte Routen mit benutzerdefinierten Layouts zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir aplicativos web para vários idiomas usando next-intl, fornecendo definições de localidade e configurações de roteamento, e habilitando rotas baseadas em localidade com layouts personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить веб-приложения на несколько языков с помощью next-intl, предоставляя определения местоположения и настройки маршрутизации, и ermöglicht маршруты на основе местоположения с настраиваемыми макетами.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ترجمة تطبيقات الويب إلى لغات متعددة باستخدام next-intl، وتوفير تعريفات الموقع وتكوين المسارات، وتمكين المسارات المعتمدة على الموقع مع تخطيطات مخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating Next.js web applications into different languages","Configuring locale-based routing for multilingual support","Implementing customized layouts for various locales"],"zh":["将 Next.js 网页应用程序翻译成不同的语言","为多语言支持配置基于区域的路由","为各种区域实现自定义布局"],"ja":["Next.js ウェブアプリケーションを異なる言語に翻訳する","マルチリンガル対応のためにロケールベースのルーティングを設定する","さまざまなロケールにカスタマイズされたレイアウトを実装する"],"ko":["Next.js 웹 애플리케이션을 다른 언어로 번역하는 것","다국어 지원을 위한 지역 기반 라우팅 구성","각 지역에 맞는 사용자 지정 레이아웃을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Traducir aplicaciones web Next.js a diferentes idiomas","Configurar enrutamiento basado en locales para soporte multilingüe","Implementar diseños personalizados para varios locales"],"fr":["Traduire des applications Web Next.js dans différentes langues","Configurer le routage basé sur les locales pour le support multilingue","Mettre en œuvre des mises en page personnalisées pour différents locales"],"de":["Next.js-Webanwendungen in verschiedene Sprachen übersetzen","Locale-basiertes Routing für multilinguale Unterstützung konfigurieren","Benutzerdefinierte Layouts für verschiedene Locale implementieren"],"pt":["Traduzir aplicativos web Next.js para diferentes idiomas","Configurar roteamento baseado em localidade para suporte multilíngue","Implementar layouts personalizados para várias localidades"],"ru":["Перевод веб-приложений Next.js на разные языки","Настройка маршрутизации на основе местоположения для многоязычной поддержки","Реализация настраиваемых макетов для различных местоположений"],"ar":["ترجمة تطبيقات الويب Next.js إلى لغات مختلفة","تكوين مسارات الموقع للمساعدة المتعددة اللغات","تنفيذ تخطيطات مخصصة لمواقع متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires next-intl library integration","Limited to Next.js web applications","Needs locale definitions and routing configurations"],"zh":["需要 next-intl 库集成","仅限 Next.js 网页应用程序","需要区域定义和路由配置"],"ja":["next-intl ライブラリの統合が必要","Next.js ウェブアプリケーションに限定される","ロケール定義とルーティング設定が必要"],"ko":["next-intl 라이브러리 통합이 필요함","Next.js 웹 애플리케이션에만限함","지역 정의 및 라우팅 구성이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la biblioteca next-intl","Limitado a aplicaciones web Next.js","Necesita definiciones de locales y configuraciones de enrutamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque next-intl","Limité aux applications Web Next.js","Nécessite des définitions de locale et des configurations de routage"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der next-intl-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf Next.js-Webanwendungen","Benötigt Locale-Definitionen und Routing-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Requer integração da biblioteca next-intl","Limitado a aplicativos web Next.js","Necessita de definições de localidade e configurações de roteamento"],"ru":["Требует интеграции библиотеки next-intl","Ограничен веб-приложениями Next.js","Требует определений местоположения и настроек маршрутизации"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج مكتبة next-intl","محدود لتطبيقات الويب Next.js","يحتاج إلى تعريفات الموقع وتكوين المسارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ad321b822d3b409d22fc0743bc8aa107ddd5abd668834d7b8a249ac7b4122c6","qualityScore":31}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('osoleve/the-fold/troubleshooting', 'community', 'osoleve', 'the-fold', 'osoleve/the-fold', 'troubleshooting', 0, 0, 31, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.934Z', '2026-03-02T02:33:27.961Z', 'b743e94132fef4ebe5ce8022ea5632afe6f29a016f4f6cf769c27343b4736709', '{"id":"osoleve/the-fold/troubleshooting","name":"troubleshooting","description":{"zh":"AI智能体故障排除是一种内容地址同义技能树，用于代理AI的开发和调试","ja":"AIエージェントのトラブルシューティングは、代理AIの開発とデバッグに使用されるコンテンツアドレス型のホモアイコニックスキルツリーです","ko":"AI 에이전트 트러블슈팅은 에이전트 AI의 개발과 디버깅을 위한 콘텐츠 주소형 호모아이코닉 스킬 트리입니다","es":"Nuestra habilidad de solución de problemas es un árbol de habilidades homoicónicas para agentic AI, diseñada para ayudar a los desarrolladores a solucionar problemas de manera efectiva","fr":"Notre compétence de dépannage est un arbre de compétences homoicóniques pour les agents IA, conçue pour aider les développeurs à résoudre des problèmes de manière efficace","de":"Unsere Fähigkeit zum Troubleshooting ist ein homoikonischer Skill-Tree für agentic AI, entwickelt um Entwicklern bei der Fehlerbehebung zu helfen","pt":"A árvore de habilidades de solução de problemas é uma habilidade homoicônica para agentic AI que ajuda a solucionar problemas de forma eficaz","ru":"Дерево навыков для устранения неисправностей - это homoиконная habilidade для ИИ агентов, которая помогает эффективно решать проблемы","ar":"شجرة المهارات لتصحيح الأخطاء هي مهارة homoicônica لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تساعد في حل المشكلات بفعالية","en":"A content-addressed homoiconic skill tree for agentic AI"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能体故障排除","ja":"AIエージェントのトラブルシューティング","ko":"AI 에이전트 트러블슈팅","es":"Herramientas de AI Agents para solución de problemas","fr":"Outils d''agents IA pour dépannage","de":"AI-Tools für Fehlerbehebung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Árvore de Habilidades de Solução de Pr...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Дерево Навыков для Устранения