e":"Benachrichtigungs-UI-Tools für Todo-Anwendungen","pt":"Notification UI: Ferramenta de Notificação para Aplicativos","ru":"Notification UI: Инструмент для создания уведомлений","ar":"Notification UI: أداة لإرسال الإشعارات","en":"notification-ui"},"description":{"zh":"notification-ui是一个AI智能通知界面，用于构建强大的Todo应用程序。它提供了灵活的通知管理和用户体验优化","ja":"notification-uiは、強力なTodoアプリケーションを構築するためのAIエージェントの通知UIです。柔軟な通知管理とユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化を提供します","ko":"notification-ui는 강력한 Todo 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 AI 에이전트의 알림 UI입니다. 유연한 알림 관리와 사용자 경험 최적화를 제공합니다","es":"La herramienta de notificación UI es una función clave para aplicaciones Todo, permitiendo a los desarrolladores crear notificaciones personalizadas y mejora...","fr":"L''outil de notification UI est une fonction clé pour les applications Todo, permettant aux développeurs de créer des notifications personnalisées et d''amélio...","de":"Das Benachrichtigungs-UI-Tool ist eine wichtige Funktion für Todo-Anwendungen, mit der Entwickler benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen erstellen und die Ben...","pt":"Notification UI é uma ferramenta de notificação para aplicativos que permite criar notificações personalizadas e enviar notificações em tempo real","ru":"Notification UI - инструмент для создания уведомлений в приложениях Todo","ar":"Notification UI: أداة لإرسال الإشعارات في تطبيقات Todo","en":"Todo-Application"},"definition":{"en":"Todo-Application"},"features":{"zh":["灵活的通知管理","用户体验优化","支持多种通知类型","易于集成和使用","高可定制性"],"ja":["柔軟な通知管理","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの最適化","複数の通知タイプをサポート","簡単な統合と使用","高可定制性"],"ko":["유연한 알림 관리","사용자 경험 최적화","多种 알림 유형 지원","쉽게 통합하고 사용","고도화된 사용자 정의"],"es":["Notificaciones personalizadas","Integración con aplicaciones Todo","Diseño de interfaz de usuario intuitivo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Alertas y recordatorios configurables"],"fr":["Notifications personnalisées","Intégration avec les applications Todo","Conception d''interface utilisateur intuitive","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Alertes et rappels configurables"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen","Integration mit Todo-Anwendungen","Intuitives Benutzeroberflächendesign","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Konfigurierbare Alarme und Erinnerungen"],"pt":["Criação de notificações personalizadas","Envio de notificações em tempo real","Integração com aplicativos Todo","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas"],"ru":["Создание уведомлений","Отправка уведомлений в реальном времени","Интеграция с приложениями Todo","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["إرسال الإشعارات","إرسال الإشعارات في الوقت الحقيقي","التكامل مع تطبيقات Todo","دعم منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用notification-ui","什么是AI智能通知界面","notification-ui替代品","notification-ui vs 其他工具","notification-ui安装","notification-ui设置指南","Todo应用程序开发","AI智能通知界面开发"],"ja":["notification-uiの使用方法","AIエージェントの通知UIとは","notification-uiの代替品","notification-ui vs その他のツール","notification-uiのインストール","notification-uiの設定ガイド","Todoアプリケーションの開発","AIエージェントの通知UIの開発"],"ko":["notification-ui 사용법","AI 에이전트의 알림 UI란","notification-ui 대안","notification-ui vs 다른 도구","notification-ui 설치","notification-ui 설정 가이드","Todo 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트의 알림 UI 개발"],"es":["herramientas de notificación UI","aplicaciones Todo","notificaciones personalizadas","cómo usar notificación UI","alternativas a notificación UI","instalación de notificación UI","guía de configuración de notificación UI"],"fr":["outils de notification UI","applications Todo","notifications personnalisées","comment utiliser la notification UI","alternatives à la notification UI","installation de la notification UI","guide de configuration de la notification UI"],"de":["Benachrichtigungs-UI-Tools","Todo-Anwendungen","benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen","wie man Benachrichtigungs-UI verwendet","Alternativen zu Benachrichtigungs-UI","Installation von Benachrichtigungs-UI","Konfigurationsanleitung für Benachrichtigungs-UI"],"pt":["Notification UI","Ferramenta de notificação","Aplicativos Todo","Notificações personalizadas","Envio de notificações em tempo real","Integração com aplicativos Todo"],"ru":["Notification UI","Инструмент для создания уведомлений","Приложения Todo","Уведомления в реальном времени","Интеграция с приложениями Todo","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["Notification UI","أداة لإرسال الإشعارات","تطبيقات Todo","إرسال الإشعارات في الوقت الحقيقي","التكامل مع تطبيقات Todo","دعم منصات متعددة"]}},"owner":"Syedaashnaghazanfar","repo":"full-stack-todo-app","repoPath":"Syedaashnaghazanfar/full-stack-todo-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.941Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notification-ui","description":"Renders notification bell icon with unread count badge, pulse animations for new notifications, and dropdown panel (320px × max 400px) displaying notification items with purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT tasks. Includes mark-as-read interaction and empty state handling.","bodyPreview":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When","body":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When displaying empty state (no notifications)\n\n## Bell Icon Specifications\n\n### Icon Size and Position\n\n- **Size**: 24px × 24px\n- **Position**: Top-right header\n- **Color**: Default #374151 (gray), hover #1F2937 (dark gray)\n\n```jsx\nfunction BellIcon({ unreadCount, onClick }) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className=\"bell-icon-button\"\n      onClick={onClick}\n      aria-label={`Notifications (${unreadCount} unread)`}\n    >\n      <svg\n        width=\"24\"\n        height=\"24\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n        className=\"bell-icon\"\n      >\n        <path\n          d=\"M15 17H20L18.5951 15.5951C18.2141 15.2141 18 14.6973 18 14.1585V11C18 8.38757 16.3304 6.16509 14 5.34142V5C14 3.89543 13.1046 3 12 3C10.8954 3 10 3.89543 10 5V5.34142C7.66962 6.16509 6 8.38757 6 11V14.1585C6 14.6973 5.78595 15.2141 5.40493 15.5951L4 17H9M15 17V18C15 19.6569 13.6569 21 12 21C10.3431 21 9 19.6569 9 18V17M15 17H9\"\n          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n          strokeWidth=\"2\"\n          strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n          strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n        />\n      </svg>\n      {unreadCount > 0 && (\n        <span className=\"badge\">{unreadCount > 99 ? ''99+'' : unreadCount}</span>\n      )}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Bell Icon Styling\n\n```css\n.bell-icon-button {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover {\n  background-color: #F3F4F6;\n}\n\n.bell-icon {\n  color: #374151;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover .bell-icon {\n  color: #1F2937;\n}\n```\n\n## Unread Count Badge\n\n### Badge Specifications\n\n- **Shape**: Circular\n- **Background**: #DC2626 (red)\n- **Text**: White (#FFFFFF)\n- **Display**: Count up to 99, then \"99+\"\n- **Position**: Top-right corner of bell icon\n\n```css\n.badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 4px;\n  right: 4px;\n  min-width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background-color: #DC2626; /* Red */\n  color: #FFFFFF; /* White */\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n```\n\n### Badge Display Logic\n\n```javascript\nfunction getBadgeText(count) {\n  if (count === 0) return null; // No badge\n  if (count > 99) return ''99+'';\n  return count.toString();\n}\n```\n\n## Pulse Animation\n\n### Animation Specifications\n\n- **Duration**: 2 seconds\n- **Effect**: Purple glow (#8B5CF6)\n- **Trigger**: On new notification arrival\n- **Iterations**: 3 times, then stop\n\n```css\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.7);\n  }\n  50% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0);\n  }\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button.pulsing {\n  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Animation Trigger\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationBell({ notifications }) {\n  const [isPulsing, setIsPulsing] = useState(false);\n  const prevCountRef = useRef(notifications.length);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Detect new notification\n    if (notifications.length > prevCountRef.current) {\n      setIsPulsing(true);\n\n      // Stop animation after 6 seconds (3 iterations × 2s)\n      setTimeout(() => setIsPulsing(false), 6000);\n    }\n\n    prevCountRef.current = notifications.length;\n  }, [notifications.length]);\n\n  return (\n    <BellIcon\n      className={isPulsing ? ''pulsing'' : ''''}\n      unreadCount={notifications.filter(n => !n.read).length}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Dropdown Panel\n\n### Panel Specifications\n\n- **Width**: 320px\n- **Max Height**: 400px\n- **Scrollable**: Yes (overflow-y: auto)\n- **Position**: Dropdown below bell icon\n- **Elevation**: Shadow for depth\n\n```css\n.notification-dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: calc(100% + 8px);\n  right: 0;\n  width: 320px;\n  max-height: 400px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n  border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n              0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-header {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #8B5CF6;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read:hover {\n  color: #7C3AED;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Item Styling\n\n### Item Specifications\n\n- **Padding**: 16px\n- **Border**: Bottom separator (1px solid #F3F4F6)\n- **Hover**: Background change to #F9FAFB\n- **Purple Theme**: VERY IMPORTANT notifications use #8B5CF6 accent\n\n```css\n.notification-item {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.notification-item:hover {\n  background-color: #F9FAFB;\n}\n\n.notification-item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread {\n  background-color: #FAF5FF; /* Very light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread:hover {\n  background-color: #F3E8FF; /* Light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.notification-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.notification-priority-indicator {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple for VERY IMPORTANT */\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.notification-message {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #374151;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread .notification-message {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.notification-time {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.unread-dot {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple */\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification Item Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    if (!notification.read) {\n      onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const relativeTime = formatRelativeTime(notification.timestamp);\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      <div className=\"notification-content\">\n        <div className=\"notification-header\">\n          <div className=\"notification-priority-indicator\" />\n          <p className=\"notification-message\">{notification.message}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"notification-time\">\n          {!notification.read && <span className=\"unread-dot\" />}\n          <span>{relativeTime}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction formatRelativeTime(timestamp) {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  const diff = now - timestamp;\n  const minutes = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60));\n  const hours = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60));\n  const days = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n\n  if (minutes < 1) return ''Just now'';\n  if (minutes < 60) return `${minutes}m ago`;\n  if (hours < 24) return `${hours}h ago`;\n  return `${days}d ago`;\n}\n```\n\n## Mark-as-Read Interaction\n\n### Click to Mark Read\n\nClicking an unread notification marks it as read:\n\n```jsx\nfunction handleNotificationClick(notification) {\n  if (!notification.read) {\n    // Mark as read\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(notification.id);\n\n    // Update UI state\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n\n    // Optional: Navigate to task\n    navigateToTask(notification.taskId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Visual Feedback\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const [isMarking, setIsMarking] = useState(false);\n\n  const handleClick = async () => {\n    if (!notification.read && !isMarking) {\n      setIsMarking(true);\n      await onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n      setIsMarking(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''} ${isMarking ? ''marking'' : ''''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      {/* ... */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Empty State\n\n### Empty State Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction EmptyState() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-empty-state\">\n      <div className=\"empty-icon\">🔔</div>\n      <p className=\"empty-title\">No notifications</p>\n      <p className=\"empty-description\">\n        You''re all caught up! Notifications for VERY IMPORTANT tasks will appear here.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Empty State Styling\n\n```css\n.notification-empty-state {\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #6B7280;\n}\n\n.empty-icon {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  opacity: 0.4;\n}\n\n.empty-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #374151;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.empty-description {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification System\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationSystem() {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [notifications, setNotifications] = useState([]);\n  const [unreadCount, setUnreadCount] = useState(0);\n  const dropdownRef = useRef(null);\n\n  // Load notifications\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const loaded = notificationPersistence.getAll();\n    setNotifications(loaded);\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  }, []);\n\n  // Close dropdown when clicking outside\n  useEffect(() => {\n    function handleClickOutside(event) {\n      if (dropdownRef.current && !dropdownRef.current.contains(event.target)) {\n        setIsOpen(false);\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n  }, []);\n\n  const handleMarkAsRead = (id) => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(id);\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  };\n\n  const handleMarkAllAsRead = () => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAllAsRead();\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(0);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-system\" ref={dropdownRef}>\n      <NotificationBell\n        unreadCount={unreadCount}\n        onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}\n        notifications={notifications}\n      />\n\n      {isOpen && (\n        <div className=\"notification-dropdown\">\n          <div className=\"notification-dropdown-header\">\n            <h3 className=\"notification-dropdown-title\">Notifications</h3>\n            {unreadCount > 0 && (\n              <button className=\"mark-all-read\" onClick={handleMarkAllAsRead}>\n                Mark all as read\n              </button>\n            )}\n          </div>\n\n          {notifications.length === 0 ? (\n            <EmptyState />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"notification-list\">\n              {notifications.map(notification => (\n                <NotificationItem\n                  key={notification.id}\n                  notification={notification}\n                  onMarkAsRead={handleMarkAsRead}\n                />\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Responsive Behavior\n\n### Mobile Adjustments\n\n```css\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .notification-dropdown {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    border-radius: 0;\n  }\n\n  .notification-dropdown-header {\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **Notification Persistence Skill**: Reads notification data\n- **Notification Trigger Skill**: Displays triggered notifications\n- **Priority Classification Skill**: Uses purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT\n- **Notification Experience Agent**: Coordinates UI interactions\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Bell icon button has aria-label with unread count\n- Keyboard navigation supported (Enter/Space to open/close)\n- Focus management in dropdown\n- Screen reader announcements for new notifications\n- Sufficient color contrast ratios (WCAG AA)\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n- Dropdown renders only when open (conditional rendering)\n- Virtual scrolling for large notification lists (>50)\n- Debounced mark-as-read operations\n- Memoized components to prevent unnecessary re-renders\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:39:23.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring interactive notification display capabilities with animated indicators and badge updates.","zh":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring interactive notification display capabilities with animated indicators and badge updates.","ja":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring interactive notification display capabilities with animated indicators and badge updates.","ko":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring interactive notification display capabilities with animated indicators and badge updates.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que requieren capacidades de visualización de notificaciones interactivas con indicadores animados y actualizaciones de insignias.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend nécessitant des capacités d''affichage de notifications interactives avec des indicateurs animés et des mises à jour de badges.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die interaktive Benachrichtigungsanzeigefunktionen mit animierten Indikatoren und Badge-Updates benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem capacidades de exibição de notificações interativas com indicadores animados e atualizações de emblemas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, требующих интерактивных возможностей отображения уведомлений с анимированными индикаторами и обновлениями значков.","ar":"مثالي لوكيلات الواجهة الأمامية التي تتطلب إمكانيات عرض الإشعارات التفاعلية مع المؤشرات المتحركة وتحديثات الشارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to render customizable notification panels with bell icons, display unread notification counts, and animate new arrivals using protocols like WebSockets for real-time updates, while utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript libraries for dynamic UI interactions.","zh":"Empowers agents to render customizable notification panels with bell icons, display unread notification counts, and animate new arrivals using protocols like WebSockets for real-time updates, while utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript libraries for dynamic UI interactions.","ja":"Empowers agents to render customizable notification panels with bell icons, display unread notification counts, and animate new arrivals using protocols like WebSockets for real-time updates, while utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript libraries for dynamic UI interactions.","ko":"Empowers agents to render customizable notification panels with bell icons, display unread notification counts, and animate new arrivals using protocols like WebSockets for real-time updates, while utilizing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript libraries for dynamic UI interactions.","es":"Permite a los agentes renderizar paneles de notificación personalizables con iconos de campana, mostrar recuentos de notificaciones no leídas y animar las nuevas llegadas utilizando protocolos como WebSockets para actualizaciones en tiempo real, mientras utiliza bibliotecas HTML, CSS y JavaScript para interacciones de UI dinámicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rendre des panneaux de notification personnalisables avec des icônes de cloche, d''afficher des comptes de notifications non lues et d''animer les nouvelles arrivées en utilisant des protocoles comme WebSockets pour des mises à jour en temps réel, tout en utilisant des bibliothèques HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour des interactions UI dynamiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungspanels mit Glocken-Symbols zu rendern, ungelesene Benachrichtigungen anzuzeigen und neue Ankünfte mithilfe von Protokollen wie WebSockets für Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen zu animieren, während HTML-, CSS- und JavaScript-Bibliotheken für dynamische UI-Interaktionen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a renderizar painéis de notificação personalizáveis com ícones de sino, exibir contagens de notificações não lidas e animar as novas chegadas usando protocolos como WebSockets para atualizações em tempo real, enquanto utiliza bibliotecas HTML, CSS e JavaScript para interações de UI dinâmicas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отображать настраиваемые панели уведомлений с иконками колокольчика, отображать счетчики непрочитанных уведомлений и анимировать прибытие новых уведомлений, используя протоколы, такие как WebSockets для обновлений в реальном времени, а также использовать библиотеки HTML, CSS и JavaScript для динамических взаимодействий с пользователем.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تقديم لوحات إشعارات قابلة للتعديل مع الرموز الجرس، وعرض عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة، وتحريك وصول الإشعارات الجديدة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل WebSockets للتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي، مع استخدام مكتبات HTML و CSS و JavaScript للتفاعلات الواجهة动态."},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering app headers with dynamic bell icons and badge updates","Displaying and updating unread notification counts in real-time","Animating the arrival of new notifications with interactive panel dropdowns"],"zh":["Rendering app headers with dynamic bell icons and badge updates","Displaying and updating unread notification counts in real-time","Animating the arrival of new notifications with interactive panel dropdowns"],"ja":["Rendering app headers with dynamic bell icons and badge updates","Displaying and updating unread notification counts in real-time","Animating the arrival of new notifications with interactive panel dropdowns"],"ko":["Rendering app headers with dynamic bell icons and badge updates","Displaying and updating unread notification counts in real-time","Animating the arrival of new notifications with interactive panel dropdowns"],"es":["Renderizar encabezados de aplicaciones con iconos de campana dinámicos y actualizaciones de insignias","Mostrar y actualizar recuentos de notificaciones no leídas en tiempo real","Animar la llegada de nuevas notificaciones con paneles desplegables interactivos"],"fr":["Rendre des en-têtes d''applications avec des icônes de cloche dynamiques et des mises à jour de badges","Afficher et mettre à jour des comptes de notifications non lues en temps réel","Animer l''arrivée de nouvelles notifications avec des panneaux déroulants interactifs"],"de":["Rendern von App-Headern mit dynamischen Glocken-Symbolen und Badge-Updates","Anzeigen und Aktualisieren ungelesener Benachrichtigungen in Echtzeit","Animieren der Ankunft neuer Benachrichtigungen mit interaktiven Panel-Dropdowns"],"pt":["Renderização de cabeçalhos de aplicativos com ícones de sino dinâmicos e atualizações de emblemas","Exibição e atualização de contagens de notificações não lidas em tempo real","Animação da chegada de novas notificações com painéis de dropdown interativos"],"ru":["Рендеринг заголовков приложений с динамическими иконками колокольчика и обновлениями значков","Отображение и обновление счетчиков непрочитанных уведомлений в реальном времени","Анимация прибытия новых уведомлений с интерактивными выпадающими панелями"],"ar":["تجسيد رأس التطبيق مع رموز الجرس الديناميكية وتحديثات الشارات","عرض وتحديث عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة في الوقت الفعلي","تحريك وصول الإشعارات الجديدة مع لوحات سحب تفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires client-side rendering capabilities","Limited to web-based applications with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript support"],"zh":["Requires client-side rendering capabilities","Limited to web-based applications with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript support"],"ja":["Requires client-side rendering capabilities","Limited to web-based applications with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript support"],"ko":["Requires client-side rendering capabilities","Limited to web-based applications with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript support"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de renderizado del lado del cliente","Limitado a aplicaciones web con soporte para HTML, CSS y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de rendu côté client","Limité aux applications web avec prise en charge de HTML, CSS et JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt Client-seitige Rendering-Funktionen","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen mit HTML-, CSS- und JavaScript-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de renderização do lado do cliente","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web com suporte a HTML, CSS e JavaScript"],"ru":["Требует возможностей рендеринга на стороне клиента","Ограничен веб-приложениями с поддержкой HTML, CSS и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إمكانيات العرض على جانب العميل","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى الويب بدعم HTML و CSS و JavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b1470954596364db57b123d0b13f4d053961314448b77eb12a1c68d7bf378715","qualityScore":31}');
