s","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных агентов","Интеграция с GH Copilot","Повышение безопасности кода","Анализ уязвимостей","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تطوير وكلاء مخصصين","التكامل مع GH Copilot","تحسين أمان الكود","تحليل الثغرات","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","防御的深度","GH Copilot","代码安全性","自定义AI代理","代码保护","多层次防御","AI工具","代码防御"],"ja":["AIエージェント","防御の深さ","GH Copilot","コードのセキュリティ性","カスタマイズされたAIエージェント","コード保護","多層の防御","AIツール","コード防御"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","방어의 깊이","GH Copilot","코드 보안성","커스텀 AI 에이전트","코드 보호","다중 계층 방어","AI 도구","코드 방어"],"es":["cómo usar defensa en profundidad","qué es defensa en profundidad","alternativas a GH Copilot","GH Copilot vs otros herramientas de desarrollo","instalación de defensa en profundidad","guía de configuración de defensa en profundidad","desarrollo de software seguro"],"fr":["comment utiliser la défense en profondeur","qu''est-ce que la défense en profondeur","alternatives à GH Copilot","GH Copilot vs autres outils de développement","installation de la défense en profondeur","guide de configuration de la défense en profondeur","développement de logiciels sécurisé"],"de":["wie man Verteidigungstiefe verwendet","was ist Verteidigungstiefe","Alternativen zu GH Copilot","GH Copilot vs andere Entwicklungstools","Installation von Verteidigungstiefe-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Verteidigungstiefe-Tools","sichere Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["como usar Defense-in-Depth","o que é Defense-in-Depth","GH Copilot alternative","Defense-in-Depth vs outros","instalar Defense-in-Depth","guia de configuração do Defense-in-Depth"],"ru":["как использовать Defense-in-Depth","что такое Defense-in-Depth","альтернатива GH Copilot","Defense-in-Depth vs другие","установить Defense-in-Depth","руководство по настройке Defense-in-Depth"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام الدفاع في العمق","ما هو الدفاع في العمق","بديل GH Copilot","الدفاع في العمق مقابل آخرون","تثبيت الدفاع في العمق","دليل إعداد الدفاع في العمق"]}},"owner":"AlabamaMike","repo":"copilot-agents","repoPath":"AlabamaMike/copilot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.960Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"defense-in-depth","description":"Use when invalid data causes failures deep in execution, requiring validation at multiple system layers - validates at every layer data passes through to make bugs structurally impossible","bodyPreview":"# Defense-in-Depth Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you fix a bug caused by invalid data, adding validation at one place feels sufficient. But that single check can be bypassed by different code paths, refactoring, or mocks.\n\n**Core principle:** Validate at EVERY layer data passes through. Make the bug structurally impossible.\n\n## Why Multiple Layers\n\nSingle validation: \"We fixed the bug\"\nMultiple layers: \"We made the bug impossible\"\n\nDifferent layers catch different cases:\n- Entry validation catch","body":"# Defense-in-Depth Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you fix a bug caused by invalid data, adding validation at one place feels sufficient. But that single check can be bypassed by different code paths, refactoring, or mocks.\n\n**Core principle:** Validate at EVERY layer data passes through. Make the bug structurally impossible.\n\n## Why Multiple Layers\n\nSingle validation: \"We fixed the bug\"\nMultiple layers: \"We made the bug impossible\"\n\nDifferent layers catch different cases:\n- Entry validation catches most bugs\n- Business logic catches edge cases\n- Environment guards prevent context-specific dangers\n- Debug logging helps when other layers fail\n\n## The Four Layers\n\n### Layer 1: Entry Point Validation\n**Purpose:** Reject obviously invalid input at API boundary\n\n```typescript\nfunction createProject(name: string, workingDirectory: string) {\n  if (!workingDirectory || workingDirectory.trim() === '''') {\n    throw new Error(''workingDirectory cannot be empty'');\n  }\n  if (!existsSync(workingDirectory)) {\n    throw new Error(`workingDirectory does not exist: ${workingDirectory}`);\n  }\n  if (!statSync(workingDirectory).isDirectory()) {\n    throw new Error(`workingDirectory is not a directory: ${workingDirectory}`);\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 2: Business Logic Validation\n**Purpose:** Ensure data makes sense for this operation\n\n```typescript\nfunction initializeWorkspace(projectDir: string, sessionId: string) {\n  if (!projectDir) {\n    throw new Error(''projectDir required for workspace initialization'');\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 3: Environment Guards\n**Purpose:** Prevent dangerous operations in specific contexts\n\n```typescript\nasync function gitInit(directory: string) {\n  // In tests, refuse git init outside temp directories\n  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''test'') {\n    const normalized = normalize(resolve(directory));\n    const tmpDir = normalize(resolve(tmpdir()));\n\n    if (!normalized.startsWith(tmpDir)) {\n      throw new Error(\n        `Refusing git init outside temp dir during tests: ${directory}`\n      );\n    }\n  }\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n### Layer 4: Debug Instrumentation\n**Purpose:** Capture context for forensics\n\n```typescript\nasync function gitInit(directory: string) {\n  const stack = new Error().stack;\n  logger.debug(''About to git init'', {\n    directory,\n    cwd: process.cwd(),\n    stack,\n  });\n  // ... proceed\n}\n```\n\n## Applying the Pattern\n\nWhen you find a bug:\n\n1. **Trace the data flow** - Where does bad value originate? Where used?\n2. **Map all checkpoints** - List every point data passes through\n3. **Add validation at each layer** - Entry, business, environment, debug\n4. **Test each layer** - Try to bypass layer 1, verify layer 2 catches it\n\n## Example from Session\n\nBug: Empty `projectDir` caused `git init` in source code\n\n**Data flow:**\n1. Test setup → empty string\n2. `Project.create(name, '''')`\n3. `WorkspaceManager.createWorkspace('''')`\n4. `git init` runs in `process.cwd()`\n\n**Four layers added:**\n- Layer 1: `Project.create()` validates not empty/exists/writable\n- Layer 2: `WorkspaceManager` validates projectDir not empty\n- Layer 3: `WorktreeManager` refuses git init outside tmpdir in tests\n- Layer 4: Stack trace logging before git init\n\n**Result:** All 1847 tests passed, bug impossible to reproduce\n\n## Key Insight\n\nAll four layers were necessary. During testing, each layer caught bugs the others missed:\n- Different code paths bypassed entry validation\n- Mocks bypassed business logic checks\n- Edge cases on different platforms needed environment guards\n- Debug logging identified structural misuse\n\n**Don''t stop at one validation point.** Add checks at every layer.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:49:48.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-Oriented Agents needing robust data validation and sanitization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的数据验证和清理功能的安全性导向型代理。","ja":"セキュリティ指向のエージェントが堅牢なデータ検証とサニタイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"강력한 데이터 검증 및 제한 기능이 필요한 보안 지향 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes con orientación a la Seguridad que necesitan capacidades de validación y saneamiento de datos robustas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur la Sécurité nécessitant des capacités de validation et de nettoyage de données robustes.","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsorientierte Agenten, die robuste Datenvalidierungs- und Sanierungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Orientados à Segurança que necessitam de capacidades robustas de validação e sanitização de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на безопасность, которым требуются надежные возможности проверки и санации данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمان الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات قوية للتحقق من صحة البيانات وتطهيرها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement multi-layer validation using entry validation, refactoring, and mocking, making bugs structurally impossible and ensuring data integrity through protocols like validation at every layer.","zh":"使得代理能够实现多层验证，使用输入验证、重构和模拟，使得错误在结构上成为不可能，并通过每层的验证等协议来确保数据完整性。","ja":"エージェントがエントリ検証、リファクタリング、モッキングを使用して多層検証を実装できるようにし、バグが構造的に不可能になり、各層の検証などのプロトコルを通じてデータの完全性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 입력 검증, 리팩토링, 모의를 사용하여 다층 검증을 구현할 수 있도록 해주어 버그가 구조적으로 불가능하게 만들고, 각 계층의 검증 등의 프로토콜을 통해 데이터 무결성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una validación multcapa utilizando validación de entrada, refactorización y simulación, lo que hace que los errores sean estructuralmente imposibles y garantiza la integridad de los datos a través de protocolos como la validación en cada capa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une validation multicroche en utilisant la validation d''entrée, la refactorisation et la simulation, ce qui rend les bogues structurellement impossibles et garantit l''intégrité des données via des protocoles tels que la validation à chaque couche.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine mehrschichtige Validierung mithilfe von Eingabvalidierung, Refactoring und Mocking umzusetzen, wodurch Fehler strukturell unmöglich gemacht und die Datensicherheit durch Protokolle wie Validierung auf jeder Ebene gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem validação de múltiplas camadas usando validação de entrada, refatoração e mocking, tornando os bugs estruturalmente impossíveis e garantindo a integridade dos dados por meio de protocolos como validação em cada camada.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать многоуровневую проверку с использованием проверки входных данных, рефакторинга и мокинга, делая ошибки структурно невозможными и обеспечивая целостность данных с помощью таких протоколов, как проверка на каждом уровне.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ التحقق متعدد الطبقات باستخدام التحقق من صحة الإدخال وإعادة الهيكلة والتهيئة، مما يجعل الأخطاء مستحيلة من الناحية الهيكلية ويضمن سلامة البيانات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل التحقق في كل طبقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating user input data","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms","Preventing bypassing of single validation checks"],"zh":["验证用户输入数据","实施强大的错误处理机制","防止单一验证检查的绕过"],"ja":["ユーザー入力データの検証","堅牢なエラー処理メカニズムの実装","単一の検証チェックのバイパス防止"],"ko":["사용자 입력 데이터의 검증","강력한 오류 처리 메커니즘의 구현","단일 검증 체크의 우회 방지"],"es":["Validar datos de entrada de usuarios","Implementar mecanismos de control de errores robustos","Prevenir el bypass de comprobaciones de validación únicas"],"fr":["Valider les données de saisie utilisateur","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes de gestion d''erreurs robustes","Empêcher le contournement des vérifications de validation unique"],"de":["Validierung von Benutzereingabedaten","Implementierung robuster Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen","Verhinderung des Umgehens von einzelnen Validierungsprüfungen"],"pt":["Validating user input data","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms","Preventing bypassing of single validation checks"],"ru":["Validating user input data","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms","Preventing bypassing of single validation checks"],"ar":["Validating user input data","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms","Preventing bypassing of single validation checks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive code review and analysis","May add complexity to codebase"],"zh":["需要全面代码审查和分析","可能增加代码库的复杂性"],"ja":["包括的コードレビューと分析が必要","コードベースの複雑性が増大する可能性"],"ko":["전체 코드 리뷰 및 분석이 필요함","코드베이스의 복잡성이 증가할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una revisión y análisis de código exhaustivos","Puede agregar complejidad a la base de código"],"fr":["Nécessite une révision et une analyse de code exhaustives","Peut ajouter de la complexité à la base de code"],"de":["Erfordert eine umfassende Code-Überprüfung und -Analyse","Kann die Codebasis komplexer machen"],"pt":["Requires comprehensive code review and analysis","May add complexity to codebase"],"ru":["Requires comprehensive code review and analysis","May add complexity to codebase"],"ar":["Requires comprehensive code review and analysis","May add complexity to codebase"]},"version":3},"content