sierte Erstellung von LinkedIn-Beiträgen","Inhaltsanpassung mit KI","Integration mit der Giordano-Website","SEO-Optimierung","Kompatibilität mit Node.js und CLI"],"pt":["Criação de postagens personalizadas","Otimização de conteúdo para SEO","Integração com o LinkedIn","Análise de desempenho de postagens","Suporte a múltiplas contas"],"ru":["Создание персонализированных постов","Оптимизация контента для SEO","Интеграция с LinkedIn","Анализ производительности постов","Поддержка нескольких аккаунтов"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات مخصصة","تحسين المحتوى للبحث","التكامل مع LinkedIn","تحليل أداء المنشورات","دعم حسابات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["writing-linkedin-posts AI工具","如何使用writing-linkedin-posts AI工具","writing-linkedin-posts AI工具安装","writing-linkedin-posts AI工具设置","writing-linkedin-posts AI工具替代","writing-linkedin-posts AI工具 vs 其他工具"],"ja":["writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェント","writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェントを使用する方法","writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェントのインストール","writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェントの設定","writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェントの代替","writing-linkedin-posts AIエージェント vs その他のツール"],"ko":["writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구","writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구를 사용하는 방법","writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구의 설치","writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구의 설정","writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구의 대체","writing-linkedin-posts AI 도구 vs 다른 도구"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es un agente de AI","alternativas a writing-linkedin-posts","writing-linkedin-posts vs competidores","instalación de writing-linkedin-posts","guía de configuración de writing-linkedin-posts","desarrollo de publicaciones de LinkedIn con Python","optimización de SEO para LinkedIn"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives à writing-linkedin-posts","writing-linkedin-posts vs concurrents","installation de writing-linkedin-posts","guide de configuration de writing-linkedin-posts","développement de publications LinkedIn avec Python","optimisation de SEO pour LinkedIn"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu writing-linkedin-posts","writing-linkedin-posts vs wettbewerber","installation von writing-linkedin-posts","einrichtungsanleitung für writing-linkedin-posts","entwicklung von LinkedIn-beiträgen mit Python","seo-optimierung für linkedin"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para redes sociais","como usar Giordano''s","otimização de postagens no LinkedIn","criação de conteúdo para redes sociais","Giordano''s vs outras ferramentas","instalação do Giordano''s","guias de configuração do Giordano''s"],"ru":["ИИ-фerramentas для социальных сетей","как использовать Giordano''s","оптимизация постов в LinkedIn","создание контента для социальных сетей","Giordano''s vs другие фerramentas","установка Giordano''s","руководства по настройке Giordano''s"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للشبكات الاجتماعية","كيفية استخدام Giordano''s","تحسين منشورات LinkedIn","إنشاء محتوى للشبكات الاجتماعية","Giordano''s مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Giordano''s","دليل إعداد Giordano''s"]}},"owner":"gscalzo","repo":"gscalzo.github.io","repoPath":"gscalzo/gscalzo.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.971Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-linkedin-posts","description":"Create engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts like a Top Voice. Use this skill when asked to write LinkedIn content, social media posts for LinkedIn, professional thought leadership content, or help with LinkedIn engagement strategy. Triggers include requests for LinkedIn posts, professional social content, thought leadership pieces, or viral/engaging LinkedIn content.","bodyPreview":"# LinkedIn Post Writer\n\nCreate engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts that drive meaningful engagement and establish thought leadership.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Authenticity Over Performance\n\nLinkedIn has matured. Readers can spot manufactured vulnerability and engagement bait instantly. The posts that resonate now are genuinely useful or genuinely human—not optimized for virality.\n\nWhat works:\n- Real experiences with honest reflection\n- Specific insights from your actual work\n- Admitting what you","body":"# LinkedIn Post Writer\n\nCreate engaging, authentic LinkedIn posts that drive meaningful engagement and establish thought leadership.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Authenticity Over Performance\n\nLinkedIn has matured. Readers can spot manufactured vulnerability and engagement bait instantly. The posts that resonate now are genuinely useful or genuinely human—not optimized for virality.\n\nWhat works:\n- Real experiences with honest reflection\n- Specific insights from your actual work\n- Admitting what you don''t know\n- Sharing without needing validation\n\nWhat doesn''t:\n- Performed vulnerability for engagement\n- Stories that feel too perfectly structured\n- Lessons that sound like motivational posters\n\n### One Idea Per Post\n\nThe biggest mistake is cramming multiple tips, stories, or angles into one post. Focus on:\n- One core idea\n- One story\n- One insight\n- One lesson\n\nIf you have five points, that''s five posts.\n\n### Value Without Strings\n\nEvery post must educate, inspire, or entertain. Ask: \"Would I find this valuable if a stranger posted it?\" Not \"Will this get engagement?\"\n\n## Building Your Signature Voice\n\nTop Voices don''t just post well—they''re recognizable. Their perspective, style, and focus areas are consistent.\n\n### Define Your POV\n\nAnswer these before writing:\n- What topic do I have genuine expertise in?\n- What''s my contrarian belief in my industry?\n- What perspective do I bring that others don''t?\n- What would I want to be known for saying?\n\n### Consistency Markers\n\nDevelop 2-3 recognizable elements:\n- A recurring theme or topic area\n- A consistent tone (analytical, warm, direct, witty)\n- A signature format you''re known for\n- Phrases or frameworks you''ve coined\n\n### Voice Calibration\n\nYour LinkedIn voice should be:\n- More polished than a text to a friend\n- Less formal than a company memo\n- As smart as your best work conversations\n- As human as your real personality\n\n## Post Anatomy\n\n### The Hook (Lines 1-2)\n\nThe first 2-3 lines appear before \"See more\" and determine everything.\n\n**Modern hooks that work** (avoid overused patterns):\n\n| Type | Example | Why It Works |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| **Honest admission** | \"I''ve been wrong about remote work.\" | Genuine, not performed |\n| **Specific observation** | \"I''ve noticed something in every founder who scaled past $10M.\" | Credibility + curiosity |\n| **Direct challenge** | \"Most career advice optimizes for the wrong thing.\" | Provokes thought |\n| **Unexpected angle** | \"The best hire I made had the worst resume.\" | Subverts expectations |\n| **Simple truth** | \"Nobody talks about how lonely leadership is.\" | Resonates emotionally |\n\n**Hooks to retire**:\n- \"This one thing made me $X\" (feels like a scam ad)\n- \"The CEO pulled me aside and said...\" (overused curiosity bait)\n- \"I''m excited to announce...\" (corporate and skippable)\n- \"[Number] words that changed my life\" (too formulaic)\n\nSee `references/hooks.md` for comprehensive examples.\n\n### The Body\n\nStructure for scannability:\n- Short paragraphs (1-3 sentences max)\n- Line breaks between thoughts\n- Bullet points for lists (but don''t overuse)\n- Bold for emphasis sparingly\n\n**Storytelling framework**:\n1. Set the scene (briefly—one sentence)\n2. Introduce tension or conflict\n3. Show the turning point\n4. Deliver the insight\n5. Make it applicable to the reader\n\n### The Close\n\nEnd with purpose, not desperation:\n\n**Good closes**:\n- Genuine question that invites perspective\n- Specific call to action (\"Bookmark this for your next negotiation\")\n- Reflection that lingers (\"Something to sit with this week\")\n\n**Avoid**:\n- \"Agree?\" (lazy)\n- \"Comment YES if...\" (engagement bait)\n- \"Share this with someone who needs it\" (needy)\n- \"Follow me for more\" (salesy)\n\n## Vulnerability Done Right\n\nAuthentic sharing builds connection. Performed vulnerability destroys trust.\n\n### Strategic Vulnerability vs. Exploitation\n\n**Share when**:\n- The experience taught you something others can learn\n- You''ve processed it enough to offer perspective\n- It serves the reader, not your need for validation\n- Time has passed and you have hindsight\n\n**Don''t share when**:\n- The wound is still fresh\n- You''re seeking sympathy, not providing value\n- It could harm others involved\n- It feels performative even to you\n\n### The Vulnerability Test\n\nBefore posting something personal, ask:\n1. Am I sharing this to help others or to process my own feelings?\n2. Would I be comfortable if this went viral?\n3. Does this include genuine insight or just pain?\n4. Have I protected others who were involved?\n\n## Post Formats\n\n### Story Post\nBest for: Personal experiences, lessons learned, career moments\n\n```\n[Hook - honest admission or surprising outcome]\n\n[One sentence of context]\n\n[What happened - the tension or challenge]\n\n[The turning point]\n\n[What you learned]\n\n[Question or reflection for reader]\n```\n\n### List Post\nBest for: Frameworks, actionable advice, curated insights\n\n```\n[Hook - clear value promise]\n\n[Why this matters - one sentence]\n\n1. [Point with brief context]\n2. [Point with brief context]\n3. [Point with brief context]\n(3-7 items max)\n\n[Closing insight or question]\n```\n\n### Contrarian Post\nBest for: Challenging conventional wisdom (with substance)\n\n```\n[Your contrarian position, stated directly]\n\n[The common belief you''re challenging]\n\n[Your reasoning - why you see it differently]\n\n[Evidence or experience]\n\n[Nuanced conclusion - acknowledge complexity]\n\n[Invite discussion]\n```\n\n**Contrarian guardrails**:\n- Have genuine expertise on the topic\n- Argue against ideas, not people\n- Offer an alternative, not just criticism\n- Acknowledge what the other side gets right\n- Be open to being wrong\n\n### Observation Post\nBest for: Industry insights, trends, patterns you''ve noticed\n\n```\n[What you''ve observed]\n\n[Specific evidence or examples]\n\n[Why it matters]\n\n[Your interpretation]\n\n[Question to test if others see it too]\n```\n\n## Media Formats\n\nText-only posts aren''t the only option. Different formats serve different purposes.\n\n### Document/Carousel Posts\n- Higher save rates and extended engagement\n- Best for: step-by-step guides, frameworks, before/after\n- Keep to 5-10 slides\n- Each slide should stand alone\n- End with a summary or CTA slide\n\n### Image Posts\n- Use when visual adds genuine value (charts, diagrams, photos from events)\n- Avoid: stock photos, generic graphics, memes (unless that''s your brand)\n- Native uploads outperform links\n\n### Polls\n- Good for: genuine market research, sparking discussion\n- Bad for: obvious questions, engagement farming\n- Always follow up with your take on the results\n\n### Video\n- LinkedIn favors native video over links\n- Keep under 90 seconds for most content\n- Captions are essential (most watch muted)\n- Face-to-camera builds personal connection\n\n## Engagement Strategy\n\nWhat happens after you post matters as much as what you post.\n\n### The First Hour\n\nLinkedIn''s algorithm weighs early engagement heavily:\n- Respond to every comment in the first 60 minutes\n- Ask follow-up questions to extend conversations\n- Thank people genuinely, not generically\n\n### Comment Quality\n\nYour comments on others'' posts build your brand too:\n- Add insight, not just agreement\n- Share relevant experience\n- Ask thoughtful follow-up questions\n- Avoid \"Great post!\" without substance\n\n### What Not to Do\n\n- Engagement pods (LinkedIn detects and penalizes these)\n- Asking people to \"comment for a free resource\"\n- Posting and disappearing\n- Commenting just to get visibility\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Tone Spectrum\n\nFind your spot on each scale:\n\n```\nCorporate ←————————→ Casual\nReserved ←————————→ Vulnerable\nAnalytical ←————————→ Emotional\nSerious ←————————→ Playful\n```\n\nMost Top Voices sit slightly right of center on each.\n\n### Length\n- Optimal: 150-300 words (enough for depth, short enough to finish)\n- Maximum: 3,000 characters\n- Use whitespace generously—dense text kills engagement\n\n### Formatting Rules\n- Never use hashtags inline with text\n- Place 3-5 hashtags at the very end, after a line break\n- One emoji max, if any (overuse signals inauthenticity)\n- Use \"I\" not \"we\" for personal posts\n\n## What to Avoid\n\n**Content anti-patterns**:\n- \"I''m excited to announce...\" (corporate speak)\n- Humblebrags disguised as lessons\n- Recycled viral post formats (the airport conversation, the Uber driver wisdom)\n- Posting others'' frameworks without credit\n- Tragedy exploitation (using global events for engagement)\n\n**Engagement anti-patterns**:\n- \"Comment YES if you agree\"\n- \"Share this with 3 people\"\n- Tagging people who didn''t ask to be tagged\n- Posting controversial takes you don''t actually believe\n- Fake questions where you just want to share your answer\n\n**Format anti-patterns**:\n- Every. Sentence. As. Its. Own. Line.\n- Excessive emoji strings\n- ALL CAPS FOR EMPHASIS\n- Hashtag stuffing\n\n## Content Categories That Perform\n\n1. **Career lessons** - Failures, pivots, decisions made\n2. **Behind-the-scenes** - Real work experiences, how things actually work\n3. **Industry insights** - Patterns you''ve noticed, trends you''re seeing\n4. **How-to frameworks** - Actionable processes readers can apply\n5. **Contrarian takes** - Challenge assumptions (with substance)\n6. **Personal milestones** - Only when tied to broader insights\n\n## References\n\n- `references/hooks.md` - Complete hook patterns with examples\n- `references/examples.md` - Full post examples demonstrating best practices\n\n## Quick Checklist Before Posting\n\n1. **Hook**: Would this stop MY scroll?\n2. **Focus**: Is there ONE clear idea?\n3. **Value**: Would I find this useful if someone else posted it?\n4. **Authenticity**: Does this sound like me, not \"LinkedIn me\"?\n5. **Format**: Is it scannable with short paragraphs?\n6. **Close**: Does it invite genuine engagement?\n7. **Vulnerability check**: Am I sharing to help or to process?\n8. **Cringe test**: Will I be proud of this post in a year?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:53:58.933Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing authentic and engaging content creation for LinkedIn posts","zh":"非常适合需要为LinkedIn帖子创建真实和吸引人的内容的Language Agents","ja":"LinkedIn投稿のための本物的な魅力的コンテンツ作成が必要なLanguage Agentsに最適","ko":"링크드인 게시물을 위한 진정하고 매력적인 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de lenguaje que necesitan creación de contenido auténtico y atractivo para publicaciones de LinkedIn","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langue ayant besoin de création de contenu authentique et engageant pour les publications LinkedIn","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die authentische und ansprechende Inhalte für LinkedIn-Beiträge benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam de criação de conteúdo autêntico e envolvente para posts do LinkedIn","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым требуется создание аутентичного и увлекательного контента для публикаций в LinkedIn","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء محتوى أصيل ومثير للنشرات على LinkedIn"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft meaningful LinkedIn posts that drive engagement and establish thought leadership, utilizing principles of authenticity over performance and incorporating real experiences with honest reflection, specific insights from actual work, and admissions of vulnerability","zh":"赋予代理人创建有意义的LinkedIn帖子的能力，这些帖子能够驱动参与度和树立思想领导力，利用真实性而非表现原则，并融入真实经历、真诚反思、实际工作的具体见解和脆弱性的承认","ja":"エージェントが真実性を重視し、実際の仕事からの具体的な洞察や脆弱性の承認を含む、LinkedIn投稿を通じて関与や思想的リーダーシップを生み出すことができるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 진실성과 실제 작업에서 얻은 구체적인 통찰 및 취약성의 اعتر�통해 참여와 리더십을树立하는 링크드인 게시물을 작성할 수 있도록 해줌","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear publicaciones de LinkedIn significativas que impulsan el compromiso y establecen el liderazgo de pensamiento, utilizando principios de autenticidad sobre rendimiento e incorporando experiencias reales con reflexión honesta, ideas específicas del trabajo real y admisiones de vulnerabilidad","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des publications LinkedIn significatives qui favorisent l''engagement et établissent un leadership de pensée, en utilisant des principes d''authenticité plutôt que de performance et en incorporant des expériences réelles avec une réflexion honnête, des idées spécifiques issues d''un travail réel et des admissions de vulnérabilité","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bedeutsame LinkedIn-Beiträge zu erstellen, die Engagement fördern und Thought Leadership etablieren, indem sie Prinzipien der Authentizität über Leistung anwenden und reale Erfahrungen mit ehrlicher Reflexion, spezifischen Erkenntnissen aus tatsächlicher Arbeit und Anerkennung von Verletzlichkeit einbeziehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar posts significativos no LinkedIn que impulsionam o engajamento e estabelecem liderança de pensamento, utilizando princípios de autenticidade em vez de desempenho e incorporando experiências reais com reflexão honesta, insights específicos do trabalho real e admissões de vulnerabilidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать значимые публикации в LinkedIn, которые стимулируют вовлеченность и устанавливают лидерство в области мысли, используя принципы аутентичности над результативностью и включающие реальный опыт с честным размышлением, конкретными идеями из реальной работы и признаниями уязвимости","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على صياغة منشورات LinkedIn ذات مغزى تعزز التفاعل وتؤسس القيادة الفكرية، مستخدمين مبادئ الأصالة بدلاً من الأداء وتضمين الخبرات الحقيقية مع التأمل الصادق والمعلومات المحددة من العمل الفعلي والإعترافات بالضعف"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating authentic and engaging LinkedIn posts that resonate with readers","Creating content that establishes thought leadership and drives meaningful engagement","Crafting posts that incorporate real experiences, honest reflection, and specific insights from actual work"],"zh":["为读者生成真实且吸引人的LinkedIn帖子","创建树立思想领导力并驱动有意义参与的内容","创建包含真实经历、真诚反思和实际工作见解的帖子"],"ja":["読者に共感できる本物的なLinkedIn投稿を生成する","思想的リーダーシップを樹立し、有意義な関与を生み出すコンテンツを作成する","実際の経験、真摯な反省、仕事からの具体的な洞察を含む投稿を作成する"],"ko":["읽는이에게 공감できる 진정하고 매력적인 링크드인 게시물을 생성하는 것","리더십을樹立하고 의미있는 참여를 유도하는 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","실제 경험과 진실한 반성, 실제 작업의 구체적인 통찰을 포함하는 게시물을 작성하는 것"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de LinkedIn auténticas y atractivas que resuenen con los lectores","Crear contenido que establezca el liderazgo de pensamiento y impulse un compromiso significativo","Crear publicaciones que incorporen experiencias reales, reflexión honesta y ideas específicas del trabajo real"],"fr":["Générer des publications LinkedIn authentiques et engageantes qui résonnent avec les lecteurs","Créer du contenu qui établit un leadership de pensée et favorise un engagement significatif","Créer des publications qui intègrent des expériences réelles, une réflexion honnête et des idées spécifiques issues d''un travail réel"],"de":["Erstellen von authentischen und ansprechenden LinkedIn-Beiträgen, die bei den Lesern Anklang finden","Erstellen von Inhalten, die Thought Leadership etablieren und bedeutsames Engagement fördern","Erstellen von Beiträgen, die reale Erfahrungen, ehrliche Reflexion und spezifische Erkenntnisse aus tatsächlicher Arbeit einbeziehen"],"pt":["Geração de posts autênticos e envolventes no LinkedIn que ressoam com os leitores","Criação de conteúdo que estabelece liderança de pensamento e impulsiona engajamento significativo","Criação de posts que incorporam experiências reais, reflexão honesta e insights específicos do trabalho real"],"ru":["Генерация аутентичных и увлекательных публикаций в LinkedIn, которые находят отклик у читателей","Создание контента, который устанавливает лидерство в области мысли и стимулирует значимое вовлеченность","Создание публикаций, которые включают реальный опыт, честное размышление и конкретные идеи из реальной работы"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات LinkedIn أصيلة ومثيرة تلتقط انتباه القراء","إنشاء محتوى يؤسس القيادة الفكرية ويعزز التفاعل المهم","صياغة منشورات تدمج الخبرات الحقيقية والتأمل الصادق والمعلومات المحددة من العمل الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of LinkedIn''s matured audience and their ability to spot manufactured vulnerability and engagement bait","Limited to creating content for LinkedIn posts, may not be applicable to other social media platforms"],"zh":["需要理解LinkedIn成熟受众的能力以及他们识别人工脆弱性和参与诱饵的能力","仅限于创建LinkedIn帖子的内容，可能不适用于其他社交媒体平台"],"ja":["LinkedInの成熟した受衆が人工的な脆弱性や関与の誘発を検知する能力を理解する必要がある","LinkedIn投稿のコンテンツ作成に限定され、他のソーシャルメディアプラットフォームには適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["링크드인의 성숙한 受众가 인공적인 취약성이나 참여 유도을 감지하는 능력을 이해하는 것이 필요","링크드인 게시물의 콘텐츠 생성에限定되어其他 소셜미디어 플랫폼에 적용되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la audiencia madura de LinkedIn y su capacidad para detectar vulnerabilidad fabricada y cebo de compromiso","Limitado a la creación de contenido para publicaciones de LinkedIn, puede que no sea aplicable a otras plataformas de redes sociales"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du public mature de LinkedIn et de sa capacité à détecter la vulnérabilité fabriquée et les appâts d''engagement","Limité à la création de contenu pour les publications LinkedIn, peut ne pas être applicable à d''autres plateformes de réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis der ausgereiften Zielgruppe von LinkedIn und ihrer Fähigkeit, hergestellte Verletzlichkeit und Engagement-Köder zu erkennen","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Inhalten für LinkedIn-Beiträge, möglicherweise nicht auf andere soziale Medien-Plattformen anwendbar"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da audiência madura do LinkedIn e sua capacidade de detectar vulnerabilidade fabricada e isca de engajamento","Limitado à criação de conteúdo para posts do LinkedIn, pode não ser aplicável a outras plataformas de mídia social"],"ru":["Требует понимания зрелой аудитории LinkedIn и их способности обнаруживать искусственную уязвимость и приманку для вовлеченности","Ограничен созданием контента для публикаций в LinkedIn, может быть не применим к другим социальным платформам"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم الجمهور الناضج لليكند والقدرة على كشف الضعف المصنعة وطعم التفاعل","محدود بإنشاء المحتوى لمنشورات LinkedIn، قد لا يكون قابلاً للتطبيق على منصات وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ce6659a1a55dca64329852091093a127c41205b04a9426a0235cdcf2280fcd7b","qualityScore":31}');
