tas de IA para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Голосовое Совпадение для Разработчиков","ar":"wizard-صوتي: أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للبرمجة","en":"voice-matching-wizard"},"description":{"zh":"Voice Matching Wizard是一个AI技能市场和新闻稿平台，用于创意智能。它提供了一个开发者社区，用于分享和发现新的AI技能和工具。","ja":"Voice Matching Wizardは、クリエイティブインテリジェンスのためのAIエージェントスキルマーケットプレイスとニュースレターです。開発者コミュニティが新しいAIスキルやツールを共有し、発見するためのプラットフォームを提供します。","ko":"보이스 매칭 위저드(Voice Matching Wizard)는 창의적 인텔리전스를 위한 AI 에이전트 스킬 마켓플레이스와 뉴스레터입니다. 개발자들이 새로운 AI 스킬과 툴을 공유하고 khám phá하기 위한 플랫폼을 제공합니다.","es":"Voice-matching-wizard es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que ofrece un mercado de habilidades de IA y un boletín para la inteligencia creativa","fr":"Voice-matching-wizard est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui propose un marché de compétences d''IA et une newsletter pour l''intelligence créative","de":"Voice-matching-wizard ist ein KI-Tool, das einen Markt für KI-Fähigkeiten und einen Newsletter für kreative Intelligenz bietet","pt":"O voice-matching-wizard é um assistente de voz com habilidades de IA para criatividade e inovação","ru":"ИИ агент voice-matching-wizard для разработчиков с голосовым совпадением","ar":"wizard-صوتي هو معالج صوتي بالذكاء الاصطناعي للبرمجة","en":"AI skills marketplace + newsletter for creative intelligence"},"definition":{"en":"AI skills marketplace + newsletter for creative intelligence"},"features":{"zh":["AI技能市场","新闻稿平台","开发者社区","创意智能解决方案","Voice Matching Wizard集成"],"ja":["AIエージェントスキルマーケットプレイス","ニュースレター平台","開発者コミュニティ","クリエイティブインテリジェンス解決方案","Voice Matching Wizard統合"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 스킬 마켓플레이스","뉴스레터 플랫폼","개발자 커뮤니티","창의적 인텔리전스 솔루션","보이스 매칭 위저드 통합"],"es":["Marketplace de habilidades de IA","Boletín para la inteligencia creativa","Asistente de voz para la creatividad","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js","Compatibilidad con CLI para una integración más profunda","Soporte para el desarrollo de agentes de voz personalizados"],"fr":["Marché de compétences d''IA","Newsletter pour l''intelligence créative","Assistant vocal pour la créativité","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une intégration plus approfondie","Support pour le développement d''agents vocaux personnalisés"],"de":["Markt für KI-Fähigkeiten","Newsletter für kreative Intelligenz","Sprachassistent für die Kreativität","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI für eine tiefere Integration","Unterstützung für die Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Sprachagenten"],"pt":["Integração com mercado de habilidades de IA","Newsletter para inteligência criativa","Desenvolvimento de voz com React e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para voz","Compatibilidade com Python para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Интеграция с рынком навыков ИИ","Новостная рассылка для творческого интеллекта","Разработка голоса с React и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для голоса","Совместимость с Python для разработчиков"],"ar":["التكامل مع سوق المهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","نشرة إخبارية للذكاء الإبداعي","تطوير الصوت مع React و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للصوت","التوافق مع Python للبرمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","创意智能","AI技能市场","新闻稿平台","开发者社区","Voice Matching Wizard","如何使用Voice Matching Wizard","Voice Matching Wizard安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","クリエイティブインテリジェンス","AIエージェントスキルマーケットプレイス","ニュースレター平台","開発者コミュニティ","Voice Matching Wizard","Voice Matching Wizardの使い方","Voice Matching Wizardのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","창의적 인텔리전스","AI 에이전트 스킬 마켓플레이스","뉴스레터 플랫폼","개발자 커뮤니티","보이스 매칭 위저드","보이스 매칭 위저드 사용법","보이스 매칭 위저드 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar voice-matching-wizard","qué es la inteligencia artificial","alternativas a voice-matching-wizard","voice-matching-wizard vs otros asistentes de voz","instalación de voice-matching-wizard","guía de configuración de voice-matching-wizard","desarrollo de agentes de voz con voice-matching-wizard"],"fr":["comment utiliser voice-matching-wizard","qu''est-ce que l''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à voice-matching-wizard","voice-matching-wizard vs d''autres assistants vocaux","installation de voice-matching-wizard","guide de configuration de voice-matching-wizard","développement d''agents vocaux avec voice-matching-wizard"],"de":["wie man voice-matching-wizard verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","Alternativen zu voice-matching-wizard","voice-matching-wizard im Vergleich zu anderen Sprachassistenten","Installation von voice-matching-wizard","Konfigurationsanleitung für voice-matching-wizard","Entwicklung von Sprachagenten mit voice-matching-wizard"],"pt":["como usar assistente de voz","o que é assistente de voz","assistente de voz alternative","assistente de voz vs outros","instalar assistente de voz","guia de configuração de assistente de voz","desenvolvimento de voz com Python","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","ИИ агент alternative","ИИ агент vs другие","установить ИИ агент","руководство по настройке ИИ агента","разработка голоса с Python","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام معالج الصوت","ما هو معالج الصوت","معالج الصوت بديل","معالج الصوت مقابل غيره","تثبيت معالج الصوت","دليل إعداد معالج الصوت","تطوير الصوت مع Python","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبرمجة"]}},"owner":"cdeistopened","repo":"skill-stack","repoPath":"cdeistopened/skill-stack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-matching-wizard","description":"Transform writing samples into a codified voice style that can be replicated consistently. This wizard guides you through analyzing samples, extracting patterns, and generating a custom voice skill.","bodyPreview":"# Voice Matching Wizard\n\nCreate a voice skill that captures the patterns, rhythms, and sensibilities of any writing style.\n\n## What This Does\n\nVoice matching is the art of identifying what makes writing *recognizable*. Not just the obvious markers—vocabulary, sentence length—but the deeper patterns: how ideas unfold, where the writer pauses, what they leave unsaid.\n\nThis wizard walks you through the process of:\n1. Gathering representative samples\n2. Extracting patterns across multiple dimensions","body":"# Voice Matching Wizard\n\nCreate a voice skill that captures the patterns, rhythms, and sensibilities of any writing style.\n\n## What This Does\n\nVoice matching is the art of identifying what makes writing *recognizable*. Not just the obvious markers—vocabulary, sentence length—but the deeper patterns: how ideas unfold, where the writer pauses, what they leave unsaid.\n\nThis wizard walks you through the process of:\n1. Gathering representative samples\n2. Extracting patterns across multiple dimensions\n3. Synthesizing a usable voice profile\n4. Generating a working skill file\n\nThe output is a `voice-[name].skill.md` you can use alongside other skills (like `anti-ai-writing`) for consistent, authentic content.\n\n---\n\n## Before You Begin\n\n**What makes a good sample:**\n- At least 500 words\n- Writing you''re proud of (or writing you want to emulate)\n- Representative of the voice you want to capture\n- From the same medium (all newsletters, all blog posts, etc.)\n\n**What to avoid:**\n- Heavily edited committee writing\n- Content written under constraints\n- Mixed formats (tweets + longform together)\n- Very old work that doesn''t reflect current voice\n\n**How many samples:**\n- 2-3 samples: Basic patterns\n- 4-5 samples: Good coverage\n- 10+: Comprehensive capture\n\n---\n\n## Three Paths Through This Wizard\n\n### Path A: \"I have samples of my own writing\"\nYou want to codify your existing voice so AI can match it consistently.\n→ Skip to **Phase 1: Gather Your Samples**\n\n### Path B: \"I want to write like [someone I admire]\"\nYou want to emulate an author, publication, or brand voice.\n→ If the writer is well-known (major author, publication), you may be able to use their name directly in prompts. For custom or lesser-known voices, you''ll still need samples.\n→ Proceed to **Phase 1: Gather Your Samples**\n\n### Path C: \"I''m not sure what my voice is yet\"\nYou want to discover and develop your voice through this process.\n→ Start with **Phase 0: Voice Discovery** (below)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 0: Voice Discovery (Optional)\n\n*Skip this if you already have samples or know what voice you want.*\n\nTo discover your voice, we need to understand how you naturally communicate when you''re not performing.\n\n**Answer these questions:**\n\n1. **How do you explain things to friends?**\n   - Do you use stories and examples?\n   - Do you build logical arguments?\n   - Do you make jokes?\n   - Do you ask questions to draw them in?\n\n2. **What writers or publications do you gravitate toward?**\n   - Not who you think you *should* read—who do you actually read?\n   - What about their style appeals to you?\n\n3. **What''s your natural sentence length?**\n   - Short and punchy?\n   - Long and flowing?\n   - Variable depending on the point?\n\n4. **How do you feel about jargon?**\n   - Love it (signals expertise)?\n   - Hate it (pretentious)?\n   - Use it sparingly when precise?\n\n5. **What''s your relationship with your reader?**\n   - Peer/friend?\n   - Mentor/teacher?\n   - Curious explorer?\n\nBased on your answers, find 2-3 pieces you''ve written that feel authentic. Use those for Phase 1.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Gather Samples\n\nCollect 2-5 writing samples. Paste each one into a separate document, or note where they can be found.\n\n**For each sample, note:**\n- Source/context (blog post, newsletter, etc.)\n- When it was written\n- Why you chose it\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Extract Patterns\n\nAnalyze each sample across these dimensions:\n\n### 2.1 Sentence Architecture\n\n| Element | What to Look For |\n|---------|------------------|\n| **Length** | Average sentence length (short/medium/long) |\n| **Variation** | Does length vary deliberately for rhythm? |\n| **Complexity** | Simple declarative? Compound? Complex? |\n| **Punctuation** | Em dashes? Semicolons? Minimal? |\n| **Fragments** | Used for emphasis? Never? |\n\n**Signature structures to identify:**\n- Opening patterns (\"Here''s the thing:\")\n- Rhythm breaks (\"But.\")\n- List patterns (\"First... Second... Third...\")\n- Closing moves (questions, callbacks, calls to action)\n\n### 2.2 Word Choice\n\n| Element | What to Look For |\n|---------|------------------|\n| **Vocabulary level** | Simple/moderate/sophisticated |\n| **Formality** | 1-5 scale (casual to formal) |\n| **Contractions** | Always/sometimes/never |\n| **Jargon** | Industry terms? Avoided? |\n| **Strong language** | Profanity level/style if any |\n\n**Identify:**\n- Favorite words (appears 3+ times across samples)\n- Avoided words (never appears despite opportunity)\n- Signature phrases\n\n### 2.3 Tone & Attitude\n\n| Element | What to Look For |\n|---------|------------------|\n| **Emotional register** | Warm? Cool? Intense? Measured? |\n| **Reader relationship** | Peer? Mentor? Friend? Expert? |\n| **Humor style** | Sarcasm? Wordplay? Self-deprecation? None? |\n| **Certainty level** | Definitive or exploratory? |\n| **Attitude toward subject** | Passionate? Skeptical? Curious? |\n\n### 2.4 Structural Moves\n\n| Element | What to Look For |\n|---------|------------------|\n| **Openings** | Story? Question? Bold claim? Scene-setting? |\n| **Transitions** | Seamless? Signposted? Abrupt? |\n| **Closings** | Call to action? Question? Summary? Callback? |\n| **Paragraph length** | Short punchy? Long flowing? Mixed? |\n\n### 2.5 Distinctive Techniques\n\nWhat makes this voice *recognizable*?\n\n- Rhetorical devices (questions, analogies, callbacks)\n- Signature moves unique to this writer\n- How evidence is presented (data? anecdotes? logic?)\n- Pattern interrupts (how does the writer surprise?)\n\n### 2.6 What They DON''T Do\n\nJust as important:\n- Phrases never used\n- Structures avoided\n- Topics skipped\n- Formality levels never hit\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Synthesize\n\n### The Voice in One Paragraph\n\nWrite a single paragraph capturing the essence:\n\n> \"[Name]''s voice is [primary characteristics]. They write like [relationship to reader], using [key techniques]. Their tone is [tone], with [humor style if applicable]. Sentences tend to be [structure]. They favor [word choice] and avoid [avoidances]. The overall effect is [feeling/impact].\"\n\n### Voice Spectrum\n\nRate the voice on these scales (1-5):\n\n```\nFormal ←――――――――――→ Casual         [ ]\nExpert ←――――――――――→ Peer           [ ]\nSerious ←―――――――――→ Playful        [ ]\nReserved ←――――――――→ Opinionated    [ ]\nAbstract ←――――――――→ Concrete       [ ]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Generate the Voice Skill\n\nUsing your analysis, create `voice-[name].skill.md` with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: voice-[name]\ndescription: Write in [Name]''s distinctive voice. [One sentence characterization]. Use with anti-ai-writing for authentic content.\n---\n\n# Voice: [Name]\n\n[Your one-paragraph voice description from Phase 3]\n\n## Voice Spectrum\n\n- Formal/Casual: [1-5]\n- Expert/Peer: [1-5]\n- Serious/Playful: [1-5]\n- Reserved/Opinionated: [1-5]\n- Abstract/Concrete: [1-5]\n\n## Core Characteristics\n\n### Sentence Architecture\n[Your findings from 2.1]\n\n### Word Choice\n[Your findings from 2.2]\n\n### Tone & Attitude\n[Your findings from 2.3]\n\n### Structural Moves\n[Your findings from 2.4]\n\n### Distinctive Techniques\n[Your findings from 2.5]\n\n### Avoidances\n[Your findings from 2.6]\n\n## Example Patterns\n\n### Signature Openings\n[3-5 examples from samples with pattern explanation]\n\n### Signature Transitions\n[3-5 examples]\n\n### Signature Closings\n[3-5 examples]\n\n### Signature Sentences\n[5-10 exemplary sentences that capture the voice]\n\n## The [Name] Test\n\nBefore publishing, ask:\n- [ ] Would [Name] actually write this sentence?\n- [ ] Does it match the voice spectrum above?\n- [ ] Are signature patterns present?\n- [ ] Are avoidances absent?\n- [ ] Does it *feel* right?\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\nIf you see these, you''ve drifted from the voice:\n- [List 5-10 patterns that would violate this voice]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: Validate\n\nTest your voice skill:\n\n1. Write a short piece using only the voice skill\n2. Compare to original samples\n3. Identify gaps or mischaracterizations\n4. Refine based on testing\n\n**Validation checklist:**\n- [ ] Voice description captures the essence\n- [ ] Spectrum ratings feel accurate\n- [ ] Example patterns are genuinely representative\n- [ ] Test output sounds like the samples\n- [ ] Nothing important was missed\n\n---\n\n## Human Writing Fundamentals\n\n*Every voice skill should build on these principles from `anti-ai-writing`.*\n\n### The Energy Transfer Principle\n\nThe best writing is a transfer of energy from writer to reader. When analyzing samples, notice how the writer transfers energy:\n- Do they write conversations or speeches?\n- Do they speak WITH their audience or AT them?\n- Where do they use specific, concrete language vs. abstract ideas?\n\n### The SUCKS Framework\n\nApply this when generating voice output:\n\n**S - Specific**: Who is the ONE reader?\n**U - Unique & Useful**: Does it change how they think, feel, or act?\n**C - Clear, Curious, Conversational**: Does it read like talking to a friend?\n**K - Kept Simple & Structured**: Simple ideas, clear structure?\n**S - Sticky**: Are there memorable phrases they''ll repeat?\n\n### Sticky Sentence Techniques\n\nWhen identifying signature sentences in Phase 2, look for these techniques:\n\n**Alliteration** — Same starting sounds\n- \"Specificity is the secret\"\n- \"The best jobs are neither decreed nor degreed\"\n\n**Symmetry** — Parallel structure\n- \"Read for awareness. Write for understanding.\"\n- \"It''s not 10,000 hours. It''s 10,000 iterations.\"\n\n**Contrast** — Opposing ideas\n- \"To be everywhere is to be nowhere.\"\n- \"Be clear, not clever. Concise, not complex.\"\n\n**Rhythm** — Pleasing cadence\n- Sentence length variation for effect\n- Short sentences for emphasis\n- Longer sentences for flow\n\nInclude the writer''s use of these techniques in your voice skill.\n\n### AI Tells to Eliminate\n\nWhen using your voice skill, watch for these patterns that signal AI involvement:\n\n**The Correlative Construction** (most common):\n- ❌ \"X aren''t just Y - they''re Z\"\n- ❌ \"It''s not about X, it''s about Y\"\n\n**Forbidden Openers**:\n- ❌ \"In the ever-evolving world of...\"\n- ❌ \"Gone are the days when...\"\n- ❌ \"Let that sink in\"\n\n**Hedging Language**:\n- ❌ \"This might help you\" → \"This will help you\"\n- ❌ \"It could be argued...\" → state it directly\n\n**Overused Softeners**:\n- Too much \"just\" and \"actually\"\n- Passive voice (\"was determined\")\n- Corporate jargon\n\n**Test:** For each sentence, ask: Would this appear in ChatGPT output? If yes, rewrite it.\n\n---\n\n## Using Your Voice Skill\n\nSave to: `.claude/skills/voice-[name]/SKILL.md`\n\n**Invoke alongside other skills:**\n- `voice-[name]` + `anti-ai-writing` = Authentic, humanized content\n- `voice-[name]` + `ghostwriter` = Long-form pieces in voice\n- `voice-[name]` + `social-content-creation` = Platform-specific posts\n\n**Update as needed:**\nYour voice evolves. Revisit the skill quarterly or when something feels off.\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **anti-ai-writing** — Core humanization engine (use with all voice work)\n- **ghostwriter** — For long-form content in someone else''s voice\n- **transcript-polisher** — For interview-based content\n\n---\n\n*One well-crafted voice skill compounds across everything you create.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:59:02.150Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Natural Language Processing Agents needing advanced writing style analysis and pattern recognition capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Natural Language Processing Agents 需要高级写作风格分析和模式识别能力。","ja":"Natural Language Processing Agents が高度な文章スタイル分析とパターン認識機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Natural Language Processing Agents 가 고급 글쓰기 스타일 분석 및 패턴 인식 기능을 필요로 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Lenguaje Natural que necesitan un análisis avanzado de estilo de escritura y capacidades de reconocimiento de patrones.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement de Langue Naturelle ayant besoin d''une analyse avancée de style d''écriture et de capacités de reconnaissance de modèles.","de":"Perfekt für Natural Language Processing-Agents, die eine erweiterte Schreibstilanalyse und Mustererkennungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Linguagem Natural que necessitam de análise avançada de estilo de escrita e capacidades de reconhecimento de padrões.","ru":"Идеально для агентов обработки естественного языка, требующих продвинутого анализа стиля письма и возможностей распознавания образов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل معالجة اللغة الطبيعية التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم للنمط الكتابي وقدرات التعرف على الأنماط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture the nuances of any writing style by extracting patterns across multiple dimensions, including vocabulary, sentence length, and idea unfolding, using techniques such as voice matching and rhythm analysis, and supporting formats like text samples.","zh":"赋予代理人通过从多个维度（包括词汇、句子长度和思想展开）提取模式的能力，以捕捉任何写作风格的细微差别，使用诸如语音匹配和节奏分析等技术，并支持诸如文本样本等格式。","ja":"エージェントが声のマッチングやリズム分析などのテクニックを使用して、文書のスタイルのニュアンスを捉え、テキストサンプルなどのフォーマットをサポートすることで、複数の次元（語彙、文の長さ、アイデアの展開など）を横断してパターンを抽出する機能を提供します。","ko":"다중 차원（어휘, 문장 길이, 아이디어 전개 등）에서 패턴을 추출하여 모든 글쓰기 스타일의 세부 사항을 포착할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 음성 일치 및 리듬 분석 등의 기술을 사용하며, 텍스트 샘플 등과 같은 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar las nuances de cualquier estilo de escritura al extraer patrones en múltiples dimensiones, incluyendo vocabulario, longitud de oración e idea desplegada, utilizando técnicas como la coincidencia de voz y el análisis de ritmo, y soportando formatos como muestras de texto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer les nuances de n''importe quel style d''écriture en extrayant des modèles sur plusieurs dimensions, notamment le vocabulaire, la longueur de phrase et le déroulement des idées, en utilisant des techniques telles que la correspondance de voix et l''analyse de rythme, et en prenant en charge des formats tels que des échantillons de texte.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Nuancen eines beliebigen Schreibstils zu erfassen, indem sie Muster über mehrere Dimensionen hinweg extrahieren, einschließlich Vokabular, Satzlänge und Ideenentfaltung, unter Verwendung von Techniken wie Voice-Matching und Rhythmusanalyse und Unterstützung von Formaten wie Textproben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar as nuances de qualquer estilo de escrita, extraíndo padrões em várias dimensões, incluindo vocabulário, comprimento de frase e desenvolvimento de ideias, utilizando técnicas como correspondência de voz e análise de ritmo, e suportando formatos como amostras de texto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить нюансы любого стиля письма, извлекая закономерности в нескольких измерениях, включая словарный запас, длину предложения и развертывание идей, используя такие методы, как сопоставление голоса и анализ ритма, и поддерживая форматы, такие как образцы текста.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من التقاط الدقة في أي نمط كتابي من خلال استخلاص الأنماط عبر أبعاد متعددة، بما في ذلك المفردات وطول الجملة وتنمية الأفكار، باستخدام تقنيات مثل مطابقة الصوت وتحليل الإيقاع، ودعم تنسيقات مثل عينات النص."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing authorial voice in literary texts","Generating content with a specific writing style","Identifying patterns in customer feedback and reviews"],"zh":["文学文本中的作者声音分析","具有特定写作风格的内容生成","客户反馈和评论中的模式识别"],"ja":["文学テキスト内の著者声分析","特定の文章スタイルでコンテンツを生成する","顧客のフィードバックやレビュー内のパターン識別"],"ko":["문학 텍스트의 저자 목소리 분석","특정 글쓰기 스타일로 콘텐츠 생성","고객 피드백 및 리뷰 내의 패턴 식별"],"es":["Analizar la voz autoral en textos literarios","Generar contenido con un estilo de escritura específico","Identificar patrones en comentarios y reseñas de clientes"],"fr":["Analyser la voix de l''auteur dans les textes littéraires","Générer du contenu avec un style d''écriture spécifique","Identifier des modèles dans les commentaires et les avis des clients"],"de":["Analyse der Autorenstimme in literarischen Texten","Erzeugen von Inhalten mit einem bestimmten Schreibstil","Identifizierung von Mustern in Kundenfeedback und -bewertungen"],"pt":["Analisar a voz autoral em textos literários","Gerar conteúdo com um estilo de escrita específico","Identificar padrões em feedback e avaliações de clientes"],"ru":["Анализ авторского голоса в литературных текстах","Генерация контента с определенным стилем письма","Определение образов в отзывах и обзорах клиентов"],"ar":["تحليل الصوت المؤلف في النصوص الأدبية","إنشاء محتوى بنمط كتابي معين","تحديد الأنماط في反馈 وتقييمات العملاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires representative writing samples","Limited to text-based input"],"zh":["需要代表性的写作样本","仅限于基于文本的输入"],"ja":["代表的な文章サンプルが必要","テキストベースの入力のみに限定される"],"ko":["대표적인 글쓰기 샘플이 필요함","텍스트 기반 입력만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere muestras de escritura representativas","Limitado a entrada basada en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite des échantillons d''écriture représentatifs","Limité à l''entrée basée sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt repräsentative Schreibproben","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Eingabe"],"pt":["Exige amostras de escrita representativas","Limitado a entrada baseada em texto"],"ru":["Требует представительных образцов письма","Ограничен входными данными в виде текста"],"ar":["يتطلب عينات كتابية ممثلة","محدود بالإدخال القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9366dbdf33613f2fbcc5d258022edba0b5bcbe10f26a8cdb461a8d53f946e2a1","qualityScore":31}');
