"Zerg-Testing vs другие","установить Zerg-Testing","руководство по настройке Zerg-Testing","разработка ИИ Агентов","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Zerg-Testing","ما هو Zerg-Testing","بديل Zerg-Testing","Zerg-Testing مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت Zerg-Testing","دليل إعداد Zerg-Testing","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"cipher982","repo":"longhouse","repoPath":"cipher982/longhouse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.984Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zerg-testing","description":"Zerg testing workflow (unit + E2E). Use when running or debugging tests.","bodyPreview":"# Zerg Testing\n\n## Rules\n- Always use Make targets. Never run pytest/bun/playwright directly.\n\n## Core Commands\n```bash\nmake test                # unit tests\nmake test-e2e-core       # core E2E (must pass 100%)\nmake test-e2e            # full E2E (retries ok)\nmake test-all            # unit + full E2E\nmake test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts\nmake test-e2e-errors     # show last E2E errors\nmake test-e2e-verbose    # full output for debugging\n```\n\n## Debugging Flow\n1) `make test-e2e-errors`\n2) `m","body":"# Zerg Testing\n\n## Rules\n- Always use Make targets. Never run pytest/bun/playwright directly.\n\n## Core Commands\n```bash\nmake test                # unit tests\nmake test-e2e-core       # core E2E (must pass 100%)\nmake test-e2e            # full E2E (retries ok)\nmake test-all            # unit + full E2E\nmake test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts\nmake test-e2e-errors     # show last E2E errors\nmake test-e2e-verbose    # full output for debugging\n```\n\n## Debugging Flow\n1) `make test-e2e-errors`\n2) `make test-e2e-single TEST=tests/<spec>.ts`\n3) `make test-e2e-verbose`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:59:28.188Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing comprehensive end-to-end testing capabilities using Make targets and Pytest.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Make 