 à Instructure Canvas LMS","Intégration d''outils d''agents IA","Prise en charge de MCP Server","Mise en œuvre de techniques d''inférence bayésienne","Développement d''agents logiciels personnalisés"],"de":["Verbindung zu Instructure Canvas LMS","Integration von KI-Agenten-Tools","Unterstützung für MCP Server","Implementierung von bayesschen Inferenztechniken","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Software-Agenten"],"pt":["Conexão ao Instructure Canvas LMS","Suporte a estatística bayesiana","Desenvolvimento de soluções de aprendizado personalizado","Integração com MCP Server","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de aprendizado"],"ru":["Соединение с Instructure Canvas LMS","Поддержка байесовской статистики","Разработка решений для персонализированного обучения","Интеграция с MCP Server","Поддержка нескольких сред обучения"],"ar":["الارتباط بالانستروكشر كانفاس نظام إدارة التعلم","دعم الإحصاء البيزي","تطوير حلول للتعلم المخصص","التكامل مع مخدم MCP","دعم بيئات تعلم متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Bayesian Reasoning Agents","Instructure Canvas LMS","如何使用Bayesian Reasoning Agents","什么是AI智能代理","Bayesian Reasoning Agents安装","Bayesian Reasoning Agents设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Bayesian Reasoning Agents","Instructure Canvas LMS","Bayesian Reasoning Agentsの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Bayesian Reasoning Agentsのインストール","Bayesian Reasoning Agentsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Bayesian Reasoning Agents","Instructure Canvas LMS","Bayesian Reasoning Agents 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Bayesian Reasoning Agents 설치","Bayesian Reasoning Agents 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de AI","qué es un agente de razonamiento bayesiano","MCP Server alternativa","agentes de AI vs agentes de software","instalación de MCP Server","guía de configuración de agentes de AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser des agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de raisonnement bayésien","alternative à MCP Server","agents IA vs agents logiciels","installation de MCP Server","guide de configuration des agents IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein bayesscher Reasoning-Agent","MCP Server-Alternative","KI-Agenten vs Software-Agenten","Installation von MCP Server","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Agenten"],"pt":["como usar agentes de raciocínio bayesiano","o que são agentes de IA","MCP Server alternativa","agentes de raciocínio bayesiano vs outros agentes","instalar agentes de raciocínio bayesiano","guia de configuração de agentes de raciocínio bayesiano"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агенты байесовского рассуждения","что такое ИИ агенты","MCP Server альтернатива","ИИ агенты байесовского рассуждения vs другие агенты","установить ИИ агенты байесовского рассуждения","руководство по настройке ИИ агентов байесовского рассуждения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الاستدلال البيزي","ما هي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل مخدم MCP","وكلاء الاستدلال البيزي مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت وكلاء الاستدلال البيزي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الاستدلال البيزي"]}},"owner":"sweeden-ttu","repo":"canvas-lms-mcp","repoPath":"sweeden-ttu/canvas-lms-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.031Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bayesian-reasoning-agents","description":"Implements three Bayesian sub-agents for hypothesis-driven development. Use when generating hypotheses, designing experiments, evaluating evidence, performing backwards reasoning from effects to causes, finding conditional variables, verifying results, or creating git worktree schemas. Agent 1 generates hypotheses and schemas; Agent 2 evaluates evidence and creates worktrees; Agent 3 performs backwards probability reasoning to find causes.","bodyPreview":"# Bayesian Reasoning Agents\n\nThree-agent system for hypothesis-driven development using Bayesian reasoning and git worktrees.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        Bayesian Orchestrator                             │\n├───────────────────┬─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤\n│   Agent 1:        │   Agent 2:          │   Agent 3:                    │\n│   Hypothesis      │   Evidence","body":"# Bayesian Reasoning Agents\n\nThree-agent system for hypothesis-driven development using Bayesian reasoning and git worktrees.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        Bayesian Orchestrator                             │\n├───────────────────┬─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤\n│   Agent 1:        │   Agent 2:          │   Agent 3:                    │\n│   Hypothesis      │   Evidence          │   Backwards                   │\n│   Generator       │   Evaluator         │   Reasoner                    │\n├───────────────────┼─────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┤\n│ - Hypotheses      │ - Evaluate evidence │ - P(Cause|Effect)             │\n│ - Experiments     │ - Update beliefs    │ - Conditional variables       │\n│ - Predictions     │ - Verify results    │ - Causal graphs               │\n│ - WT Schemas      │ - Create worktrees  │ - Suggest hypotheses          │\n└───────────────────┴─────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘\n         │                    │                        │\n         ▼                    ▼                        ▼\n   worktree_schemas/    worktrees/branch-*     Causal Network\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nuv add numpy scipy pydantic\n```\n\n```python\nfrom agents.bayesian import (\n    BayesianOrchestrator,\n    OrchestratorConfig,\n)\n\n# Initialize orchestrator with all three agents\norchestrator = BayesianOrchestrator()\n\n# Set up causal network for backwards reasoning\norchestrator.setup_causal_network(\n    variables=[\n        {\"name\": \"bug_in_code\", \"description\": \"A bug exists in the code\"},\n        {\"name\": \"test_failure\", \"description\": \"Tests are failing\"},\n        {\"name\": \"recent_change\", \"description\": \"Recent code change\"},\n    ],\n    causal_links=[\n        {\"cause\": \"bug_in_code\", \"effect\": \"test_failure\", \"strength\": 0.8},\n        {\"cause\": \"recent_change\", \"effect\": \"bug_in_code\", \"strength\": 0.6},\n    ]\n)\n\n# Reason from observation\nresult = orchestrator.reason_from_observation(\n    observation=\"Tests started failing after deployment\",\n    observation_vars={\"test_failure\": \"true\"}\n)\n\nprint(result[\"hypotheses\"])\n```\n\n## Agent 1: Hypothesis Generator\n\n**Responsibilities:**\n- Generate testable hypotheses from observations\n- Assign prior probabilities using domain knowledge\n- Design experiments with success criteria\n- Create worktree schemas for parallel exploration\n\n**Key Methods:**\n\n```python\nfrom agents.bayesian import HypothesisGeneratorAgent\n\ngenerator = HypothesisGeneratorAgent()\n\n# Generate a hypothesis with prior probability\nhypothesis = generator.generate_hypothesis(\n    statement=\"The performance regression is caused by the new caching layer\",\n    rationale=\"Caching was recently modified and correlates with slowdown\",\n    predictions=[\"Disabling cache improves performance\", \"Cache hit ratio is abnormal\"],\n    prior=0.6,  # 60% prior probability\n)\n\n# Design experiment to test hypothesis\nexperiment = generator.design_experiment(\n    hypothesis=hypothesis,\n    description=\"Benchmark with cache disabled\",\n    expected_outcome=\"Latency returns to baseline\",\n    success_criteria=\"p95 latency < 100ms\",\n)\n\n# Create worktree schema for parallel exploration\nschema = generator.create_worktree_schema(hypothesis)\n```\n\n## Agent 2: Evidence Evaluator\n\n**Responsibilities:**\n- Evaluate experimental evidence\n- Update beliefs using Bayes'' theorem: P(H|E) = P(E|H) * P(H) / P(E)\n- Form refined hypotheses when results are inconclusive\n- Create git worktrees from schemas for parallel exploration\n\n**Key Methods:**\n\n```python\nfrom agents.bayesian import EvidenceEvaluatorAgent\n\nevaluator = EvidenceEvaluatorAgent()\n\n# Evaluate evidence from experiment\nevidence = evaluator.evaluate_evidence(\n    experiment=experiment,\n    observation=\"Latency improved to 85ms with cache disabled\",\n    matches_prediction=True,\n    strength=0.8,  # Strong evidence\n)\n\n# Update hypothesis belief using Bayes'' theorem\nupdated_belief = evaluator.update_belief(hypothesis, evidence)\nprint(f\"Prior: {hypothesis.belief.prior:.2%}\")\nprint(f\"Posterior: {updated_belief.posterior:.2%}\")\n\n# Create worktree from schema\nworktree_path = evaluator.create_worktree_from_schema(schema)\n```\n\n## Agent 3: Backwards Reasoner\n\n**Responsibilities:**\n- Calculate inverse conditional probabilities P(Cause|Effect)\n- Find conditional variables for reasoning\n- Build and query causal graphs\n- Suggest hypotheses based on most likely causes\n\n**Key Methods:**\n\n```python\nfrom agents.bayesian import BackwardsReasonerAgent\n\nreasoner = BackwardsReasonerAgent()\n\n# Add variables to causal network\nreasoner.add_variable(\"bug_in_code\", description=\"A bug exists\")\nreasoner.add_variable(\"test_failure\", description=\"Tests are failing\")\nreasoner.add_variable(\"memory_leak\", description=\"Memory leak present\")\n\n# Add causal links with conditional probabilities\nreasoner.add_causal_link(\n    cause=\"bug_in_code\",\n    effect=\"test_failure\",\n    strength=0.8,\n    conditional_probs={\n        (\"true\", \"true\"): 0.85,   # P(test_fail|bug) = 0.85\n        (\"true\", \"false\"): 0.15,\n        (\"false\", \"true\"): 0.1,   # P(test_fail|no_bug) = 0.1\n        (\"false\", \"false\"): 0.9,\n    }\n)\n\n# Calculate backwards probability\nprob = reasoner.calculate_backwards_probability(\n    cause_var=\"bug_in_code\",\n    cause_value=\"true\",\n    effect_var=\"test_failure\",\n    effect_value=\"true\",\n)\nprint(f\"P(bug|test_failure) = {prob:.2%}\")\n\n# Query for most likely causes of an effect\nquery = reasoner.query_causes(\"test_failure\", \"true\")\nprint(query.results)  # {\"bug_in_code\": 0.85, \"memory_leak\": 0.2, ...}\n\n# Find conditional variables for reasoning\nrelevant = reasoner.find_conditional_variables(\n    target_var=\"test_failure\",\n    observed_vars=[\"recent_change\"]\n)\n\n# Suggest hypotheses based on backwards reasoning\nsuggestions = reasoner.suggest_hypotheses_from_effect(\"test_failure\", \"true\")\n```\n\n## Worktree Schema Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_id\": \"wts-a1b2c3d4\",\n  \"hypothesis\": \"Feature X causes performance regression\",\n  \"hypothesis_id\": \"hyp-x1y2z3\",\n  \"branch_name\": \"experiment/hyp-x1y2z3-feature-x-causes-perfo\",\n  \"worktree_path\": null,\n  \"prior_probability\": 0.6,\n  \"posterior_probability\": null,\n  \"experiments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"exp-001\",\n      \"description\": \"Benchmark with Feature X disabled\",\n      \"expected_outcome\": \"Performance returns to baseline\",\n      \"success_criteria\": \"p95 < 100ms\",\n      \"status\": \"designed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"evidence_collected\": [],\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-01-30T12:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Full Workflow Example\n\n```python\nfrom agents.bayesian import BayesianOrchestrator\n\n# Initialize\norchestrator = BayesianOrchestrator()\n\n# Step 1: Set up causal network (Agent 3)\norchestrator.setup_causal_network(\n    variables=[\n        {\"name\": \"cache_bug\", \"description\": \"Bug in caching layer\"},\n        {\"name\": \"db_slow\", \"description\": \"Database queries slow\"},\n        {\"name\": \"high_latency\", \"description\": \"High API latency observed\"},\n    ],\n    causal_links=[\n        {\"cause\": \"cache_bug\", \"effect\": \"high_latency\", \"strength\": 0.7},\n        {\"cause\": \"db_slow\", \"effect\": \"high_latency\", \"strength\": 0.8},\n    ]\n)\n\n# Step 2: Reason from observation (uses all 3 agents)\nresult = orchestrator.reason_from_observation(\n    observation=\"API latency increased by 50%\",\n    observation_vars={\"high_latency\": \"true\"}\n)\n\n# Step 3: Get backwards analysis\nprint(\"Most likely causes:\", result[\"backwards_analysis\"][\"combined_most_likely_causes\"])\n\n# Step 4: Hypotheses were auto-generated\nfor h in result[\"hypotheses\"]:\n    print(f\"Hypothesis: {h[''statement'']} (prior: {h[''prior'']:.2%})\")\n\n# Step 5: Run experiments and evaluate results\neval_result = orchestrator.evaluate_experiment_result(\n    experiment_id=result[\"hypotheses\"][0][\"id\"] + \"_exp\",\n    observation=\"Cache hit ratio dropped to 40%\",\n    matches_prediction=True,\n    strength=0.75,\n)\n\nprint(f\"Posterior: {eval_result[''posterior'']:.2%}\")\nprint(f\"Status: {eval_result[''status'']}\")\n\n# Step 6: Create worktrees for parallel exploration\nworktrees = orchestrator.create_all_worktrees()\n\n# Step 7: Export report\norchestrator.export_report()\n```\n\n## Bayesian Belief Update\n\nThe system uses Bayes'' theorem to update beliefs:\n\n```\nP(H|E) = P(E|H) * P(H) / P(E)\n\nWhere:\n- P(H|E) = Posterior probability of hypothesis given evidence\n- P(E|H) = Likelihood of evidence if hypothesis is true\n- P(H)   = Prior probability of hypothesis\n- P(E)   = Marginal probability of evidence\n```\n\n**Example update:**\n\n```python\n# Prior: 50% chance hypothesis is true\n# Evidence strongly supports hypothesis (strength=0.8)\n\nbelief = BayesianBelief(prior=0.5)\nupdated = belief.update(evidence_supports=True, strength=0.8)\n\n# Posterior: ~80% chance hypothesis is true\nprint(f\"Posterior: {updated.posterior:.2%}\")\n```\n\n## Backwards Reasoning (Abduction)\n\nAgent 3 performs abductive reasoning - inferring causes from effects:\n\n```\nGiven: Effect E is observed\nFind:  Most likely Cause C\n\nP(C|E) = P(E|C) * P(C) / P(E)\n\nWhere P(E) = Σ P(E|C_i) * P(C_i) for all possible causes\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```python\n# Observation: Tests are failing\n# Question: What caused this?\n\nreasoner.add_causal_link(\"bug\", \"test_failure\", strength=0.8)\nreasoner.add_causal_link(\"flaky_test\", \"test_failure\", strength=0.3)\nreasoner.add_causal_link(\"env_issue\", \"test_failure\", strength=0.5)\n\nquery = reasoner.query_causes(\"test_failure\", \"true\")\n\n# Results (ranked by probability):\n# 1. bug: 0.72\n# 2. env_issue: 0.45\n# 3. flaky_test: 0.28\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- [ ] Start with well-defined causal structures\n- [ ] Use informative priors based on domain knowledge\n- [ ] Design experiments with clear success criteria\n- [ ] Update beliefs incrementally with each piece of evidence\n- [ ] Use backwards reasoning to identify non-obvious causes\n- [ ] Create worktrees for parallel hypothesis exploration\n- [ ] Refine hypotheses when evidence is inconclusive\n- [ ] Export reports for documentation and review\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:18:15.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Hypothesis-Driven Agents requiring advanced Bayesian reasoning and git worktree integration for data-driven decision making.","zh":"适用于需要高级贝叶斯推理和git worktree集成的假设驱动型代理，用于数据驱动的决策。","ja":"ベイズ推論とgit worktreeの統合を必要とする仮説駆動型エージェントにとって最適です。","ko":"고급 베이즈 추론과 git worktree 통합이 필요한 가설 주도 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes basados en hipótesis que requieren razonamiento bayesiano avanzado y la integración de git worktree para la toma de decisiones basada en datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur des hypothèses nécessitant un raisonnement bayésien avancé et une intégration de git worktree pour la prise de décision basée sur les données.","de":"Ideal für hypothesengetriebene Agenten, die erweitertes bayesisches Denken und git worktree-Integration für datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Hipótese impulsionados que exigem raciocínio bayesiano avançado e integração de git worktree para tomada de decisões baseada em dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, основанных на гипотезах, требующих продвинутого байесовского рассуждения и интеграции git worktree для принятия решений на основе данных.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهيئة المتنقلة الذي يتطلب التفكير البيزي المتقدم وتكامل git worktree للاتخاذ القرارات المعتمد على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Bayesian reasoning for hypothesis-driven development, utilizing git worktrees for efficient collaboration and version control, and integrating with the MCP Server for seamless connectivity to Instructure Canvas LMS.","zh":"赋予代理利用贝叶斯推论进行假设驱动开发的能力，使用git worktrees进行高效的协作和版本控制，并与MCP Server集成以实现与Instructure Canvas LMS的无缝连接。","ja":"エージェントがベイズ推論を使用して仮説駆動開発を行うことを可能にし、git worktreesを使用して効率的なコラボレーションとバージョン管理を行い、MCP Serverと統合してInstructure Canvas LMSへのシームレスな接続を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 베이즈 추론을 사용하여 가설 주도 개발을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, git worktrees를 사용하여 효율적인 협업과 버전 관리를 수행하며, MCP Server와 통합하여 Instructure Canvas LMS에 대한 무결점 연결을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el razonamiento bayesiano para el desarrollo basado en hipótesis, utilizando git worktrees para una colaboración y control de versiones eficientes, e integrándose con el servidor MCP para una conectividad transparente a Instructure Canvas LMS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le raisonnement bayésien pour le développement basé sur des hypothèses, en utilisant les git worktrees pour une collaboration et un contrôle de version efficaces, et en s''intégrant au serveur MCP pour une connectivité transparente à Instructure Canvas LMS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bayesisches Denken für hypothesengetriebene Entwicklung zu nutzen, indem sie git worktrees für effiziente Zusammenarbeit und Versionskontrolle verwenden und sich mit dem MCP-Server für nahtlose Konnektivität zu Instructure Canvas LMS integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o raciocínio bayesiano para desenvolvimento orientado por hipóteses, utilizando git worktrees para colaboração eficiente e controle de versão, e integrando com o servidor MCP para conectividade sem interrupção ao Instructure Canvas LMS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать байесовское рассуждение для разработки, основанной на гипотезах, используя git worktrees для эффективного сотрудничества и контроля версий, и интегрируя с сервером MCP для бесперебойного подключения к Instructure Canvas LMS.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على استخدام التفكير البيزي لتطوير الهيئة المتنقلة الموجهة بالفرضية، باستخدام git worktrees للتعاون الفعال ومراقبة الإصدار، والدمج مع خادم MCP للاتصال السلس إلى Instructure Canvas LMS."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing hypothesis-driven models using Bayesian reasoning","Automating evidence collection and analysis with git worktree management","Integrating with Instructure Canvas LMS for streamlined educational content delivery"],"zh":["使用贝叶斯推论开发假设驱动模型","使用git worktree管理自动化证据收集和分析","与Instructure Canvas LMS集成以实现流畅的教育内容交付"],"ja":["ベイズ推論を使用して仮説駆動型モデルを開発する","git worktree管理を使用して証拠の収集と分析を自動化する","Instructure Canvas LMSと統合して教育コンテンツのストリーミング配信を実現する"],"ko":["베이즈 추론을 사용하여 가설 주도 모델을 개발하는 것","git worktree 관리를 사용하여 증거 수집 및 분석을 자동화하는 것","Instructure Canvas LMS와 통합하여 교육 콘텐츠의 원활한 전달을实现하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar modelos basados en hipótesis utilizando el razonamiento bayesiano","Automatizar la recopilación y el análisis de evidencia con la gestión de git worktree","Integrarse con Instructure Canvas LMS para la entrega de contenido educativo optimizada"],"fr":["Développer des modèles basés sur des hypothèses en utilisant le raisonnement bayésien","Automatiser la collecte et l''analyse des preuves avec la gestion des git worktrees","S''intégrer à Instructure Canvas LMS pour une livraison de contenu éducatif rationalisée"],"de":["Entwickeln hypothesengetriebener Modelle unter Verwendung des bayesischen Denkens","Automatisieren der Beweissammlung und -analyse mit der Verwaltung von git worktrees","Integration mit Instructure Canvas LMS für eine optimierte Lieferung von Bildungsinhalten"],"pt":["Desenvolver modelos orientados por hipóteses usando raciocínio bayesiano","Automatizar coleta e análise de evidências com gerenciamento de git worktree","Integrar com Instructure Canvas LMS para entrega de conteúdo educacional otimizada"],"ru":["Разработка моделей, основанных на гипотезах, с использованием байесовского рассуждения","Автоматизация сбора и анализа доказательств с помощью управления git worktree","Интеграция с Instructure Canvas LMS для оптимизированной доставки образовательного контента"],"ar":["تطوير نماذج الهيئة المتنقلة الموجهة بالفرضية باستخدام التفكير البيزي","توسيع جمع وتحليل الأدلة بإدارة git worktree","التكامل مع Instructure Canvas LMS لتسليم المحتوى التعليمي المتدفق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git worktree setup and configuration","Dependent on MCP Server for Instructure Canvas LMS connectivity","Limited to Bayesian reasoning and hypothesis-driven development applications"],"zh":["需要git worktree设置和配置","依赖MCP Server进行Instructure Canvas LMS连接","仅限于贝叶斯推论和假设驱动开发应用"],"ja":["git worktreeの設定と構成が必要","Instructure Canvas LMS接続にはMCP Serverに依存する","ベイズ推論と仮説駆動開発アプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["git worktree 설정 및 구성이 필요","Instructure Canvas LMS 연결에는 MCP Server에 의존","베이즈 추론 및 가설 주도 개발 응용 프로그램으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la configuración y el ajuste de git worktree","Depende del servidor MCP para la conectividad con Instructure Canvas LMS","Limitado a aplicaciones de razonamiento bayesiano y desarrollo basado en hipótesis"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de git worktree","Dépend du serveur MCP pour la connectivité à Instructure Canvas LMS","Limité aux applications de raisonnement bayésien et de développement basé sur des hypothèses"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung und Konfiguration von git worktree","Hängt vom MCP-Server für die Konnektivität zu Instructure Canvas LMS ab","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen des bayesischen Denkens und der hypothesengetriebenen Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação de git worktree","Dependente do servidor MCP para conectividade com Instructure Canvas LMS","Limitado a aplicações de raciocínio bayesiano e desenvolvimento orientado por hipóteses"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации git worktree","Зависит от сер