bapp-creation"},"description":{"zh":"Vue Web应用创建和ERP Next定制，使用AI智能工具提高开发效率","ja":"Vue Webアプリケーション作成とERP Nextカスタマイズ，AIエージェントを使用して開発効率を向上させる","ko":"Vue 웹앱 생성과 ERP Next 사용자 정의，AI 에이전트를 사용하여 개발 효율성을 높임","es":"Creación de aplicaciones web con Vue y ERP Next. Personaliza tus aplicaciones con herramientas de AI","fr":"Création d''applications web avec Vue et ERP Next. Personnalisez vos applications avec des outils d''IA","de":"Erstellung von Webanwendungen mit Vue und ERP Next. Passen Sie Ihre Anwendungen mit KI-Tools an","pt":"A ferramenta de IA para criação de aplicativos web com Vue e ERP Next Customizações permite desenvolvedores criar soluções personalizadas.","ru":"Инструмент ИИ для создания веб-приложений с Vue и настройками ERP Next позволяет разработчикам создавать индивидуальные решения.","ar":"أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء تطبيقات الويب باستخدام Vue و تخصيصات ERP Next تمكن المطورين من إنشاء حلول مخصصة.","en":"ERP Next Customizations"},"definition":{"en":"ERP Next Customizations"},"features":{"zh":["使用Vue.js创建Web应用","ERP Next定制和个性化设置","AI智能工具提高开发效率","支持多种开发框架和库","简化开发过程和工作流程"],"ja":["Vue.jsを使用してWebアプリケーションを作成","ERP Nextカスタマイズと個別設定","AIエージェントを使用して開発効率を向上させる","複数の開発フレームワークとライブラリをサポート","開発プロセスとワークフローを簡素化"],"ko":["Vue.js를 사용하여 웹애플리케이션을 생성","ERP Next 사용자 정의와 개별 설정","AI 에이전트를 사용하여 개발 효율성을 높임","다수의 개발 프레임워크와 라이브러리를 지원","개발 프로세스와 워크플ロー를 단순화"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones web personalizadas","Integración con ERP Next","Uso de herramientas de AI para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Desarrollo rápido y eficiente","Personalización de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Création d''applications web personnalisées","Intégration avec ERP Next","Utilisation d''outils d''IA pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Développement rapide et efficace","Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Webanwendungen","Integration mit ERP Next","Nutzen von KI-Tools zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Schnelles und effizientes Entwickeln","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos web personalizados com Vue","Integração com ERP Next para gerenciamento de negócios","Ferramentas de IA para automação de tarefas","Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos e plataformas"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных веб-приложений с Vue","Интеграция с ERP Next для управления бизнесом","Инструменты ИИ для автоматизации задач","Быстрое и эффективное развитие","Поддержка нескольких устройств и платформ"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات الويب المخصصة باستخدام Vue","التكامل مع ERP Next لإدارة الأعمال","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للتحكم الآلي في المهام","التطوير السريع والفعال","دعم متعددة الأجهزة والمنصات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue Web应用创建","ERP Next定制","AI智能工具","Vue.js开发","ERP系统个性化","如何使用Vue.js创建Web应用","Vue Web应用创建教程","ERP Next定制指南"],"ja":["Vue Webアプリケーション作成","ERP Nextカスタマイズ","AIエージェント","Vue.js開発","ERPシステム個別設定","Vue.jsを使用してWebアプリケーションを作成する方法","Vue Webアプリケーション作成チュートリアル","ERP Nextカスタマイズガイド"],"ko":["Vue 웹앱 생성","ERP Next 사용자 정의","AI 에이전트","Vue.js 개발","ERP 시스템 개별 설정","Vue.js를 사용하여 웹애플리케이션을 생성하는 방법","Vue 웹앱 생성 튜토리얼","ERP Next 사용자 정의 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","creación de aplicaciones web","Vue","ERP Next","desarrollo web","personalización de aplicaciones","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","guias de instalación de Vue","alternativas a React"],"fr":["outils d''IA","création d''applications web","Vue","ERP Next","développement web","personnalisation d''applications","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","guides d''installation de Vue","alternatives à React"],"de":["KI-Tools","Erstellung von Webanwendungen","Vue","ERP Next","Webentwicklung","Anpassung von Anwendungen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Installationsanleitungen für Vue","Alternativen zu React"],"pt":["como usar vue para criar aplicativos web","o que é erp next","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","vue vs react","erp next alternative","instalar vue","guias de setup para erp next"],"ru":["как использовать vue для создания веб-приложений","что такое erp next","инструменты ии для разработчиков","vue vs react","erp next альтернатива","установить vue","руководства по настройке erp next"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام vue لإنشاء تطبيقات الويب","ما هي erp next","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","vue vs react","بديل erp next","تثبيت vue","دليل إعداد erp next"]}},"owner":"ghimirerohan","repo":"erpnextCCDis","repoPath":"ghimirerohan/erpnextCCDis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.103Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-webapp-creation","description":"Create new Vue web applications within the custom_erp Frappe app. Use when the user wants to create a new Vue app, add a new frontend app, create a new PWA, or asks about adding apps like qrpay, pay-dashboard. Covers directory structure, routing, Vite config, Frappe www files, PWA manifest, and deployment.","bodyPreview":"# Vue WebApp Creation in Custom_ERP\n\nThis skill guides you through creating a new Vue web application within the custom_erp Frappe app, from initial setup to production deployment.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nFor a new app called `my-app` at route `/my-app`, you need:\n\n| File/Directory | Purpose |\n|----------------|---------|\n| `my-app/` | Source directory with `index.html` and `src/` |\n| `my-app/src/main.js` | Vue app initialization |\n| `my-app/src/App.vue` | Root component with PWA setup |\n| `my-app/","body":"# Vue WebApp Creation in Custom_ERP\n\nThis skill guides you through creating a new Vue web application within the custom_erp Frappe app, from initial setup to production deployment.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\nFor a new app called `my-app` at route `/my-app`, you need:\n\n| File/Directory | Purpose |\n|----------------|---------|\n| `my-app/` | Source directory with `index.html` and `src/` |\n| `my-app/src/main.js` | Vue app initialization |\n| `my-app/src/App.vue` | Root component with PWA setup |\n| `my-app/src/router.js` | Vue Router with auth guards |\n| `my-app/src/MyApp.vue` | Main page component |\n| `custom_erp/www/my-app.html` | Frappe production entry (hyphenated) |\n| `custom_erp/www/my_app.py` | Frappe context (underscored) |\n| `public/manifest-my-app.json` | PWA manifest |\n| `public/icons/my-app/icon-512x512.png` | App icon |\n| `vite.config.js` | Add to apps array |\n| `build-apps.js` | Add to apps array + theme config |\n\n## Naming Convention\n\n**CRITICAL**: Follow this naming pattern exactly:\n\n| Location | Format | Example |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| Directory & URL | hyphenated | `my-app`, `/my-app` |\n| www/*.html | hyphenated | `my-app.html` |\n| www/*.py | underscored | `my_app.py` |\n| vite.config.js | hyphenated | `''my-app''` |\n| build-apps.js | hyphenated | `''my-app''` |\n| manifest | hyphenated | `manifest-my-app.json` |\n| Router base | hyphenated | `/my-app` |\n\n---\n\n## Step-by-Step Creation Process\n\n### Step 1: Create Directory Structure\n\n```bash\ncd frappe-bench/apps/custom_erp\nmkdir -p my-app/src\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Source Files\n\nCreate all files in this order. See [templates.md](templates.md) for complete file contents.\n\n1. `my-app/index.html` - Dev entry point\n2. `my-app/src/main.js` - Vue initialization\n3. `my-app/src/App.vue` - Root component\n4. `my-app/src/router.js` - Router with auth\n5. `my-app/src/MyApp.vue` - Main component\n\n### Step 3: Update Build Configurations\n\n**vite.config.js** - Add to apps array:\n```javascript\nconst apps = [\n  ''qrpay'',\n  ''my-app'',  // ADD HERE\n  // ... other apps\n]\n```\n\n**build-apps.js** - Add to apps array AND appThemes:\n```javascript\nconst apps = [\n  ''qrpay'',\n  ''my-app'',  // ADD HERE\n  // ...\n]\n\nconst appThemes = {\n  // ...\n  ''my-app'': { \n    theme: ''#3b82f6'',      // Primary color (hex)\n    bg: ''#ffffff'',          // Background color\n    name: ''My App'',         // Display name\n    desc: ''App description'' // PWA description\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Create Frappe WWW Files\n\n**custom_erp/www/my-app.html** (placeholder - build will update):\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/assets/custom_erp/frontend/my-app/favicon.png\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\" />\n    <title>My App - Description</title>\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#3b82f6\" />\n    <meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\" />\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/api/method/custom_erp.api.pwa.get_manifest?app_name=my-app\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"app\"></div>\n    <script>\n        {% for key in boot %}\n        window[\"{{ key }}\"] = {{ boot[key] | tojson }};\n        {% endfor %}\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n**custom_erp/www/my_app.py** (NOTE: underscored filename):\n```python\nimport frappe\n\ndef get_context(context):\n    \"\"\"Context for my-app\"\"\"\n    context.no_cache = 1\n    return context\n```\n\n### Step 5: Create PWA Manifest\n\n**public/manifest-my-app.json**:\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"/my-app/\",\n  \"name\": \"My App\",\n  \"short_name\": \"MyApp\",\n  \"description\": \"App description\",\n  \"start_url\": \"/my-app/\",\n  \"scope\": \"/my-app/\",\n  \"display\": \"standalone\",\n  \"orientation\": \"portrait-primary\",\n  \"background_color\": \"#ffffff\",\n  \"theme_color\": \"#3b82f6\",\n  \"icons\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/assets/custom_erp/icons/my-app/icon-512x512.png\",\n      \"sizes\": \"512x512\",\n      \"type\": \"image/png\",\n      \"purpose\": \"any maskable\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"categories\": [\"business\", \"finance\"],\n  \"prefer_related_applications\": false\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Add App Icon\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p public/icons/my-app\ncp public/icons/qrpay/icon-512x512.png public/icons/my-app/\n```\n\nOr create a custom 512x512 PNG icon.\n\n---\n\n## Testing & Deployment\n\n### Local Development\n```bash\ncd frappe-bench/apps/custom_erp\nyarn dev\n# Access at http://localhost:8080/my-app\n```\n\n### Build for Production\n```bash\ncd frappe-bench/apps/custom_erp\nnode build-apps.js\n```\n\n### Commit & Push\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat: add my-app Vue web application\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### Deploy to Server\n```bash\n# On production server:\ncd ~/frappe-bench/apps/custom_erp\ngit pull origin main\nnode build-apps.js\ncd ~/frappe-bench\nbench build --app custom_erp\nbench restart\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nCopy this checklist when creating a new app:\n\n```\nNew Vue App: [APP_NAME]\n\nDirectory & Source Files:\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/ directory\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/index.html\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/src/main.js\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/src/App.vue\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/src/router.js (base path: /[app-name])\n- [ ] Created [app-name]/src/[AppName].vue\n\nBuild Configuration:\n- [ ] Added to vite.config.js apps array\n- [ ] Added to build-apps.js apps array\n- [ ] Added theme config to build-apps.js appThemes\n\nFrappe Files:\n- [ ] Created custom_erp/www/[app-name].html\n- [ ] Created custom_erp/www/[app_name].py (underscored!)\n\nPWA Assets:\n- [ ] Created public/manifest-[app-name].json\n- [ ] Added icon to public/icons/[app-name]/icon-512x512.png\n\nTesting:\n- [ ] Tested locally with yarn dev\n- [ ] Built with node build-apps.js\n- [ ] Verified at /[app-name] route\n\nDeployment:\n- [ ] Committed and pushed\n- [ ] Pulled on server\n- [ ] Ran node build-apps.js on server\n- [ ] Ran bench build --app custom_erp\n- [ ] Ran bench restart\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues & Solutions\n\n### 404 Errors for Assets\n**Cause**: Build output doesn''t exist or wrong paths\n**Fix**: Run `node build-apps.js` - it generates correct asset hashes\n\n### PWA Manifest 404\n**Cause**: App not in build-apps.js or manifest not generated\n**Fix**: Add to build-apps.js apps array and rebuild\n\n### Login Redirect Loop\n**Cause**: Wrong router base path\n**Fix**: Ensure `createWebHistory(\"/my-app\")` matches your URL\n\n### Python File Not Found\n**Cause**: Wrong filename format\n**Fix**: WWW Python files use underscores: `my_app.py` (not `my-app.py`)\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- See [templates.md](templates.md) for complete file templates\n- See [examples.md](examples.md) for real app examples\n- Reference existing apps: `qrpay/`, `pay-dashboard/`, `qrpay-horlicks/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:34:56.876Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents specializing in Vue.js PWA creation within Frappe/ERPNext ecosystems.","zh":"适合专门从事Vue.js PWA创建的前端开发代理，特别是在Frappe/ERPNext生态系统中。","ja":"Vue.js PWA作成を専門とするフロントエンド開発エージェントに適しています。特にFrappe/ERPNextエコシステム内で。","ko":"Vue.js PWA 생성을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Frappe/ERPNext 생태계 내에서입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend especializados en la creación de PWA de Vue.js dentro de los ecosistemas de Frappe/ERPNext.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Frontend spécialisés dans la création de PWA Vue.js au sein des écosystèmes Frappe/ERPNext.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf die Erstellung von Vue.js-PWA innerhalb von Frappe/ERPNext-Ökosystemen spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend especializados na criação de PWAs Vue.js dentro dos ecossistemas Frappe/ERPNext.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенд-разработки, специализирующихся на создании PWA на Vue.js в экосистемах Frappe/ERPNext.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية المتخصصين في إنشاء تطبيقات Vue.js PWA داخل أنظمة Frappe/ERPNext."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to scaffold and deploy Vue.js Progressive Web Applications directly within Custom_ERP Frappe apps, handling Vue initialization, PWA setup, and production deployment workflows. Agents can rapidly generate web applications with proper routing structure and build configurations.","zh":"使代理能够直接在自定义ERP Frappe应用程序中创建和部署Vue.js渐进式Web应用程序，处理Vue初始化、PWA设置和生产部署工作流。代理可以快速生成具有适当路由结构和构建配置的Web应用程序。","ja":"エージェントがCustom_ERPのFrappeアプリ内でVue.jsプログレッシブWebアプリケーションを直接作成およびデプロイできるようにします。Vueの初期化、PWAの設定、生产デプロイのワークフローを処理します。エージェントは、適切なルーティング構造とビルド設定を備えたWebアプリケーションを迅速に生成できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Custom_ERP의 Frappe 애플리케이션 내에서 직접 Vue.js 프로그레시브 웹 애플리케이션을 생성하고 배포할 수 있도록 합니다. Vue 초기화, PWA 설정, 프로덕션 배포 워크플ロー 등을 처리합니다. 에이전트는 적절한 라우팅 구조와 빌드 구성이 있는 웹 애플리케이션을 신속하게 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y implementar aplicaciones web progresivas de Vue.js directamente dentro de aplicaciones personalizadas de Frappe, manejar la inicialización de Vue, la configuración de PWA y los flujos de trabajo de implementación de producción. Los agentes pueden generar rápidamente aplicaciones web con estructura de enrutamiento y configuraciones de compilación adecuadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de déployer des applications web progressives Vue.js directement au sein des applications Frappe personnalisées, en gérant l''initialisation de Vue, la configuration de PWA et les flux de travail de déploiement de production. Les agents peuvent rapidement générer des applications web avec une structure de routage et des configurations de build appropriées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vue.js-Progressive-Web-Anwendungen direkt innerhalb von benutzerdefinierten Frappe-Apps zu erstellen und bereitzustellen, wobei die Vue-Initialisierung, die PWA-Konfiguration und die Produktionsbereitstellungs-Workflows gehandhabt werden. Agenten können schnell Webanwendungen mit geeigneter Routing-Struktur und Build-Konfigurationen generieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e implantem Aplicações Web Progressivas Vue.js diretamente dentro de aplicativos Custom_ERP Frappe, lidando com a inicialização do Vue, configuração PWA e fluxos de trabalho de implantação em produção. Os agentes podem gerar rapidamente aplicações web com estrutura de roteamento adequada e configurações de build.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и развертывать Progressive Web Applications на Vue.js непосредственно в приложениях Custom_ERP Frappe, обрабатывая инициализацию Vue, настройку PWA и рабочие процессы развертывания в production. Агенты могут быстро генерировать веб-приложения с правильной структурой маршрутизации и конфигурациями сборки.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء ونشر تطبيقات Vue.js Progressive Web مباشرة داخل تطبيقات Custom_ERP Frappe، والتعامل مع تهيئة Vue، وإعداد PWA، وسير عمل النشر للإنتاج. يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء تطبيقات ويب بسرعة بهيكل توجيه مناسب وتكوينات بناء."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Vue.js applications within Frappe environments","Configuring PWA capabilities for offline functionality","Deploying Vue webapps to production from Custom_ERP"],"zh":["在Frappe环境中创建新的Vue.js应用程序","为离线功能配置PWA功能","将Vue Web应用程序从Custom_ERP部署到生产环境"],"ja":["Frappe環境内で新しいVue.jsアプリケーションを作成する","オフライン機能用のPWA機能を構成する","Vue WebアプリケーションをCustom_ERPから生产環境にデプロイする"],"ko":["Frappe 환경 내에서 새로운 Vue.js 애플리케이션을 생성하는 것","오프라인 기능을 위한 PWA 기능을 구성하는 것","Vue 웹 애플리케이션을 Custom_ERP에서 프로덕션 환경으로 배포하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevas aplicaciones Vue.js dentro de entornos de Frappe","Configuración de capacidades de PWA para funcionalidad sin conexión","Implementación de aplicaciones web de Vue en producción desde Custom_ERP"],"fr":["Création de nouvelles applications Vue.js au sein des environnements Frappe","Configuration des capacités de PWA pour la fonctionnalité hors ligne","Déploiement d''applications web Vue en production à partir de Custom_ERP"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Vue.js-Anwendungen innerhalb von Frappe-Umgebungen","Konfiguration von PWA-Funktionen für die Offline-Funktionalität","Bereitstellung von Vue-Webanwendungen in der Produktion von Custom_ERP"],"pt":["Criação de novas aplicações Vue.js em ambientes Frappe","Configuração de capacidades PWA para funcionalidade offline","Implantaçãode webapps Vue em produção a partir do Custom_ERP"],"ru":["Создание новых приложений Vue.js в средах Frappe","Настройка возможностей PWA для работы в автономном режиме","Развертывание Vue веб-приложений в production из Custom_ERP"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات Vue.js جديدة داخل بيئات Frappe","تكوين إمكانيات PWA للعمل في وضع عدم الاتصال","نشر تطبيقات Vue للويب للإنتاج من Custom_ERP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Frappe/Custom_ERP setup","Dependent on specific directory structure (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Vue.js specific implementation only"],"zh":["需要现有的Frappe/Custom_ERP设置","依赖于特定的目录结构（my-app/src/main.js, App.vue）","仅限Vue.js的实现"],"ja":["既存のFrappe/Custom_ERPの設定が必要","特定のディレクトリ構造（my-app/src/main.js, App.vue）に依存","Vue.js専用の実装のみ"],"ko":["既存의 Frappe/Custom_ERP 설정이 필요합니다","특정 디렉토리 구조(my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)에 의존합니다","Vue.js 전용 구현만 가능"],"es":["Requiere una configuración existente de Frappe/Custom_ERP","Dependiente de una estructura de directorio específica (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Implementación específica de Vue.js solo"],"fr":["Exige une configuration existante de Frappe/Custom_ERP","Dépend d''une structure de répertoire spécifique (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Implémentation spécifique de Vue.js uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert eine bestehende Frappe/Custom_ERP-Konfiguration","Abhängig von einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Nur spezifische Implementierung von Vue.js"],"pt":["Requer uma configuração existente do Frappe/Custom_ERP","Dependente de uma estrutura de diretórios específica (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Implementação específica apenas para Vue.js"],"ru":["Требует существующей настройки Frappe/Custom_ERP","Зависит от конкретной структуры каталогов (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","Только для реализации, специфичной для Vue.js"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Frappe/Custom_ERP موجودًا مسبقًا","يعتمد على هيكل دليل محدد (my-app/src/main.js, App.vue)","تنفيذ محدد لـ Vue.js فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d8a8581153e6eb0fb3e683e4b6dc4cf052e122d682e027a9a7efa1f7408b7d94","qualityScore":31}');
