n de tickets CLI minimalista diseñado para Agentes de IA, que simplifica la gestión de tareas","fr":"tk est un système de gestion de tickets CLI minimaliste conçu pour les Agents d''IA, qui simplifie la gestion des tâches","de":"tk ist ein minimales CLI-Ticketsystem für KI-Agents, das die Aufgabenverwaltung vereinfacht","pt":"tk é um sistema de gestão de tickets CLI minimalista projetado para AI Agents","ru":"tk - минимальная CLI система управления тикетами для ИИ Агентов","ar":"tk هو نظام إدارة تذكرة CLI مخصص للأدوات الذكية","en":"Minimal CLI ticket management system designed for AI agents."},"definition":{"en":"Minimal CLI ticket management system designed for AI agents."},"features":{"zh":["极简CLI界面","高效任务管理","支持AI工具","简单易用","提高生产力"],"ja":["シンプルなCLIインターフェース","効率的なタスク管理","AIエージェントをサポート","簡単で使いやすい","生産性の向上"],"ko":["간단한 CLI 인터페이스","효율적인 작업 관리","AI 에이전트 지원","쉬운 사용","생산성 향상"],"es":["Diseño minimalista","Gestión de tickets CLI","Diseñado para Agentes de IA","Simplificación de la gestión de tareas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Conception minimaliste","Gestion de tickets CLI","Conçu pour les Agents d''IA","Simplification de la gestion des tâches","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Minimales Design","CLI-Ticketverwaltung","Für KI-Agents konzipiert","Vereinfachung der Aufgabenverwaltung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Sistema de gestão de tickets CLI minimalista","Projetado para AI Agents","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Gerenciamento de tarefas e tickets","Interface de usuário minimalista"],"ru":["Минимальная CLI система управления тикетами","Проектирование для ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Управление задачами и тикетами","Интерфейс пользователя минимальный"],"ar":["نظام إدارة تذكرة CLI مخصص","تصميم للادوات الذكية","تكامل مع أدوات التطوير","إدارة المهام والتذاكر","واجهة المستخدم المحدودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","CLI票务管理系统","任务管理","tk教程","tk安装","tk替代","如何使用tk","tk vs 其他工具","tk设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","CLIチケット管理システム","タスク管理","tkチュートリアル","tkインストール","tkの代替","tkの使い方","tkと他のツールの比較","tk設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","CLI 티켓 관리 시스템","작업 관리","tk 튜토리얼","tk 설치","tk 대체","tk 사용법","tk와 다른 도구 비교","tk 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar tk","qué es tk","alternativas a tk","tk vs otras herramientas","instalación de tk","guía de configuración de tk","herramientas de desarrollo para Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser tk","qu''est-ce que tk","alternatives à tk","tk vs autres outils","installation de tk","guide de configuration de tk","outils de développement pour les Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man tk verwendet","was ist tk","alternativen zu tk","tk vs andere tools","installation von tk","einrichtungsanleitung für tk","entwicklungstools für KI-Agents"],"pt":["tk","sistema de gestão de tickets","AI Agents","CLI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de tarefas","instalação do tk","guia de configuração do tk"],"ru":["tk","система управления тикетами","ИИ Агенты","CLI","инструменты разработки","управление задачами","установка tk","руководство по настройке tk"],"ar":["tk","نظام إدارة تذكرة","الأدوات الذكية","CLI","أدوات التطوير","إدارة المهام","تثبيت tk","دليل إعداد tk"]}},"owner":"radutopala","repo":"ticket","repoPath":"radutopala/ticket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.142Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tk","description":"Git-backed ticket management for AI agents","bodyPreview":"# tk - Ticket Management\n\nA minimal CLI for tracking tickets as markdown files in `.tickets/`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n```bash\ntk ready              # 1. Find available work\ntk start <id>         # 2. Claim a ticket\ntk show <id>          # 3. Read details\n# ... do the work\ntk close <id>         # 4. Mark complete\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `tk create \"title\"` | Create ticket (returns ID) |\n| `tk show <id>` | View ticket details |\n| `tk start <id>` | Claim","body":"# tk - Ticket Management\n\nA minimal CLI for tracking tickets as markdown files in `.tickets/`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n```bash\ntk ready              # 1. Find available work\ntk start <id>         # 2. Claim a ticket\ntk show <id>          # 3. Read details\n# ... do the work\ntk close <id>         # 4. Mark complete\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `tk create \"title\"` | Create ticket (returns ID) |\n| `tk show <id>` | View ticket details |\n| `tk start <id>` | Claim ticket (set to in_progress) |\n| `tk close <id>` | Complete ticket |\n| `tk reopen <id>` | Revert to open |\n| `tk edit <id>` | Open in $EDITOR |\n\n## Listing & Filtering\n\n```bash\ntk list                      # All tickets\ntk list --status open        # By status (open|in_progress|closed)\ntk list -a alice             # By assignee\ntk list -T urgent            # By tag\ntk ready                     # Open tickets with resolved deps\ntk blocked                   # Tickets with unresolved deps\ntk closed                    # Recently closed\n```\n\n## Create Options\n\n```bash\ntk create \"Fix login bug\" \\\n  -d \"Description text\" \\\n  -t bug \\                   # Type: bug|feature|task|epic|chore\n  -p 1 \\                     # Priority: 0-4 (0=highest)\n  -a alice \\                 # Assignee\n  --parent <epic-id> \\       # Parent ticket\n  --tags ui,urgent           # Tags\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\ntk dep add <id> <depends-on>   # Add dependency\ntk dep remove <id> <dep-id>    # Remove dependency\ntk dep tree                    # Show dependency tree\ntk dep check                   # Check for cycles\n```\n\n## Notes & Links\n\n```bash\ntk add-note <id> \"Progress update\"   # Add timestamped note\ntk link <id1> <id2>                  # Link related tickets\ntk unlink <id1> <id2>                # Remove link\n```\n\n## Export\n\n```bash\ntk query                    # JSON output\ntk query ''.[] | .title''     # With jq filter\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n- Partial ID matching: `tk show a1b` matches `tic-a1b2c3`\n- Tickets stored in `.tickets/` as markdown with YAML frontmatter\n- Git-friendly: commit tickets with your code\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:44:10.661Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing lightweight ticket management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要轻量级票据管理功能的基于CLI的AI代理。","ja":"CLIベースのAIエージェントが軽量なチケット管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"CLI 기반 AI 에이전트가 가벼운 티켓 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan capacidades de gestión de tickets ligeras.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA basés sur CLI ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de tickets légères.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die leichte Ticket-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de tickets leves.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, которым требуются лёгкие возможности управления тикетами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية القائمة على CLI الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إدارة التذاكر الخفيفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage tickets as markdown files in `.tickets/` using core commands like `tk create`, `tk show`, and `tk close`, streamlining workflow with minimal CLI interactions.","zh":"赋予代理管理`.tickets/`中的票据作为markdown文件的能力，使用诸如`tk create`、`tk show`和`tk close`的核心命令，简化工作流程，尽量减少CLI交互。","ja":"`tk create`、`tk show`、`tk close`などのコアコマンドを使用して、`.tickets/`内のチケットをMarkdownファイルとして管理できるようにエージェントに権限を与え、ワークフローを最小限のCLI操作で簡素化します。","ko":"`tk create`, `tk show`, `tk close` 등의 핵심 명령을 사용하여 `.tickets/` 내의 티켓을 마크다운 파일로 관리할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 최소한의 CLI 상호작용으로 워크플ロー를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar tickets como archivos markdown en `.tickets/` utilizando comandos básicos como `tk create`, `tk show` y `tk close`, optimizando el flujo de trabajo con interacciones mínimas de CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les tickets comme des fichiers markdown dans `.tickets/` en utilisant des commandes de base comme `tk create`, `tk show` et `tk close`, rationalisant le flux de travail avec des interactions CLI minimales.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tickets als Markdown-Dateien in `.tickets/` zu verwalten, indem sie grundlegende Befehle wie `tk create`, `tk show` und `tk close` verwenden, um den Workflow mit minimalen CLI-Interaktionen zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tickets como arquivos markdown em `.tickets/` usando comandos básicos como `tk create`, `tk show` e `tk close`, otimizando o fluxo de trabalho com interações CLI mínimas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять тикетами как markdown-файлами в `.tickets/` с помощью основных команд như `tk create`, `tk show` и `tk close`, оптимизируя рабочий процесс при минимальных взаимодействиях с CLI.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة التذاكر كملفات markdown في `.tickets/` باستخدام أوامر أساسية مثل `tk create` و `tk show` و `tk close`، ويتوافق مع تدفق العمل مع تفاعلات CLI أقل."},"useCases":{"en":["Claiming and managing tickets with `tk start` and `tk close`","Creating new tickets with `tk create`","Tracking ticket status with `tk show`"],"zh":["使用`tk start`和`tk close`申领和管理票据","使用`tk create`创建新票据","使用`tk show`跟踪票据状态"],"ja":["`tk start`と`tk close`を使用してチケットを申請および管理する","`tk create`を使用して新しいチケットを作成する","`tk show`を使用してチケットの状態を追跡する"],"ko":["`tk start` 및 `tk close`를 사용하여 티켓을 청구 및 관리하는 것","`tk create`를 사용하여 새로운 티켓을 생성하는 것","`tk show`를 사용하여 티켓 상태를 추적하는 것"],"es":["Reclamar y gestionar tickets con `tk start` y `tk close`","Crear nuevos tickets con `tk create`","Seguir el estado de los tickets con `tk show`"],"fr":["Réclamer et gérer les tickets avec `tk start` et `tk close`","Créer de nouveaux tickets avec `tk create`","Suivre l''état des tickets avec `tk show`"],"de":["Tickets mit `tk start` und `tk close` beanspruchen und verwalten","Erstellen Sie neue Tickets mit `tk create`","Verfolgen Sie den Status der Tickets mit `tk show`"],"pt":["Reivindicar e gerenciar tickets com `tk start` e `tk close`","Criar novos tickets com `tk create`","Rastrear status do ticket com `tk show`"],"ru":["Претендовать и управлять тикетами с помощью `tk start` и `tk close`","Создавать новые тикеты с помощью `tk create`","Отслеживать статус тикета с помощью `tk show`"],"ar":["إدعاء وإدارة التذاكر باستخدام `tk start` و `tk close`","إنشاء تذاكر جديدة باستخدام `tk create`","تتبع حالة التذكرة باستخدام `tk show`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local filesystem access for `.tickets/` directory","CLI-based interaction only","Markdown file format for tickets"],"zh":["需要`.tickets/`目录的本地文件系统访问权限","仅支持CLI交互","票据仅支持Markdown文件格式"],"ja":["`.tickets/`ディレクトリへのローカルファイルシステムアクセスが必要","CLIベースのインタラクションのみをサポート","チケットはMarkdownファイル形式のみをサポート"],"ko":["`.tickets/` 디렉토리에 대한 로컬 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요함","CLI 기반 상호작용만 지원함","티켓은 마크다운 파일 형식만 지원함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos local para el directorio `.tickets/`","Interacción basada en CLI solo","Formato de archivo markdown para tickets"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers local pour le répertoire `.tickets/`","Interaction basée sur CLI uniquement","Format de fichier markdown pour les tickets"],"de":["Benötigt lokalen Dateisystemzugriff für das Verzeichnis `.tickets/`","Nur CLI-basierte Interaktion","Markdown-Dateiformat für Tickets"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos local para o diretório `.tickets/`","Interação baseada em CLI apenas","Formato de arquivo markdown para tickets"],"ru":["Требует доступа к локальной файловой системе для директории `.tickets/`","Только взаимодействие на основе CLI","Формат файла markdown для тикетов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات المحلي لمجلد `.tickets/`","التفاعل القائم على CLI فقط","تنسيق ملف markdown للتذاكر"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"413ece83edcb25e512d858da0e09e0e3ea43f7d898ccc0e9a751cd8ffa003038","qualityScore":31}');
