مع Next.js و TypeScript","en":"commit"},"description":{"zh":"个人网站_commit，使用Next.js、TypeScript和MDX构建，具有现代化的网页开发特性","ja":"個人サイト_commit、Next.jsとTypeScript、MDXを使用して構築、最新のWeb開発特性を備える","ko":"개인 웹사이트_commit, Next.js, TypeScript, MDX로 구축, 최신 웹 개발 특성 보유","es":"Mi sitio web personal, construido con Next.js, TypeScript y MDX, utilizando herramientas de commit para un desarrollo eficiente","fr":"Mon site web personnel, construit avec Next.js, TypeScript et MDX, en utilisant les outils de commit pour un développement efficace","de":"Meine persönliche Website, erstellt mit Next.js, TypeScript und MDX, mit Commit-Tools für eine effiziente Entwicklung","pt":"O Commit é um site pessoal construído com Next.js, TypeScript e MDX, oferecendo uma experiência de usuário de alta qualidade","ru":"Commit - это личный сайт, построенный с помощью Next.js, TypeScript и MDX, предлагающий высококачественный пользовательский опыт","ar":"Commit هو موقع شخصي مبني على Next.js و TypeScript و MDX، يوفر تجربة مستخدم عالية الجودة","en":"My personal website. Built with Next.js, TypeScript, and MDX"},"definition":{"en":"My personal website. Built with Next.js, TypeScript, and MDX"},"features":{"zh":["使用Next.js构建","TypeScript支持","MDX集成","goatcounter分析","mailchimp集成","reach-ui组件"],"ja":["Next.jsを使用して構築","TypeScript対応","MDX統合","goatcounter分析","mailchimp統合","reach-uiコンポーネント"],"ko":["Next.js로 구축","TypeScript 지원","MDX 통합","goatcounter 분석","mailchimp 통합","reach-ui 컴포넌트"],"es":["Desarrollo con Next.js","Integración con TypeScript","Uso de MDX para contenido","Implementación con Netlify","Integración con Reach UI","Compatibilidad con React"],"fr":["Développement avec Next.js","Intégration avec TypeScript","Utilisation de MDX pour le contenu","Mise en œuvre avec Netlify","Intégration avec Reach UI","Compatibilité avec React"],"de":["Entwicklung mit Next.js","Integration mit TypeScript","Verwendung von MDX für Inhalte","Implementierung mit Netlify","Integration mit Reach UI","Kompatibilität mit React"],"pt":["Desenvolvido com Next.js","Utiliza TypeScript para tipagem estática","Integração com MDX para conteúdo","Compatível com GoatCounter e Mailchimp","Utiliza Reach-UI para acessibilidade"],"ru":["Разработан с помощью Next.js","Использует TypeScript для статической типизации","Интеграция с MDX для контента","Совместим с GoatCounter и Mailchimp","Использует Reach-UI для доступности"],"ar":["تم تطويره باستخدام Next.js","يستخدم TypeScript لنظام التأشير الثابت","التكامل مع MDX لتحسين المحتوى","متوافق مع GoatCounter و Mailchimp","يستخدم Reach-UI لتحسين الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Next.js","TypeScript入门","MDX教程","goatcounter替代","mailchimp集成","reach-ui组件库","commit安装","commit设置指南"],"ja":["Next.jsの使い方","TypeScript入門","MDXチュートリアル","goatcounterの代替","mailchimp統合","reach-uiコンポーネントライブラリ","commitのインストール","commitの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Next.js 사용법","TypeScript 시작하기","MDX 튜토리얼","goatcounter 대체","mailchimp 통합","reach-ui 컴포넌트 라이브러리","commit 설치","commit 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de commit","desarrollo web con Next.js","TypeScript para principiantes","MDX tutorial","Netlify alternativas","Reach UI vs Material UI","instalación de React","guía de configuración de Next.js"],"fr":["outils de commit","développement web avec Next.js","TypeScript pour débutants","tutoriel MDX","alternatives à Netlify","Reach UI vs Material UI","installation de React","guide de configuration de Next.js"],"de":["Commit-Tools","Webentwicklung mit Next.js","TypeScript für Anfänger","MDX-Tutorial","Netlify-Alternativen","Reach UI vs Material UI","React-Installation","Next.js-Konfigurationshandbuch"],"pt":["como usar Next.js","o que é TypeScript","Commit vs Gatsby","instalar Commit","guia de configuração do Commit","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","desenvolvimento web com Next.js","tipos de sites pessoais"],"ru":["как использовать Next.js","что такое TypeScript","Commit vs Gatsby","установка Commit","руководство по настройке Commit","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","веб-разработка с Next.js","типы личных сайтов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Next.js","ما هو TypeScript","Commit مقابل Gatsby","تثبيت Commit","دليل إعداد Commit","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","تطوير الويب مع Next.js","أنواع المواقع الشخصية"]}},"owner":"zachsnoek","repo":"zachsnoek.com","repoPath":"zachsnoek/zachsnoek.com","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T02:53:45Z","topics":["blog","goatcounter","mailchimp","mdx","netlify","nextjs","reach-ui","react","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Generate descriptive commit messages by analyzing git diffs.","bodyPreview":"## What I do\n\n- Generate descriptive commit messages by analyzing git diffs.\n- Avoid vague descriptions like \"helps with documents\", \"processes data\", or \"does stuff with files\".\n- Follow the conventional-commits format described in `AGENTS.md` for every message.\n- After committing, push the branch so the upstream stays in sync.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse when the user asks for help writing commit messages or reviewing staged changes.","body":"## What I do\n\n- Generate descriptive commit messages by analyzing git diffs.\n- Avoid vague descriptions like \"helps with documents\", \"processes data\", or \"does stuff with files\".\n- Follow the conventional-commits format described in `AGENTS.md` for every message.\n- After committing, push the branch so the upstream stays in sync.\n\n## When to use\n\nUse when the user asks for help writing commit messages or reviewing staged changes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:22:55.342Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents needing precise Git version control and commit message generation.","zh":"非常适合需要精确 Git 版本控制和提交消息生成的开发 Agent。","ja":"正確な Git バージョン管理とコミットメッセージ生成を必要とする開発エージェントに理想的です。","ko":"정확한 Git 버전 관리와 커밋 메시지 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Development Agents que necesitan un control de versiones de Git preciso y generación de mensajes de commit.","fr":"Idéal pour les Development Agents nécessitant un contrôle de version Git précis et une génération de messages de commit.","de":"Ideal für Development Agents, die eine präzise Git-Versionskontrolle und Commit-Nachrichtengenerierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de um controlo de versão Git preciso e geração de mensagens de commit.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется точный контроль версий Git и создание сообщений о коммитах.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تحكم دقيق في إصدارات Git وإنشاء رسائل commit."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate descriptive commit messages using conventional-commits format, analyze git diffs, and push branches for upstream synchronization, leveraging Next.js, TypeScript, and MDX.","zh":"赋能 Agent 使用 conventional-commits 格式生成描述性提交消息、分析 git diffs 以及推送分支以实现上游同步，并利用 Next.js、TypeScript 和 MDX。","ja":"Next.js、TypeScript、MDX を活用し、conventional-commits フォーマットを使用して記述的なコミットメッセージを生成し、git diff を分析し、上流同期のためにブランチをプッシュする機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"Next.js, TypeScript, MDX를 활용하여 conventional-commits 형식으로 설명적인 커밋 메시지를 생성하고, git diff를 분석하여 정확한 변경 사항 추적을 하며, 업스트ream 동기화를 위해 브랜치 푸시를 자동화하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar mensajes de commit descriptivos utilizando el formato conventional-commits, analizar git diffs y enviar ramas para sincronización ascendente, aprovechando Next.js, TypeScript y MDX.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des messages de commit descriptifs en utilisant le format conventional-commits, d''analyser les git diffs et de pousser des branches pour la synchronisation en amont, en tirant parti de Next.js, TypeScript et MDX.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, beschreibende Commit-Nachrichten im conventional-commits-Format zu generieren, git diffs zur präzisen Änderungsverfolgung zu analysieren und Branches zur Upstream-Synchronisierung zu pushen, unter Nutzung von Next.js, TypeScript und MDX.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar mensagens de commit descritivas usando o formato conventional-commits, analisar git diffs para um acompanhamento preciso de alterações e enviar branches para sincronização upstream, aproveitando Next.js, TypeScript e MDX.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать описательные сообщения о коммитах с использованием формата conventional-commits, анализировать git diffs для точного отслеживания изменений и отправлять ветки для вышестоящей синхронизации, используя Next.js, TypeScript и MDX.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسائل commit وصفيّة باستخدام تنسيق conventional-commits، وتحليل git diffs لتتبع التغييرات بدقة، ودفع الفروع للمزامنة upstream، مستفيدًا من Next.js و TypeScript و MDX."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating descriptive commit messages","Analyzing git diffs for precise change tracking","Automating branch pushing for upstream synchronization"],"zh":["生成描述性提交消息","分析 git diffs 以实现精确的变更跟踪","自动化分支推送以实现上游同步"],"ja":["記述的なコミットメッセージの生成","正確な変更追跡のための git diff の分析","上流同期のためのブランチの自動プッシュ"],"ko":["설명적인 커밋 메시지 생성","정확한 변경 추적을 위한 git diff 분석","업스트림 동기화를 위한 브랜치 푸시 자동화"],"es":["Generación de mensajes de commit descriptivos","Análisis de git diffs para un seguimiento preciso de los cambios","Automatización del envío de ramas para la sincronización ascendente"],"fr":["Génération de messages de commit descriptifs","Analyse des git diffs pour un suivi précis des changements","Automatisation de la poussée de branches pour la synchronisation en amont"],"de":["Generieren beschreibender Commit-Nachrichten","Analysieren von git diffs zur präzisen Änderungsverfolgung","Automatisieren des Branch-Pushings zur Upstream-Synchronisierung"],"pt":["Geração de mensagens de commit descritivas","Análise de git diffs para um acompanhamento preciso de alterações","Automatização do envio de branches para sincronização upstream"],"ru":["Создание описательных сообщений о коммитах","Анализ git diffs для точного отслеживания изменений","Автоматическая отправка веток для вышестоящей синхронизации"],"ar":["إنشاء رسائل commit وصفيّة","تحليل git diffs لتتبع التغييرات بدقة","أتمتة دفع الفروع للمزامنة upstream"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Conventional-commits format adherence","Next.js, TypeScript, and MDX compatibility"],"zh":["需要安装 Git","需遵守 conventional-commits 格式","需要与 Next.js、TypeScript 和 MDX 兼容"],"ja":["Git のインストールが必要","conventional-commits フォーマットへの準拠","Next.js、TypeScript、MDX との互換性が必要"],"ko":["Git 설치 필요","conventional-commits 형식 준수","Next.js, TypeScript, MDX 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Git","Adherencia al formato conventional-commits","Compatibilidad con Next.js, TypeScript y MDX"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Respect du format conventional-commits","Compatibilité avec Next.js, TypeScript et MDX"],"de":["Erfordert eine Git-Installation","Einhaltung des conventional-commits-Formats","Kompatibilität mit Next.js, TypeScript und MDX"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Conformidade com o formato conventional-commits","Compatibilidade com Next.js, TypeScript e MDX"],"ru":["Требует установки Git","Соблюдение формата conventional-commits","Совместимость с Next.js, TypeScript и MDX"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Git","الالتزام بتنسيق conventional-commits","التوافق مع Next.js و TypeScript و MDX"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6df1038ac01af846188fd6771754c03ecc8225e69fa11f1267e2969bdb4b62cb","qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ebongard/renfield/git-workflow', 'community', 'ebongard', 'renfield', 'ebongard/renfield', 'git-workflow', 1, 2, 30, '2026-02-25T11:49:18Z', '2026-02-26T13:25:54.337Z', 'eac8bed60118dbc9eccc0853360a0e977f8021d09cfcd4be6e2243dd1ac31ea3', '{"id":"ebongard/renfield/git-workflow","name":"git-workflow","description":{"zh":"Git Workflow是一款自托管AI助手，支持100+工具集成，采用FastAPI + React + Ollama构建，提供离线使用和RAG知识库","ja":"Git Workflowはセルフホスト型AIエージェントで、100以上のツールを統合、FastAPI + React + Ollamaで構築、オフライン使用とRAGナレッジベースを提供","ko":"Git Workflow는 셀프 호스팅 AI 에이전트로, 100 이상의 도구를 통합, FastAPI + React + Ollama로 구축, 오프라인 사용과 RAG 지식베이스를 제공","es":"git-workflow es un asistente de IA autoalojado construido con FastAPI, React y Ollama, con más de 100 integraciones de herramientas","fr":"git-workflow est un agent IA autohébergé construit avec FastAPI, React et Ollama, avec plus de 100 intégrations d''outils","de":"git-workflow ist ein selbstgehosteter KI-Assistent, der mit FastAPI, React und Ollama erstellt wurde, mit über 100 Tool-Integrationen","pt":"O agente AI de fluxo de trabalho Git é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento autônoma com 100+ integrações de ferramentas e capacidade offline total, construída com FastAPI + React + Ollama.","ru":"ИИ агент для Git Workflow - это самодостаточный инструмент для разработчиков с 100+ интеграциями инструментов и полной离线-способностью, построенный на FastAPI + React + Ollama.","ar":"وكيل إدارة العمل_git هو أداة مطورين ذاتية الحفظ مع أكثر من 100 تكامل أداة وقدرة完全 بدون اتصال، مبني على FastAPI + React + Ollama.","en":"Self-hosted AI assistant with voice satellites, 100+ tool integrations, RAG knowledge base, and full offline capability. Built with FastAPI + React + Ollama."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能助手 - Git Workflow","ja":"AIエージェント - Git Workflow","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Git Workflow","es":"Asistentes de IA: git-workflow",