4.0.12","Mod mit Open-Source-Code"],"pt":["Melhoria de Looting","Recursos de Questing avançados","Integração com MedicBuddy","Compatibilidade com SPT 4.0.12","Melhoria da experiência de jogo","Ferramentas de IA personalizadas"],"ru":["Улучшение Looting","Продвинутые функции Questing","Интеграция с MedicBuddy","Совместимость с SPT 4.0.12","Улучшение игрового опыта","Пользовательские инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["تحسين Looting","ميزات Questing متقدمة","التكامل مع MedicBuddy","التوافق مع SPT 4.0.12","تحسين تجربة اللعبة","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bepinex","SPT 4.0.12","AI 优化模组","Looting","Questing","MedicBuddy","游戏体验增强","AI智能工具","SPT 4.0.12 优化"],"ja":["Bepinex","SPT 4.0.12","AI エージェント強化モッド","Looting","Questing","MedicBuddy","ゲーム体験向上","AIエージェント","SPT 4.0.12 向け"],"ko":["Bepinex","SPT 4.0.12","AI 에이전트 최적화 모듈","Looting","Questing","MedicBuddy","게임 경험 향상","AI 에이전트","SPT 4.0.12 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de AI para juegos","mods de IA para SPT","cómo instalar bepinex","bepinex vs otros mods","guía de configuración de bepinex","mejora de la experiencia de juego con IA","desarrollo de mods de IA","IA en juegos de rol"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour jeux","mods d''IA pour SPT","comment installer bepinex","bepinex vs autres mods","guide de configuration de bepinex","amélioration de l''expérience de jeu avec l''IA","développement de mods d''IA","IA dans les jeux de rôle"],"de":["KI-Tools für Spiele","KI-Mods für SPT","wie man bepinex installiert","bepinex vs andere Mods","Konfigurationsanleitung für bepinex","Verbesserung der Spiel-Erfahrung mit KI","Entwicklung von KI-Mods","KI in Rollenspielen"],"pt":["como usar bepinex","o que é bepinex","bepinex alternativa","bepinex vs outros mods","instalar bepinex","guia de configuração do bepinex","ferramentas de IA para jogos","melhorias de jogo com bepinex"],"ru":["как использовать bepinex","что такое bepinex","бepinex альтернатива","бepinex vs другие моды","установить bepinex","руководство по настройке bepinex","инструменты ИИ для игр","улучшение игрового опыта с bepinex"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام bepinex","ما هو bepinex","بepinex بديل","بepinex مقابل mods أخرى","تثبيت bepinex","دليل إعداد bepinex","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي للعبة","تحسين تجربة اللعبة مع bepinex"]}},"owner":"Blackhorse311","repo":"BotMind","repoPath":"Blackhorse311/BotMind","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T10:44:45Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bepinex","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# BepInEx Skill\n\nBepInEx is the plugin framework for Unity game modding. This project uses BepInEx 5.x with .NET Standard 2.1 for SPT (Single Player Tarkov) modding. Plugins are loaded via `[BepInPlugin]` attributes and use `ConfigFile` for settings. All patches use **Harmony** (see the **harmony** skill).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Plugin Entry Point\n\n```csharp\n[BepInPlugin(\"com.blackhorse311.botmind\", \"BotMind\", \"1.0.0\")]\n[BepInDependency(\"xyz.drakia.bigbrain\", BepInDependency.DependencyFlags.HardDe","body":"# BepInEx Skill\n\nBepInEx is the plugin framework for Unity game modding. This project uses BepInEx 5.x with .NET Standard 2.1 for SPT (Single Player Tarkov) modding. Plugins are loaded via `[BepInPlugin]` attributes and use `ConfigFile` for settings. All patches use **Harmony** (see the **harmony** skill).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Plugin Entry Point\n\n```csharp\n[BepInPlugin(\"com.blackhorse311.botmind\", \"BotMind\", \"1.0.0\")]\n[BepInDependency(\"xyz.drakia.bigbrain\", BepInDependency.DependencyFlags.HardDependency)]\n[BepInDependency(\"me.sol.sain\", BepInDependency.DependencyFlags.SoftDependency)]\npublic class BotMindPlugin : BaseUnityPlugin\n{\n    public static ManualLogSource Log { get; private set; }\n    \n    private void Awake()\n    {\n        Log = Logger;\n        Log.LogInfo(\"BotMind is loading...\");\n        \n        // Initialize configuration\n        BotMindConfig.Initialize(Config);\n        \n        // Apply Harmony patches\n        new Harmony(\"com.blackhorse311.botmind\").PatchAll();\n        \n        Log.LogInfo(\"BotMind loaded successfully!\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Configuration Binding\n\n```csharp\npublic static class BotMindConfig\n{\n    public static ConfigEntry<bool> EnableLooting { get; private set; }\n    public static ConfigEntry<float> SearchRadius { get; private set; }\n    \n    public static void Initialize(ConfigFile config)\n    {\n        EnableLooting = config.Bind(\n            \"General\",           // Section\n            \"Enable Looting\",    // Key\n            true,                // Default\n            \"Enable bot looting behavior\"  // Description\n        );\n        \n        SearchRadius = config.Bind(\n            \"Looting\",\n            \"Search Radius\",\n            50f,\n            new ConfigDescription(\n                \"Loot search distance in meters\",\n                new AcceptableValueRange<float>(10f, 200f)\n            )\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n| Concept | Usage | Example |\n|---------|-------|---------|\n| Plugin GUID | Unique identifier | `\"com.author.modname\"` |\n| Hard dependency | Required mod | `DependencyFlags.HardDependency` |\n| Soft dependency | Optional mod | `DependencyFlags.SoftDependency` |\n| ConfigEntry | Runtime setting | `config.Bind(\"Section\", \"Key\", default)` |\n| ManualLogSource | Logging | `Logger.LogInfo(\"message\")` |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Soft Dependency Check\n\n**When:** Integrating with optional mods like SAIN\n\n```csharp\nprivate static bool _sainChecked;\nprivate static bool _sainAvailable;\n\npublic static bool IsSAINAvailable()\n{\n    if (!_sainChecked)\n    {\n        _sainAvailable = Chainloader.PluginInfos.ContainsKey(\"me.sol.sain\");\n        _sainChecked = true;\n    }\n    return _sainAvailable;\n}\n```\n\n### Lifecycle Hooks\n\n**When:** Responding to game events\n\n```csharp\nprivate void Awake()    // Plugin load - register patches, config\nprivate void Start()    // After all plugins loaded\nprivate void OnEnable() // Plugin enabled\nprivate void OnDisable() // Plugin disabled\nprivate void OnDestroy() // Cleanup resources\n```\n\n## See Also\n\n- [patterns](references/patterns.md) - Plugin structure, config, logging\n- [workflows](references/workflows.md) - Build, deploy, debug\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **harmony** - Patching game methods\n- **csharp** - Language patterns\n- **unity** - MonoBehaviour lifecycle\n- **dotnet** - Build and project configuration"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T12:57:16.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Unity Game Modding Agents requiring advanced plugin management and Harmony patching capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级插件管理和Harmony补丁功能的Unity游戏模组代理。","ja":"高度なプラグイン管理とHarmonyパッチ機能を必要とするUnityゲームModエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 플러그인 관리 및 Harmony 패칭 기능이 필요한 Unity 게임 모딩 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Modificación de Juegos de Unity que requieren una gestión de plugins avanzada y capacidades de parcheo de Harmony.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Modification de Jeux Unity nécessitant une gestion de plugins avancée et des capacités de patching de Harmony.","de":"Ideal für Unity-Spiel-Modding-Agents, die eine erweiterte Plugin-Verwaltung und Harmony-Patching-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de modding de jogos Unity que exigem gerenciamento avançado de plugins e capacidades de patching Harmony.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга игр Unity, требующих продвинутого управления плагинами и возможностей патчинга Harmony.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إضافة مودات ألعاب Unity التي تتطلب إدارة متقدمة للبرامج الإضافية وقدرات التصحيح المتماثل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load plugins via BepInPlugin attributes, utilize ConfigFile for settings, and leverage Harmony for patching, all within the Unity game modding ecosystem using .NET Standard 2.1.","zh":"使代理能够在Unity游戏模组生态系统中使用.NET Standard 2.1，通过BepInPlugin属性加载插件，利用ConfigFile进行设置，并利用Harmony进行补丁。","ja":"UnityゲームModエコシステム内で.NET Standard 2.1を使用し、BepInPlugin属性を介したプラグインの読み込み、ConfigFileを使用した設定の管理、およびHarmonyを活用したパッチ適用をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"Unity 게임 모딩 생태계에서 .NET Standard 2.1을 사용하여 BepInPlugin 속성을 통해 플러그인을 로드하고, ConfigFile로 설정을 관리하며, Harmony를 활용해 패칭을 적용하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes cargar plugins a través de atributos BepInPlugin, utilizar ConfigFile para la configuración y aprovechar Harmony para el parcheo, todo dentro del ecosistema de modificación de juegos de Unity utilizando .NET Standard 2.1.","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger des plugins via des attributs BepInPlugin, d''utiliser ConfigFile pour les paramètres et d''exploiter Harmony pour le patching, le tout au sein de l''écosystème de modification de jeux Unity en utilisant .NET Standard 2.1.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Plugins über BepInPlugin-Attribute zu laden, ConfigFile für Einstellungen zu verwenden und Harmony für das Patches zu nutzen, alles innerhalb des Unity-Spiel-Modding-Ökosystems unter Verwendung von .NET Standard 2.1.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar plugins via atributos BepInPlugin, utilizar ConfigFile para configurações e aproveitar Harmony para patching, tudo dentro do ecossistema de modding de jogos Unity usando .NET Standard 2.1.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью загружать плагины через атрибуты BepInPlugin, использовать ConfigFile для настроек и использовать Harmony для патчинга, все это в экосистеме моддинга игр Unity, используя .NET Standard 2.1.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من تحميل البرامج الإضافية عبر سمات BepInPlugin، واستخدام ConfigFile للتعريفات، وتحقيق ميزات التصحيح المتماثل، كل ذلك داخل نظام إضافة مودات ألعاب Unity باستخدام .NET Standard 2.1."},"useCases":{"en":["Loading custom plugins for SPT modding","Configuring plugin settings with ConfigFile","Applying Harmony patches for game modifications"],"zh":["为SPT模组加载自定义插件","使用ConfigFile配置插件设置","应用Harmony补丁进行游戏修改"],"ja":["SPT Mod用のカスタムプラグインの読み込み","ConfigFileを使用したプラグイン設定の構成","ゲーム改変のためのHarmonyパッチの適用"],"ko":["SPT 모딩을 위한 사용자 정의 플러그인 로드","ConfigFile로 플러그인 설정 구성","게임 수정을 위한 Harmony 패치 적용"],"es":["Carga de plugins personalizados para la modificación de SPT","Configuración de la configuración del plugin con ConfigFile","Aplicación de parches de Harmony para la modificación del juego"],"fr":["Chargement de plugins personnalisés pour la modification SPT","Configuration des paramètres de plugin avec ConfigFile","Application de correctifs de Harmony pour la modification du jeu"],"de":["Laden von benutzerdefinierten Plugins für SPT-Modding","Konfiguration der Plugin-Einstellungen mit ConfigFile","Anwenden von Harmony-Patches für Spielmodifikationen"],"pt":["Carregar plugins personalizados para modding SPT","Configurar configurações de plugin com ConfigFile","Aplicar patches Harmony para modificações de jogo"],"ru":["Загрузка пользовательских плагинов для моддинга SPT","Настройка параметров плагина с помощью ConfigFile","Применение патчей Harmony для модификации игры"],"ar":["تحميل البرامج الإضافية المخصصة لتعديل SPT","تكوين إعدادات البرامج الإضافية باستخدام ConfigFile","تطبيق تصحيحات متماثلة للتعديلات اللعبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires BepInEx 5.x and .NET Standard 2.1","Limited to Unity game modding","Dependent on Harmony for patching"],"zh":["需要BepInEx 5.x和.NET Standard 2.1","仅限于Unity游戏模组","依赖Harmory进行补丁"],"ja":["BepInEx 5.xと.NET Standard 2.1が必要","UnityゲームModに限定される","パッチ適用はHarmoryに依存"],"ko":["BepInEx 5.x 및 .NET Standard 2.1 필요","Unity 게임 모딩으로 제한됨","패칭 적용을 위해 Harmony에 의존"],"es":["Requiere BepInEx 5.x y .NET Standard 2.1","Limitado a la modificación de juegos de Unity","Dependiente de Harmony para el parcheo"],"fr":["Nécessite BepInEx 5.x et .NET Standard 2.1","Limité à la modification de jeux Unity","Dépendant de Harmony pour le patching"],"de":["Erfordert BepInEx 5.x und .NET Standard 2.1","Begrenzt auf Unity-Spiel-Modding","Abhängig von Harmony für das Patches"],"pt":["Exige BepInEx 5.x e .NET Standard 2.1","Limitado ao modding de jogos Unity","Dependente de Harmony para patching"],"ru":["Требует BepInEx 5.x и .NET Standard 2.1","Ограничен моддингом игр Unity","Зависит от Harmony для патчинга"],"ar":["يتطلب BepInEx 5.x و .NET Standard 2.1","محدود بإضافة مودات ألعاب Unity","يعتمد على ميزات التصحيح المتماثل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fc392c828bfd68b8549e2d0f8af63c0b03f25dbd17c764c113400304e2c9efe3","qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MK-vet/bact-mdr-profiler/selfcheck', 'community', 'MK-vet', 'bact-mdr-profiler', 'MK-vet/bact-mdr-profiler', 'selfcheck', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-25T14:32:41Z', '2026-03-01T07:11:42.072Z', '4370d59fd99b5f5bc921750722e8efdff0231e846490b63972bfa50eb381702e', '{"id":"MK-vet/bact-mdr-profiler/selfcheck","name":"selfcheck","description":{"zh":"BactMDRProfiler是一种用于分析细菌耐药性数据的AI智能工具，能够发现因果关系，提高抗生素治疗效果","ja":"BactMDRProfilerは、細菌の耐薬性データを分析し、因果関係を発見して、抗生素治療の効果を高めるAIエージェントです","ko":"BactMDRProfiler는细菌의 항생제 내성 데이터를 분석하여 인과관계를 발견하고 항생제 치료 효과를 높이는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"BactMDRProfiler es una herramienta de IA para el perfilado de resistencia a múltiples fármacos en bacterias","fr":"BactMDRProfiler est un outil d''IA pour le profilage de la résistance multimedicamenteuse chez les bactéries","de":"BactMDRProfiler ist ein KI-Tool für die Profilierung der Multidrug-Resistenz bei Bakterien","pt":"O BactMDRProfiler é uma ferramenta de IA que realiza perfis de resistência a múltiplos fármacos em bactérias. Ele utiliza descoberta causal para analisar dados de resistência bacteriana.","ru":"BactMDRProfiler - это ИИ Агент, который выполняет профилирование мультирезистентности бактерий. Он использует причинно-следственный анализ для анализа данных бактериальной резистентности.","ar":"BactMDRProfiler هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تقوم بتحليل مقاومة البكتيريا المتعددة للأدوية. وهي تستخدم اكتشاف السبب في تحليل بيانات مقاومة البكتيريا.","en":"BactMDRProfiler: Multidrug resistance profiling with causal discovery for bacterial AMR data"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：BactMDRProfiler抗生素耐药性分析","ja":"AIエージェント：BactMDRProfilerによる抗生素耐薬性プロファイリング","ko":"AI 에이전트: BactMDRProfiler를 이용한 항생제 내성 분석","es":"Herramientas de IA: Perfilado de resistencia a múltiples ...","fr":"Outils d''IA : Profilage de résistance multimedicamenteuse...","de":"KI-Tools: Multidrug-Resistenz-P