ilisateur réutilisables","Écrans de composant","Tests unitaires"],"de":["Sichere Projektstruktur","Initialisierung von Projekten mit Spezifikationen","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript","Wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Bildschirmkomponenten","Einheitliche Tests"],"pt":["Inicialização de projeto segura","Specs-driven para garantir a qualidade","Arquitetura de projeto escalável","Componentes de UI reutilizáveis","Serviços de negócios puros sem React"],"ru":["Безопасная инициализация проекта","Specs-driven для обеспечения качества","Масштабируемая архитектура проекта","Переиспользуемые компоненты UI","Чистые сервисы бизнес-логики без React"],"ar":["تهيئة مشروع آمنة","المواصفات التي تقود لضمان الجودة","هندسة مشروع متوسعة","مكونات واجهة المستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","خدمات تجارية نقية بدون رياكت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","移动应用开发","安全性","高效性","TypeScript","项目初始化","React Native Skill"],"ja":["React Native","モバイルアプリ開発","セキュリティ","効率性","TypeScript","プロジェクト初期化","React Native Skill"],"ko":["React Native","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","보안","효율성","TypeScript","프로젝트 초기화","React Native Skill"],"es":["React Native","seguridad en aplicaciones móviles","especificaciones de proyecto","TypeScript","componentes de interfaz de usuario","pruebas unitarias","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["React Native","sécurité des applications mobiles","spécifications de projet","TypeScript","composants d''interface utilisateur","tests unitaires","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["React Native","Sicherheit in mobilen Anwendungen","Projektspezifikationen","TypeScript","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten","Einheitliche Tests","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["React Native","Inicialização de projeto","Segurança","Specs","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis","Arquitetura de projeto","Componentes de UI","Serviços de negócios"],"ru":["React Native","Инициализация проекта","Безопасность","Specs","Разработка мобильных приложений","Архитектура проекта","Компоненты UI","Сервисы бизнес-логики"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تهيئة مشروع","الأمان","المواصفات","تطوير تطبيقات 移 động","هندسة مشروع","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","خدمات تجارية"]}},"owner":"alinaqi","repo":"claude-bootstrap","repoPath":"alinaqi/claude-bootstrap","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native","description":"React Native mobile patterns, platform-specific code","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skill\n\n*Load with: base.md + typescript.md*\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── src/\n│   ├── core/                   # Pure business logic (no React)\n│   │   ├── types.ts\n│   │   └── services/\n│   ├── components/             # Reusable UI components\n│   │   ├── Button/\n│   │   │   ├── Button.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Button.test.tsx\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts            # Barrel export\n│   ├── screens/                # Screen components\n│   │   ├── Home/\n│","body":"# React Native Skill\n\n*Load with: base.md + typescript.md*\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── src/\n│   ├── core/                   # Pure business logic (no React)\n│   │   ├── types.ts\n│   │   └── services/\n│   ├── components/             # Reusable UI components\n│   │   ├── Button/\n│   │   │   ├── Button.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Button.test.tsx\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts            # Barrel export\n│   ├── screens/                # Screen components\n│   │   ├── Home/\n│   │   │   ├── HomeScreen.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── useHome.ts      # Screen-specific hook\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts\n│   ├── navigation/             # Navigation configuration\n│   ├── hooks/                  # Shared custom hooks\n│   ├── store/                  # State management\n│   └── utils/                  # Utilities\n├── __tests__/\n├── android/\n├── ios/\n└── CLAUDE.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Functional Components Only\n```typescript\n// Good - simple, testable\ninterface ButtonProps {\n  label: string;\n  onPress: () => void;\n  disabled?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ label, onPress, disabled = false }: ButtonProps): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <Pressable onPress={onPress} disabled={disabled}>\n      <Text>{label}</Text>\n    </Pressable>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Extract Logic to Hooks\n```typescript\n// useHome.ts - all logic here\nexport function useHome() {\n  const [items, setItems] = useState<Item[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n\n  const refresh = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    const data = await fetchItems();\n    setItems(data);\n    setLoading(false);\n  }, []);\n\n  return { items, loading, refresh };\n}\n\n// HomeScreen.tsx - pure presentation\nexport function HomeScreen(): JSX.Element {\n  const { items, loading, refresh } = useHome();\n  \n  return (\n    <ItemList items={items} loading={loading} onRefresh={refresh} />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Props Interface Always Explicit\n```typescript\n// Always define props interface, even if simple\ninterface ItemCardProps {\n  item: Item;\n  onPress: (id: string) => void;\n}\n\nexport function ItemCard({ item, onPress }: ItemCardProps): JSX.Element {\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## State Management\n\n### Local State First\n```typescript\n// Start with useState, escalate only when needed\nconst [value, setValue] = useState('''');\n```\n\n### Zustand for Global State (if needed)\n```typescript\n// store/useAppStore.ts\nimport { create } from ''zustand'';\n\ninterface AppState {\n  user: User | null;\n  setUser: (user: User | null) => void;\n}\n\nexport const useAppStore = create<AppState>((set) => ({\n  user: null,\n  setUser: (user) => set({ user }),\n}));\n```\n\n### React Query for Server State\n```typescript\n// hooks/useItems.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, useQueryClient } from ''@tanstack/react-query'';\n\nexport function useItems() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [''items''],\n    queryFn: fetchItems,\n  });\n}\n\nexport function useCreateItem() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  \n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createItem,\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''items''] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Component Testing with React Native Testing Library\n```typescript\nimport { render, fireEvent } from ''@testing-library/react-native'';\nimport { Button } from ''./Button'';\n\ndescribe(''Button'', () => {\n  it(''calls onPress when pressed'', () => {\n    const onPress = jest.fn();\n    const { getByText } = render(<Button label=\"Click me\" onPress={onPress} />);\n    \n    fireEvent.press(getByText(''Click me''));\n    \n    expect(onPress).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1);\n  });\n\n  it(''does not call onPress when disabled'', () => {\n    const onPress = jest.fn();\n    const { getByText } = render(<Button label=\"Click me\" onPress={onPress} disabled />);\n    \n    fireEvent.press(getByText(''Click me''));\n    \n    expect(onPress).not.toHaveBeenCalled();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Hook Testing\n```typescript\nimport { renderHook, act } from ''@testing-library/react-hooks'';\nimport { useCounter } from ''./useCounter'';\n\ndescribe(''useCounter'', () => {\n  it(''increments counter'', () => {\n    const { result } = renderHook(() => useCounter());\n    \n    act(() => {\n      result.current.increment();\n    });\n    \n    expect(result.current.count).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Platform-Specific Code\n\n### Use Platform.select Sparingly\n```typescript\nimport { Platform } from ''react-native'';\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  shadow: Platform.select({\n    ios: {\n      shadowColor: ''#000'',\n      shadowOffset: { width: 0, height: 2 },\n      shadowOpacity: 0.1,\n    },\n    android: {\n      elevation: 2,\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Separate Files for Complex Differences\n```\nComponent/\n├── Component.tsx          # Shared logic\n├── Component.ios.tsx      # iOS-specific\n├── Component.android.tsx  # Android-specific\n└── index.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## React Native Anti-Patterns\n\n- ❌ Inline styles - use StyleSheet.create\n- ❌ Logic in render - extract to hooks\n- ❌ Deep component nesting - flatten hierarchy\n- ❌ Anonymous functions in props - use useCallback\n- ❌ Index as key in lists - use stable IDs\n- ❌ Direct state mutation - always use setter\n- ❌ Mixing business logic with UI - keep core/ pure\n- ❌ Ignoring TypeScript errors - fix them\n- ❌ Large components - split into smaller pieces\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:11.227Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents requiring rapid development of security-first, spec-driven, AI-native mobile applications with React Native","zh":"适用于需要快速开发安全优先、规范驱动、AI 原生移动应用的移动代理，使用 React Native","ja":"React Native を使用してセキュリティ優先、仕様駆動、AI ネイティブのモバイル アプリケーションを迅速に開発する必要があるモバイル エージェントに最適","ko":"React Native를 사용하여 보안 우선, 사양 주도, AI 네이티브 모바일 애플리케이션을 빠르게 개발해야 하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que requieren un desarrollo rápido de aplicaciones móviles de seguridad, impulsadas por especificaciones y nativas de IA con React Native","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles nécessitant un développement rapide d''applications mobiles sécurisées, spécification-conduites et natives IA avec React Native","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agenten, die eine schnelle Entwicklung von Sicherheits-First-, spezifikationsgetriebenen, AI-nativen mobilen Anwendungen mit React Native erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que requerem desenvolvimento rápido de aplicações móveis de segurança em primeiro lugar, impulsionadas por especificações e nativas em IA com React Native","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, требующих быстрой разработки безопасных, ориентированных на спецификации и основанных на ИИ мобильных приложений с использованием React Native","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحمولين الذين يتطلبون تطويرًا سريعًا لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الأصلية في مجال الأمان والمتوافقة مع المواصفات والذكية الاصطناعية باستخدام React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable and maintainable mobile applications using React Native, leveraging TypeScript for type safety and a security-first approach, with a project structure that separates pure business logic from UI components","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展和可维护的移动应用的能力，使用 React Native，利用 TypeScript 实现类型安全和安全优先方法，并使用将纯业务逻辑与 UI 组件分离的项目结构","ja":"エージェントが React Native を使用してスケーラブルでメンテナンス可能なモバイル アプリケーションを構築できるようにし、TypeScript を使用して型の安全性とセキュリティ優先アプローチを実現し、ビジネス ロジックと UI コンポーネントを分離したプロジェクト構造を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 React Native를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전성과 보안 우선 접근 방식을 구현하고, 비즈니스 논리와 UI 구성 요소를 분리한 프로젝트 구조를 제공한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones móviles escalables y mantenibles utilizando React Native, aprovechando TypeScript para la seguridad de tipos y un enfoque de seguridad en primer lugar, con una estructura de proyecto que separa la lógica de negocio pura de los componentes de la interfaz de usuario","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications mobiles évolutives et maintenables en utilisant React Native, en exploitant TypeScript pour la sécurité des types et une approche de sécurité en premier lieu, avec une structure de projet qui sépare la logique métier pure des composants d''interface utilisateur","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare und wartbare Mobile-Anwendungen mit React Native zu erstellen, indem TypeScript für die Typsicherheit und einen Sicherheits-First-Ansatz genutzt wird, mit einer Projektstruktur, die die reine Geschäftslogik von den Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten trennt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações móveis escaláveis e mantenedoras usando React Native, aproveitando o TypeScript para segurança de tipo e uma abordagem de segurança em primeiro lugar, com uma estrutura de projeto que separa a lógica de negócios pura dos componentes da interface do usuário","ru":"Наделяет агентов 