 agentes de IA","Seguimiento de las mejores prácticas de TDD","Automatización de tareas de desarrollo con IA","Compatibilidad con Rails 8.1","Mejora de la productividad del desarrollo"],"fr":["Développement de modèles Rails avec des outils d''IA","Suivi des meilleures pratiques de TDD","Automatisation des tâches de développement avec l''IA","Compatibilité avec Rails 8.1","Amélioration de la productivité du développement"],"de":["Entwicklung von Rails-Modellen mit KI-Tools","Einhaltung der besten Praktiken von TDD","Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben mit KI","Kompatibilität mit Rails 8.1","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Rails 8.1 com IA","Seguimento das melhores práticas de TDD","Agentes de IA especializados para desenvolvimento","Integração com o framework Rails 8.1","Suporte à desenvolvedores para projetos de IA"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Rails 8.1 с помощью ИИ","Следование лучшим практикам TDD","Специализированные ИИ агенты для разработки","Интеграция с фреймворком Rails 8.1","Поддержка разработчиков для проектов ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات ريلز 8.1 بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات للاختبار الموجه","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصة لتطوير","التكامل مع إطار العمل ريلز 8.1","دعم المطورين لمشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rails 8.1 AI智能代理","AI驱动开发","TDD最佳实践","代码生成工具","如何使用Rails 8.1 AI智能代理","Rails 8.1 AI智能代理安装","Rails 8.1 AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["Rails 8.1 AIエージェント","AI駆動開発","TDDのベストプラクティス","コード生成ツール","Rails 8.1 AIエージェントの使い方","Rails 8.1 AIエージェントのインストール","Rails 8.1 AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Rails 8.1 AI 에이전트","AI驱动 개발","TDD 최선의实践","코드 생성 도구","Rails 8.1 AI 에이전트 사용 방법","Rails 8.1 AI 에이전트 설치","Rails 8.1 AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de IA en Rails","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a Rails","Rails vs Django","instalación de agentes de IA en Rails","guía de configuración de agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA dans Rails","quoi est un outil d''IA","alternatives à Rails","Rails vs Django","installation d''outils d''IA dans Rails","guide de configuration d''outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools in Rails verwendet","was ist ein KI-Tool","Alternativen zu Rails","Rails vs Django","Installation von KI-Tools in Rails","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar rails-model-generator","o que é agente de IA para Rails","rails-model-generator alternative","rails-model-generator vs outras ferramentas","instalar rails-model-generator","guia de configuração do rails-model-generator","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com IA e TDD","melhores práticas de TDD para Rails 8.1"],"ru":["как использовать rails-model-generator","что такое ИИ агент для Rails","rails-model-generator альтернатива","rails-model-generator vs другие инструменты","установить rails-model-generator","руководство по настройке rails-model-generator","разработка приложений с помощью ИИ и TDD","лучшие практики TDD для Rails 8.1"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام rails-model-generator","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للريلز","بديل rails-model-generator","rails-model-generator مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت rails-model-generator","دليل إعداد rails-model-generator","تطوير التطبيقات بالذكاء الاصطناعي واختبار التوجيه","أفضل الممارسات للاختبار الموجه للريلز 8.1"]}},"owner":"ThibautBaissac","repo":"rails_ai_agents","repoPath":"ThibautBaissac/rails_ai_agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.886Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rails-model-generator","description":"Creates Rails models using TDD approach - spec first, then migration, then model. Use when creating new models, adding model validations, defining associations, or setting up database tables.","bodyPreview":"# Rails Model Generator (TDD Approach)\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill creates models the TDD way:\n1. Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n2. Write model spec with expected behavior (RED)\n3. Create factory for test data\n4. Generate migration\n5. Implement model to pass specs (GREEN)\n6. Refactor if needed\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\n```\nModel Creation Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n- [ ] Step 2: Create model spec (RED)\n- [ ] Step 3:","body":"# Rails Model Generator (TDD Approach)\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill creates models the TDD way:\n1. Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n2. Write model spec with expected behavior (RED)\n3. Create factory for test data\n4. Generate migration\n5. Implement model to pass specs (GREEN)\n6. Refactor if needed\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\n```\nModel Creation Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Define requirements (attributes, validations, associations)\n- [ ] Step 2: Create model spec (RED)\n- [ ] Step 3: Create factory\n- [ ] Step 4: Run spec (should fail - no model/table)\n- [ ] Step 5: Generate migration\n- [ ] Step 6: Run migration\n- [ ] Step 7: Create model file (empty)\n- [ ] Step 8: Run spec (should fail - no validations)\n- [ ] Step 9: Add validations and associations\n- [ ] Step 10: Run spec (GREEN)\n```\n\n## Step 1: Requirements Template\n\nBefore writing code, define the model:\n\n```markdown\n## Model: [ModelName]\n\n### Table: [table_name]\n\n### Attributes\n| Name | Type | Constraints | Default |\n|------|------|-------------|---------|\n| name | string | required, unique | - |\n| email | string | required, unique, email format | - |\n| status | integer | enum | 0 (pending) |\n| organization_id | bigint | foreign key | - |\n\n### Associations\n- belongs_to :organization\n- has_many :posts, dependent: :destroy\n- has_one :profile, dependent: :destroy\n\n### Validations\n- name: presence, uniqueness, length(max: 100)\n- email: presence, uniqueness, format(email)\n- status: inclusion in enum values\n\n### Scopes\n- active: status = active\n- recent: ordered by created_at desc\n- by_organization(org): where organization_id = org.id\n\n### Instance Methods\n- full_name: combines first_name and last_name\n- active?: checks if status is active\n\n### Callbacks\n- before_save :normalize_email\n- after_create :send_welcome_email\n```\n\n## Step 2: Create Model Spec\n\nLocation: `spec/models/[model_name]_spec.rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nrequire ''rails_helper''\n\nRSpec.describe ModelName, type: :model do\n  subject { build(:model_name) }\n\n  # === Associations ===\n  describe ''associations'' do\n    it { is_expected.to belong_to(:organization) }\n    it { is_expected.to have_many(:posts).dependent(:destroy) }\n  end\n\n  # === Validations ===\n  describe ''validations'' do\n    it { is_expected.to validate_presence_of(:name) }\n    it { is_expected.to validate_uniqueness_of(:email).case_insensitive }\n    it { is_expected.to validate_length_of(:name).is_at_most(100) }\n  end\n\n  # === Scopes ===\n  describe ''.active'' do\n    let!(:active_record) { create(:model_name, status: :active) }\n    let!(:inactive_record) { create(:model_name, status: :inactive) }\n\n    it ''returns only active records'' do\n      expect(described_class.active).to include(active_record)\n      expect(described_class.active).not_to include(inactive_record)\n    end\n  end\n\n  # === Instance Methods ===\n  describe ''#full_name'' do\n    subject { build(:model_name, first_name: ''John'', last_name: ''Doe'') }\n\n    it ''returns combined name'' do\n      expect(subject.full_name).to eq(''John Doe'')\n    end\n  end\nend\n```\n\nSee [templates/model_spec.erb](templates/model_spec.erb) for full template.\n\n## Step 3: Create Factory\n\nLocation: `spec/factories/[model_name_plural].rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nFactoryBot.define do\n  factory :model_name do\n    sequence(:name) { |n| \"Name #{n}\" }\n    sequence(:email) { |n| \"user#{n}@example.com\" }\n    status { :pending }\n    association :organization\n\n    trait :active do\n      status { :active }\n    end\n\n    trait :with_posts do\n      after(:create) do |record|\n        create_list(:post, 3, model_name: record)\n      end\n    end\n  end\nend\n```\n\nSee [templates/factory.erb](templates/factory.erb) for full template.\n\n## Step 4: Run Spec (Verify RED)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nExpected: Failure because model/table doesn''t exist.\n\n## Step 5: Generate Migration\n\n```bash\nbin/rails generate migration CreateModelNames \\\n  name:string \\\n  email:string:uniq \\\n  status:integer \\\n  organization:references\n```\n\nReview the generated migration and add:\n- Null constraints: `null: false`\n- Defaults: `default: 0`\n- Indexes: `add_index :table, :column`\n\n```ruby\n# db/migrate/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_create_model_names.rb\nclass CreateModelNames < ActiveRecord::Migration[8.0]\n  def change\n    create_table :model_names do |t|\n      t.string :name, null: false\n      t.string :email, null: false\n      t.integer :status, null: false, default: 0\n      t.references :organization, null: false, foreign_key: true\n\n      t.timestamps\n    end\n\n    add_index :model_names, :email, unique: true\n    add_index :model_names, :status\n  end\nend\n```\n\n## Step 6: Run Migration\n\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate\n```\n\nVerify with:\n```bash\nbin/rails db:migrate:status\n```\n\n## Step 7: Create Model File\n\nLocation: `app/models/[model_name].rb`\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nclass ModelName < ApplicationRecord\nend\n```\n\n## Step 8: Run Spec (Still RED)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nExpected: Failures for missing validations/associations.\n\n## Step 9: Add Validations & Associations\n\n```ruby\n# frozen_string_literal: true\n\nclass ModelName < ApplicationRecord\n  # === Associations ===\n  belongs_to :organization\n  has_many :posts, dependent: :destroy\n\n  # === Enums ===\n  enum :status, { pending: 0, active: 1, suspended: 2 }\n\n  # === Validations ===\n  validates :name, presence: true,\n                   uniqueness: true,\n                   length: { maximum: 100 }\n  validates :email, presence: true,\n                    uniqueness: { case_sensitive: false },\n                    format: { with: URI::MailTo::EMAIL_REGEXP }\n\n  # === Scopes ===\n  scope :active, -> { where(status: :active) }\n  scope :recent, -> { order(created_at: :desc) }\n\n  # === Instance Methods ===\n  def full_name\n    \"#{first_name} #{last_name}\".strip\n  end\nend\n```\n\n## Step 10: Run Spec (GREEN)\n\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec spec/models/model_name_spec.rb\n```\n\nAll specs should pass.\n\n## References\n\n- See [templates/model_spec.erb](templates/model_spec.erb) for spec template\n- See [templates/factory.erb](templates/factory.erb) for factory template\n- See [reference/validations.md](reference/validations.md) for validation patterns\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Enum with Validation\n\n```ruby\nenum :status, { draft: 0, published: 1, archived: 2 }\nvalidates :status, inclusion: { in: statuses.keys }\n```\n\n### Polymorphic Association\n\n```ruby\nbelongs_to :commentable, polymorphic: true\n```\n\n### Counter Cache\n\n```ruby\nbelongs_to :organization, counter_cache: true\n# Add: organization.posts_count column\n```\n\n### Soft Delete\n\n```ruby\nscope :active, -> { where(deleted_at: nil) }\nscope :deleted, -> { where.not(deleted_at: nil) }\n\ndef soft_delete\n  update(deleted_at: Time.current)\nend\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:11.713Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby on Rails Agents needing automated model generation and TDD best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要自动模型生成和TDD最佳实践的Ruby on Rails代理。","ja":"Ruby on Railsエージェントが自動モデル生成とTDDのベストプラクティスを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 모델 생성과 TDD 최선의 실践이 필요한 Ruby on Rails 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Ruby on Rails que necesitan generación de modelos automatizada y mejores prácticas de TDD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Ruby on Rails qui ont besoin d''une génération de modèles automatisée et de meilleures pratiques de TDD.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby on Rails-Agents, die eine automatisierte Modellgenerierung und TDD-Best-Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Ruby on Rails que necessitam de geração automatizada de modelos e melhores práticas de TDD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Ruby on Rails, которым требуется автоматизированное создание моделей и лучшие практики TDD.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء Ruby on Rails الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء نماذج تلقائي وأفضل ممارسات TDD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Rails models following Test-Driven Development principles, utilizing migration generation and factory creation for test data, all while adhering to TDD workflows and RED-GREEN-REFACTOR methodologies.","zh":"赋予代理根据测试驱动开发原则生成Rails模型，利用迁移生成和工厂创建测试数据，同时遵循TDD工作流和RED-GREEN-REFACTOR方法论。","ja":"エージェントがテスト駆動開発の原則に従ってRailsモデルを生成できるようにし、テストデータのマイグレーション生成とファクトリの作成を利用し、TDDのワークフローとRED-GREEN-REFACTORの方法論に従う。","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 주도 개발 원칙을 따라 Rails 모델을 생성할 수 있게 하며, 테스트 데이터를 위한 마이그레이션 생성과 팩토리 생성을 활용하고, TDD 워크플로와 RED-GREEN-REFACTOR 방법론을 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar modelos Rails siguiendo los principios de Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas, utilizando la generación de migraciones y la creación de fábricas para datos de prueba, todo mientras se adhiere a flujos de trabajo de TDD y metodologías RED-GREEN-REFACTOR.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des modèles Rails suivant les principes de Développement Piloté par les Tests, en utilisant la génération de migrations et la création d''usines pour les données de test, tout en respectant les flux de travail de TDD et les méthodologies RED-GREEN-REFACTOR.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Rails-Modelle zu generieren, die den Prinzipien der Testgetriebenen Entwicklung folgen, unter Verwendung der Migrationserstellung und der Erstellung von Fabriken für Testdaten, während sie sich an TDD-Arbeitsabläufen und RED-GREEN-REFACTOR-Methoden halten.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar modelos Rails seguindo os princípios do Desenvolvimento Orientado a Testes (TDD), utilizando a geração de migrações e a criação de factories para dados de teste, tudo enquanto adere aos fluxos de trabalho TDD e às metodologias RED-GREEN-REFACTOR.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать модели Rails в соответствии с принципами Разработки через Тестирование (TDD), используя создание миграций и фабрик для тестовых данных, все это при соблюдении рабочих процессов TDD и методологий RED-GREEN-REFACTOR.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء نماذج Rails باتباع مبادئ التطوير القائم على الاختبار (TDD)، باستخدام إنشاء迁移 وإنشاء مصانع لبيانات الاختبار، كل ذلك مع الالتزام بأساليب عمل TDD ومنهجيات RED-GREEN-REFACTOR."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating model creation with predefined attributes and validations","Generating migration files for database schema updates","Creating test factories for model spec validation"],"zh":["使用预定义属性和验证自动创建模型","生成数据库模式更新的迁移文件","创建测试工厂用于模型规格验证"],"ja":["事前に定義された属性と検証を使用してモデルを作成する自動化","データベーススキーマの更新のためのマイグレーションファイルの生成","モデル仕様の検証のためのテストファクトリの作成"],"ko":["사전 정의된 속성 및 유효성 검사를 사용하여 모델 자동 생성","데이터베이스 스키마 업데이트를 위한 마이그레이션 파일 생성","모델 사양 유효성 검증을 위한 테스트 팩토리 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de modelos con atributos y validaciones predefinidos","Generar archivos de migración para actualizaciones del esquema de base de datos","Crear fábricas de prueba para la validación de especificaciones de modelo"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de modèles avec des attributs et des validations prédéfinis","Générer des fichiers de migration pour les mises à jour du schéma de base de données","Créer des usines de test pour la validation des spécifications de modèle"],"de":["Automatisieren der Modellerstellung mit vordefinierten Attributen und Validierungen","Generieren von Migrationdateien für Datenbankschemataktualisierungen","Erstellen von Testfabriken für die Modell-Spezifikationsvalidierung"],"pt":["Automatização da criação de modelos com atributos e validações predefinidos","Geração de arquivos de migração para atualizações do esquema de banco de dados","Criação de factories de teste para validação de especificações de modelo"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания моделей с предопределенными атрибутами и валидациями","Создание файлов миграций для обновления схемы базы данных","Создание тестовых фабрик для валидации спецификаций модели"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء النماذج بسمات وتحقق مسبق التحديد","إنشاء ملفات هجرة لتحديثات مخطط قاعدة البيانات","إنشاء مصانع اختبار للتحقق من مواصفات النموذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rails 8.1 environment","Follows TDD approach only"],"zh":["需要Rails 8.1环境","仅遵循TDD方法"],"ja":["Rails 8.1環境が必要","TDDアプローチのみを遵守"],"ko":["Rails 8.1 환경 필요","TDD 접근 방식만 따름"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Rails 8.1","Sigue solo el enfoque de TDD"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Rails 8.1","N suit que l''approche de TDD"],"de":["Benötigt ein Rails 8.1-Umgebung","Folgt nur dem TDD-Ansatz"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Rails 8.1","Segue apenas a abordagem TDD"],"ru":["Требует среду Rails 8.1","Следует только подходу TDD"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Rails 8.1","يتبع نهج TDD فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f209895b084d06ed2d11ffe77cd2f1ece03c12abfe99a6b77a7fecea3bdee833","qualityScore":30}');
