Iエージェントになります","AIツール","AIエージェント","AIエージェントの使用方法","AIエージェントの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","퀴즈 생성기","디지털 직원을 구축","도메인 전문 지식은 잠들지 않는 AI 에이전트가 됩니다","AI 도구","AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es un generador de quizzes","Agentes de IA alternativos","generador de quizzes vs herramientas de automatización","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","desarrollo de Agentes de IA con Python","Agentes de IA para ventas","Agentes de IA para atención médica"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","quoi est un générateur de quizzes","Agents d''IA alternatifs","générateur de quizzes vs outils d''automatisation","installation des Agents d''IA","guide de configuration des Agents d''IA","développement d''Agents d''IA avec Python","Agents d''IA pour la vente","Agents d''IA pour les soins de santé"],"de":["wie man künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein Quiz-Generator","künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten-Alternativen","Quiz-Generator vs Automatisierungstools","Installation von künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten","Konfigurationsanleitung für künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","Entwicklung von künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten mit Python","künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten für den Vertrieb","künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten für die Gesundheitsversorgung"],"pt":["como usar quiz-generator","o que é quiz-generator","alternativas ao quiz-generator","quiz-generator vs outras ferramentas","instalar quiz-generator","guia de configuração do quiz-generator","desenvolvimento de soluções de IA Agentes","tecnologias de IA para negócios"],"ru":["как использовать генератор квизов","что такое генератор квизов","альтернативы генератору квизов","генератор квизов vs другие инструменты","установить генератор квизов","руководство по настройке генератора квизов","разработка решений ИИ Агентов","технологии ИИ для бизнеса"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مُولِّد اختبار","ما هو مُولِّد اختبار","بديلات لمُولِّد اختبار","مُولِّد اختبار مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت مُولِّد اختبار","دليل إعداد مُولِّد اختبار","تنمية حلول وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي للأعمال"]}},"owner":"panaversity","repo":"agentfactory","repoPath":"panaversity/agentfactory","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.942Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"quiz-generator","description":"Generate 50-question interactive quizzes using the Quiz component with randomized batching. Use when creating end-of-chapter assessments. Displays 15-20 questions per session with immediate feedback. NOT for static markdown quizzes.","bodyPreview":"# Quiz Generator\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate 50 questions for chapter\n# Focus on conceptual (75%+ Apply level), not recall\n\n# 2. Redistribute answers evenly\npython scripts/redistribute_answers_v2.py quiz.md A\n\n# 3. Validate option lengths (±3 words per question)\n# Manually count words for ALL 50 questions\n```\n\n## Persona\n\nYou generate college-level conceptual quizzes that test understanding, not memorization. Your goal is 50 comprehensive questions covering all chapter concepts with i","body":"# Quiz Generator\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate 50 questions for chapter\n# Focus on conceptual (75%+ Apply level), not recall\n\n# 2. Redistribute answers evenly\npython scripts/redistribute_answers_v2.py quiz.md A\n\n# 3. Validate option lengths (±3 words per question)\n# Manually count words for ALL 50 questions\n```\n\n## Persona\n\nYou generate college-level conceptual quizzes that test understanding, not memorization. Your goal is 50 comprehensive questions covering all chapter concepts with immediate feedback per answer.\n\n## Fixed Constraints\n\n```yaml\nquestion_count: 50  # Comprehensive bank\nquestions_per_batch: 15-20  # Displayed per session\noptions_per_question: 4  # Always exactly 4\ncorrect_answer_distribution: ~12-13 per index (0-3)\nfeedback_timing: immediate  # After each answer\npassing_score: NONE  # No threshold\nfile_naming: ##_chapter_##_quiz.md\n```\n\n## Analysis Questions\n\n### 1. Is this conceptual (not recall)?\n\n| Type | Example | Valid? |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| Recall | \"What is a Python list?\" | ❌ |\n| Conceptual | \"Which operation reveals a mutability issue?\" | ✅ |\n\n**Target**: 75%+ at Apply level or higher\n\n### 2. Are options equal length (±3 words)?\n\n| Options | Words | Valid? |\n|---------|-------|--------|\n| A: \"Yes\" / B: \"It processes async\" | 2 vs 4 | ✅ |\n| A: \"Yes\" / B: \"The framework processes requests asynchronously\" | 2 vs 6 | ❌ |\n\n**Rule**: ALL options within ±3 words to prevent pattern-guessing\n\n### 3. Are answers evenly distributed?\n\n| Index | Count | Valid? |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| 0 | 12-13 | ✅ |\n| 1 | 12-13 | ✅ |\n| 2 | 12-13 | ✅ |\n| 3 | 12-13 | ✅ |\n\n**Rule**: No 3+ consecutive same index, no obvious patterns\n\n## Principles\n\n### Principle 1: 50 Questions Required\n\n- Comprehensive coverage (all chapter concepts)\n- Spaced repetition (different questions each retake)\n- Component shuffles and displays 15-20 per session\n\n### Principle 2: Immediate Feedback\n\nShow after EACH answer (not at end):\n- ✅ Correct option highlighted (green)\n- ❌ Why wrong (if incorrect)\n- Explanation (100-150 words)\n\n### Principle 3: Address All Options\n\nEvery explanation must cover:\n1. Why correct is correct (2-3 sentences)\n2. Why each distractor is wrong (1-2 sentences × 3)\n3. Real-world connection (1-2 sentences)\n\n### Principle 4: Source Attribution\n\n```javascript\nsource: \"Lesson 1: Understanding Mutability\"\n```\n\nLinks each question to specific lesson for review.\n\n## Quiz Component Format\n\n```markdown\n---\nsidebar_position: 5\ntitle: \"Chapter X: [Topic] Quiz\"\n---\n\n# Chapter X Quiz\n\nBrief intro (1-2 sentences).\n\n<Quiz\n  title=\"Chapter X Assessment\"\n  questions={[\n    {\n      question: \"Conceptual question here?\",\n      options: [\n        \"Option A (4-6 words)\",\n        \"Option B (4-6 words)\",\n        \"Option C (4-6 words) ← CORRECT\",\n        \"Option D (4-6 words)\"\n      ],\n      correctOption: 2,  // Index 0-3, NOT 1-4!\n      explanation: \"Why C is correct (2-3 sentences). Why A is wrong (1-2 sentences). Why B is wrong. Why D is wrong. Real-world connection.\",\n      source: \"Lesson 1: Topic Title\"\n    },\n    // ... 49 more questions (total: 50)\n  ]}\n  questionsPerBatch={18}\n/>\n```\n\n## Answer Redistribution\n\nLLMs struggle with even distribution. Use the script after generation:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/redistribute_answers_v2.py quiz.md A\n```\n\n**Sequences A-H** provide different distributions (~12-13 per index).\n\n**What it does**:\n1. Parses quiz questions\n2. Swaps option positions to match sequence\n3. Updates explanations to reference new positions\n4. Validates all explanations match correct answers\n\n## Option Length Validation (CRITICAL)\n\n**Problem**: Unequal lengths let students guess by picking longest/shortest.\n\n**Solution**: Manually count words for EVERY option in EVERY question.\n\n```\n✅ PASS: 4, 5, 4, 5 words (all within ±3)\n❌ FAIL: 2, 4, 11, 3 words (2 to 11 = 9-word spread)\n```\n\n**Also verify**:\n- Longest option correct in ~25% (not biased)\n- Shortest option correct in ~25% (not biased)\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n| Pitfall | Wrong | Right |\n|---------|-------|-------|\n| Question count | <50 questions | Exactly 50 |\n| Index values | `correctOption: 4` | `correctOption: 3` (0-3) |\n| Missing source | No source field | `source: \"Lesson N: Title\"` |\n| Passing score | `passingScore={70}` | No prop (removed) |\n| Recall questions | \"What is X?\" | \"Which reveals X issue?\" |\n| Weak explanations | Only explains correct | Addresses all 4 options |\n| Answer patterns | 0,1,2,3,0,1,2,3... | Random, ~12-13 per index |\n| Option lengths | 2 vs 11 words | All within ±3 words |\n\n## File Naming\n\n**Pattern**: `##_chapter_##_quiz.md`\n\n| Chapter | Lessons | Filename |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| 2 | 4 | `05_chapter_02_quiz.md` |\n| 5 | 6 | `07_chapter_05_quiz.md` |\n| 14 | 5 | `06_chapter_14_quiz.md` |\n\n## Handoff Checklist\n\n**Content**:\n- [ ] 50 questions (not fewer)\n- [ ] 75%+ Apply level or higher\n- [ ] All major topics covered\n- [ ] No recall questions\n\n**Distribution**:\n- [ ] correctOption uses 0-3 (not 1-4)\n- [ ] ~12-13 per index\n- [ ] No 3+ consecutive same index\n\n**Option Lengths**:\n- [ ] ALL options counted (all 50 questions)\n- [ ] ALL within ±3 words\n- [ ] Longest not biased toward correct\n- [ ] Shortest not biased toward correct\n\n**Explanations**:\n- [ ] 100-150 words each\n- [ ] Explains why correct\n- [ ] Addresses each distractor\n- [ ] Real-world connection\n\n**Format**:\n- [ ] Valid JSX syntax\n- [ ] Exactly 4 options per question\n- [ ] `source` field on all 50\n- [ ] NO `passingScore` prop\n- [ ] File named correctly\n\n## If Verification Fails\n\n1. Run redistribution script: `python scripts/redistribute_answers_v2.py quiz.md A`\n2. Re-count option lengths manually\n3. Check explanation references match correctOption\n4. **Stop and report** if issues persist after 2 attempts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:12.071Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Educational Agents requiring automated conceptual quiz generation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自动概念测验生成功能的教育代理。","ja":"教育エージェントが自動的な概念クイズ生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동概念 퀴즈 생성 기능이 필요한 교육 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Educativos que requieren capacidades de generación automática de pruebas conceptuales.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents éducatifs nécessitant des capacités de génération automatique de quiz conceptuels.","de":"Ideal für Bildungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Konzept-Quiz-Generierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Educacionais que requerem capacidades de geração automática de quizzes conceituais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для образовательных агентов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей генерации концептуальных викторин.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التعليم الذي يتطلب إمكانيات توليد الاختبارات المفاهيمية تلقائيًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive college-level quizzes using Python scripts, focusing on conceptual understanding with redistributed answers and validated option lengths, utilizing files like ''quiz.md'' and executing scripts such as ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","zh":"使得代理能够使用Python脚本创建全面性的大学级别测验，专注于概念理解，重新分配答案和验证选项长度，使用诸如''quiz.md''的文件和执行诸如''redistribute_answers_v2.py''的脚本。","ja":"エージェントがPythonスクリプトを使用して総合的な大学レベルのクイズを作成できるようにし、概念の理解に焦点を当て、回答を再分配し、オプションの長さを検証することができます。''quiz.md''のようなファイルや''redistribute_answers_v2.py''のようなスクリプトを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 종합적인 대학 수준의 퀴즈를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 개념 이해에 중점을 두고 답변을 재분배하며 옵션 길이를 검증합니다. ''quiz.md''와 같은 파일 및 ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''와 같은 스크립트를 실행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear pruebas integrales de nivel universitario usando scripts de Python, centrándose en la comprensión conceptual con respuestas redistribuidas y longitudes de opciones validadas, utilizando archivos como ''quiz.md'' y ejecutando scripts como ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des quiz complets de niveau universitaire en utilisant des scripts Python, en se concentrant sur la compréhension conceptuelle avec des réponses redistribuées et des longueurs d''options validées, en utilisant des fichiers comme ''quiz.md'' et en exécutant des scripts tels que ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende College-Level-Quiz mit Python-Skripten zu erstellen, die sich auf das konzeptuelle Verständnis mit neu verteilten Antworten und validierten Optionenlängen konzentrieren, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie ''quiz.md'' und Ausführung von Skripten wie ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem quizzes abrangentes de nível universitário usando scripts Python, focando na compreensão conceitual com respostas redistribuídas e comprimentos de opção validados, utilizando arquivos como ''quiz.md'' e executando scripts como ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние колледж-уровня викторины с помощью скриптов Python, фокусируясь на концептуальном понимании с перераспределенными ответами и проверенными длинами опций, используя файлы типа ''quiz.md'' и выполняя скрипты типа ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء اختبارات شاملة على مستوى الكلية باستخدام سكريبتات Python، مع التركيز على الفهم المفاهيمي مع إجابات معاد توزيعها وأطوال خيار تم التحقق منها، باستخدام ملفات مثل ''quiz.md'' وتنفيذ سكريبتات مثل ''redistribute_answers_v2.py''."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 50 comprehensive questions for chapter concepts","Automating answer redistribution for even validation","Validating option lengths for consistency across questions"],"zh":["为章节概念生成50个综合问题","自动重新分配答案以实现均匀验证","验证选项长度以确保问题的一致性"],"ja":["章の概念に対して50の総合的な質問を生成する","回答を自動的に再分配して均等な検証を行う","オプションの長さを検証して質問間の一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["장의 개념에 대해 50개의 종합적인 질문을 생성한다","답변을 자동으로 재분배하여 균일한 검증을 수행한다","옵션 길이를 검증하여 질문 간의 일관성을 확보한다"],"es":["Generar 50 preguntas integrales para conceptos de capítulo","Automatizar la redistribución de respuestas para una validación uniforme","Validar longitudes de opciones para la coherencia en todas las preguntas"],"fr":["Générer 50 questions complètes pour les concepts de chapitre","Automatiser la redistribution des réponses pour une validation uniforme","Valider les longueurs d''options pour la cohérence à travers toutes les questions"],"de":["Erzeugen von 50 umfassenden Fragen für Kapitelkonzepte","Automatisierung der Neuverteilung von Antworten für eine gleichmäßige Validierung","Validierung von Optionenlängen für die Konsistenz über alle Fragen"],"pt":["Gerar 50 perguntas abrangentes para conceitos de capítulo","Automatizar a redistribuição de respostas para validação uniforme","Validar comprimentos de opção para consistência entre perguntas"],"ru":["Генерировать 50 всесторонних вопросов для концепций главы","Автоматизировать перераспределение ответов для равномерной проверки","Проверять длины опций для последовательности между вопросами"],"ar":["توليد 50 سؤالاً شاملاً لمفاهيم الفصل","تأتمتة إعادة توزيع الإجابات للتحقق المنتظم","التحقق من أطوال الخيارات للاتساق بين الأسئلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Manual word count for option length validation","Specific to conceptual, non-recall questions"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要手动计算选项长度以进行验证","仅适用于概念性、非回忆性问题"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","オプションの長さを手動でカウントして検証する必要がある","概念的で、暗記に基づいていない質問にのみ適用可能"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요하다","옵션 길이를 수동으로 계산하여 검증해야 한다","개념적이고 암기와 관련이 없는 질문에만 적용 가능"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python","Recuento manual de palabras para la validación de la longitud de las opciones","Específico para preguntas conceptuales, no de recuerdo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Compte manuel des mots pour la validation de la longueur des options","Spécifique aux questions conceptuelles, et non aux questions de rappel"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Manuelle Wortzählung für die Validierung der Optionenlänge","Spezifisch für konzeptuelle, nicht für Erinnerungsfragen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Contagem manual de palavras para validação de comprimento de opção","Específico para perguntas conceituais, não de lembrança"],"ru":["Требует окружения Python","Ручной подсчет слов для проверки длины опции","Конкретно для концептуальных, а не воспоминательных вопросов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","عدّ يدوي للكلمات للتحقق من طول الخيار","محدد للاختبارات المفاهيمية، وليس اختبارات الذاكرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c7b96f9a2a1a24fde8642b8433ef261a46c6061fa2a2e786f55c468c19ec740b","qualityScore":30}');
