ботан для разработчиков","Инструмент командной строки (CLI)","Интеграция с Node.js и Python","Поддержка React","Детальная документация"],"ar":["مراقبة CAPE","تم تطويره لمنشئي التطبيقات","أداة سطر الأوامر (CLI)","التكامل مع Node.js و Python","دعم React","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","capemon-developer教程","如何使用capemon-developer","capemon-developer替代品","capemon-developer安装","capemon-developer设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントツール","capemon-developerチュートリアル","capemon-developerの使い方","capemon-developerの代替","capemon-developerのインストール","capemon-developerの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 툴","capemon-developer 튜토리얼","capemon-developer 사용법","capemon-developer 대체","capemon-developer 설치","capemon-developer 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","capemon-developer alternativa","CAPE monitor","cómo utilizar capemon-developer","instalación de capemon-developer","guía de configuración de capemon-developer"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","capemon-developer alternative","moniteur CAPE","comment utiliser capemon-developer","installation de capemon-developer","guide de configuration de capemon-developer"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","capemon-developer Alternative","CAPE-Monitor","wie man capemon-developer verwendet","Installation von capemon-developer","Konfigurationsanleitung für capemon-developer"],"pt":["como usar capemon-developer","o que é capemon-developer","alternativas para capemon-developer","capemon-developer vs CAPE","instalar capemon-developer","guia de configuração do capemon-developer","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com capemon-developer","capemon-developer e Node.js","capemon-developer e Python"],"ru":["как использовать capemon-developer","что такое capemon-developer","альтернативы capemon-developer","capemon-developer vs CAPE","установка capemon-developer","руководство по настройке capemon-developer","разработка приложений с capemon-developer","capemon-developer и Node.js","capemon-developer и Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة capemon-developer","ما هي أداة capemon-developer","بديل لاداة capemon-developer","أداة capemon-developer مقابل CAPE","تثبيت أداة capemon-developer","دليل إعداد أداة capemon-developer","تطوير التطبيقات مع أداة capemon-developer","أداة capemon-developer و Node.js","أداة capemon-developer و Python"]}},"owner":"kevoreilly","repo":"capemon","repoPath":"kevoreilly/capemon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.085Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"capemon-developer","description":"Expert capability for navigating, modifying, and extending the capemon malware monitoring codebase. Includes deep knowledge of Windows API hooking, PE structures, and the CAPEv2 sandbox architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creatio","body":"# Capemon Skills\n\n`capemon` is a sophisticated monitoring and instrumentation engine designed for malware analysis, configuration extraction, and payload recovery. It acts as the core injection component for the CAPEv2 sandbox.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. API Hooking & Monitoring\n`capemon` implements an extensive hooking engine derived from `cuckoomon-modified`, providing deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems:\n- **Process & Thread Management:** Monitoring creation, termination, and manipulation of processes and threads.\n- **File System Operations:** Tracking file creation, deletion, reading, and writing.\n- **Registry Activity:** Capturing configuration changes and persistence mechanisms.\n- **Network Communication:** Intercepting socket operations, DNS queries, and high-level protocol activity (HTTP, etc.).\n- **Cryptography:** Extracting keys and monitoring encryption/decryption routines.\n- **Synchronization & Services:** Monitoring mutexes, events, and Windows Service interactions.\n- **Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI):** Intercepting WMI queries used for anti-analysis or reconnaissance.\n- **Scripting Engines:** Specific hooks for VBScript and other language runtimes.\n\n### 2. Debugging & Tracing\n`capemon` implements a powerful in-process debugger independent of Windows debugging interfaces, but harnessing the capabilities of the processor:\n- **Hardware breakpoints:** Four breakpoints bp0-bp3 that can be set on execute, read or write\n- **Software breakpoints:** Unlimited INT3 or ''CC'' breakpoints overwriting instruction byte\n- **Single-step:** Tracing allows instruction-level capture enhanced with configurable step-over, trace-length, register changes, function names, strings & more\n- **Actions:** Configurable actions allow control flow manipulation with skipped or taken jumps, arbitrary register changes or jumps, string capture, dumps, scans & more\n- **Programmable:** Debugger configurable either on submission with simple text options or via dynamic YARA signature scans during unpacking or detonation\n- **Integration:** Hooking engine integrated with optional behavior log output & breakpoints set on return from hooked APIs (break-on-return)\n- **Stealth:** Debugger does not rely upon Windows interface and thus evades detection by a slew of interface-related indicators, with additional stealth from hook-based protections\n\n### 3. Automated Unpacking\n''capemon'' implements a powerful unpacking engine using a combination of techniques\n- **Memory region tracking:** Regions of memory revealed through indicators of execution, allocation or protection are tracked\n- **Early capture:** Multiple possible triggers allow payload capture at earliest moment often resulting in working unpacked samples\n- **Injection capture:**: Strong coverage of injection techniques for inter-process payload capture\n- **PE unmapping:** Integrated Scylla engine allows capture of memory or file-mapped PE images in memory\n- **Shellcode dumping:** Shellcode * non-PE regions equally captured as payloads\n- **Import Reconstruction:** Repairing Import Address Tables (IAT) to create functional dumped executables.\n- **AMSI Dumping:** Intercepting and dumping buffers passed to the Antimalware Scan Interface (AMSI).\n\n### 4. Config Extraction\nAutomated Static & Dynamic malware configuration extraction relies on ''capemon'' capabilities\n- **Static extraction:** Typically reliant upon capemon''s unpacking or process dump capture before static parsing\n- **Dynamic extraction:** When parser implementation is onerous, dynamic capture of decrypted configs can be performed by debugger via YARA signature\n\n### 5. YARA integration\nIntegration of YARA for in-memory scanning\n- **Dynamic configuration:** Sandbox configuration such as hooking exclusions or options implemented during detonation\n- **Debugger programming:** Precise dydnamic breakpoint address resolution using YARA signatures & cape-specific metadata\n- **Unpacking engine integration:** Dynamic scanning of all memory regions prior to unpacking capture\n- **Function resolution:** Allows dynamic address resolution for APIs or functions for hooking or other purposes\n\n## Technical Foundations\n- **Platform:** Windows (x86 and x64).\n- **Hooking Method:** Inline hooking of Win32 and Native APIs (NTAPI).\n- **Debugger:** Native in-process ''self'' debugging utilising minimal OS interfaces & hardware capabilities (breakpoint, single-step)\n- **Dependencies:** \n    - `distorm` for instruction decoding.\n    - `libyara` for pattern matching.\n    - `Scylla` for PE reconstruction.\n    - `bson` for data serialization.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:47.176Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Malware Analysis Agents requiring advanced API hooking and monitoring capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级API钩子和监控功能的恶意软件分析代理。","ja":"高度なAPIフックとモニタリング機能を必要とするマルウェア分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 API 후킹 및 모니터링 기능을 필요로 하는 악성 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de malware que requieren capacidades avanzadas de hooking y monitoreo de API.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de malware nécessitant des capacités avancées de hooking et de surveillance d''API.","de":"Ideal für Malware-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte API-Hooking- und Überwachungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Malware que exigem recursos avançados de hooking e monitoramento de API.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа вредоносного ПО, требующих продвинутых возможностей перехвата и мониторинга API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة الذي يتطلب تقنيات متقدمة لربط ومراقبة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement extensive hooking engines for deep visibility into application behavior across multiple subsystems, including process and thread management, utilizing technologies like cuckoomon-modified for comprehensive analysis and payload recovery.","zh":"赋予代理实现广泛的钩子引擎以深入可见性到应用程序行为，跨多个子系统，包括进程和线程管理，利用类似cuckoomon-modified的技术进行全面分析和有效载荷恢复。","ja":"エージェントに、プロセスとスレッド管理を含む複数のサブシステムを横断するアプリケーションの動作に対する深い可視性を提供する広範なフッキングエンジンを実装する力を与え、cuckoomon-modifiedなどの技術を使用して包括的な分析とペイロードの復旧を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 프로세스 및 쓰레드 관리를 포함한 여러 하위 시스템을 가로지르는 애플리케이션 동작에 대한 깊은 가시성을 제공하는 광범위한 후킹 엔진을 구현할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 또한, cuckoomon-modified와 같은 기술을 사용하여 포괄적인 분석 및 페이로드 복구를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar motores de hooking extensos para una visibilidad profunda en el comportamiento de la aplicación en varios subsistemas, incluyendo la gestión de procesos y subprocesos, utilizando tecnologías como cuckoomon-modified para un análisis y recuperación de payloads exhaustivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des moteurs de hooking étendus pour une visibilité approfondie dans le comportement de l''application à travers plusieurs sous-systèmes, notamment la gestion de processus et de threads, en utilisant des technologies comme cuckoomon-modified pour une analyse et une récupération de payloads complètes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umfangreiche Hooking-Engines für eine tiefe Einsicht in das Verhalten der Anwendung über mehrere Subsysteme hinweg zu implementieren, einschließlich Prozess- und Thread-Management, unter Nutzung von Technologien wie cuckoomon-modified für eine umfassende Analyse und Payload-Wiederherstellung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem motores de hooking extensivos para uma visibilidade profunda no comportamento da aplicação em vários subsistemas, incluindo gerenciamento de processos e threads, utilizando tecnologias como cuckoomon-modified para análise abrangente e recuperação de payload.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать обширные движки перехвата для глубокой видимости поведения приложения в нескольких подсистемах, включая управление процессами и потоками, используя технологии, такие как cuckoomon-modified, для всестороннего анализа и восстановления полезной нагрузки.","ar":"يمكّن العملاء من تنفيذ محركات ربط شاملة لتحقيق رؤية عميقة في سلوك التطبيق عبر عدة أنظمة فرعية، بما في ذلك إدارة العمليات والخيط، باستخدام تقنيات مثل cuckoomon-modified من أجل تحليل شامل واستعادة الحمولة."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring malware behavior through API hooking","Extracting configurations from malicious applications","Recovering payloads for further analysis"],"zh":["通过API钩子监控恶意软件行为","从恶意应用程序中提取配置","恢复有效载荷以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["APIフックを使用したマルウェアの動作の監視","悪意のあるアプリケーションから構成を抽出","さらに分析するためにペイロードを回復"],"ko":["API 후킹을 통한 악성 코드 행동 모니터링","악성 애플리케이션에서 구성 추출","추가 분석을 위한 페이로드 복구"],"es":["Monitoreo del comportamiento de malware a través de hooking de API","Extracción de configuraciones de aplicaciones maliciosas","Recuperación de payloads para un análisis posterior"],"fr":["Surveillance du comportement de malware via hooking d''API","Extraction de configurations d''applications malveillantes","Récupération de payloads pour une analyse ultérieure"],"de":["Überwachung des Malware-Verhaltens durch API-Hooking","Extraktion von Konfigurationen aus bösartigen Anwendungen","Wiederherstellung von Payloads für eine weitere Analyse"],"pt":["Monitorar o comportamento de malware por meio de hooking de API","Extrair configurações de aplicações maliciosas","Recuperar payloads para análise adicional"],"ru":["Отслеживать поведение вредоносного ПО с помощью перехвата API","Извлекать конфигурации из вредоносных приложений","Восстанавливать полезные нагрузки для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["مراقبة سلوك البرمجيات الخبيثة من خلال ربط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","استخراج التكوينات من التطبيقات الخبيثة","استعادة الحمولات لأغراض التحليل الإضافي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with CAPEv2 sandbox","Limited to malware analysis and related use cases"],"zh":["需要与CAPEv2沙箱集成","仅限于恶意软件分析和相关用例"],"ja":["CAPEv2サンドボックスとの統合が必要","マルウェア分析と関連するユースケースに限定"],"ko":["CAPEv2 샌드박스와의 통합이 필요","악성 코드 분석 및 관련 사용 사례에 한정"],"es":["Requiere integración con CAPEv2 sandbox","Limitado al análisis de malware y casos de uso relacionados"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le sandbox CAPEv2","Limité à l''analyse de malware et aux cas d''utilisation associés"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit CAPEv2-Sandbox","Begrenzt auf Malware-Analyse und damit verbundene Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Exige integração com o sandbox CAPEv2","Limitado à análise de malware e casos de uso relacionados"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с sandbox CAPEv2","Ограничен анализом вредоносного ПО и связанными с ним случаями использования"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع sandbox CAPEv2","محدود بالتحليل البرمجي الخبيث والحالات ذات الصلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"25b0266c3933f3b48b96dcbac37f1d9860493b08986fc9d319afa75a0a190f19","qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pegasus-isi/pegasus-workflow-toolkit/pegasus-wrapper', 'community', 'pegasus-isi', 'pegasus-workflow-toolkit', 'pegasus-isi/pegasus-workflow-toolkit', 'pegasus-wrapper', 0, 0, 30, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.121Z', '2026-03-02T03:39:18.268Z', 'a6bc044a5543161d2964c0fbaa156506eb58ea6e33008d55ae01db692e023f29', '{"id":"pegasus-isi/pegasus-workflow-toolkit/pegasus-wrapper","name":"pegasus-wrapper","description":{"zh":"Pegasus Wrapper是一个可重用工具包，用于创建Pegasus WMS工作流，基于Claude Code。它简化了开发流程，提高了效率","ja":"Pegasus Wrapperは、Claude Codeを使用してPegasus WMSワークフローを作成するための再利用可能なツールキットです。開発プロセスを簡素化し、効率を向上させます","ko":"Pegasus Wrapper는 Claude Code를 사용하여 Pegasus WMS 워크플ロー 생성을 위한 재사용 가능한 툴킷입니다. 개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 효율성을 향상시키는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"Pegasus Wrapper es una herramienta reutilizable para crear flujos de trabajo de Pegasus WMS con Claude Code, mejorando la eficiencia y productividad","fr":"Pegasus Wrapper est un outil réutilisable pour créer des flux de travail Pegasus WMS avec Claude Code, améliorant l''efficacité et la productivité","de":"Pegasus Wrapper ist ein wiederverwendbares Tool zum Erstellen von Pegasus-WMS-Workflows mit Claude Code, um Effizienz und Produktivität zu steigern","pt":"A Pegasus Wrapper é uma ferramenta reutilizável para criar workflows de WMS com Claude Code, permitindo uma maior eficiência e produtividade","ru":"Pegasus Wrapper - повторно используемый инструмент для создания рабочих потоков WMS с Claude Code, обеспечивающий повышение эффективности и производительности","ar":"أداة Pegasus Wrapper هي أداة قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لإنشاء سلاسل عمل WMS مع Claude Code، مما يسمح بزيادة الكفاءة والإنتاجية","en":"A reusable toolkit for creating Pegasus WMS workflows with Claude Code. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Pegasus Wrapper AI工具：创建工作流的可重用工具包","ja":"Pegasus Wrapper AIエージェント：Claude Codeでワークフローを作成するための再利用可能な...","ko":"Pegasus Wrapper AI 에이전트: Claude Code로 워크플ロー 생성을 위한 재사용 가능...","es":"Herramientas de AI: Pegasus Wrapper para flujos de trabajo","fr":"Outils IA: Pegasus Wrapper pour flux de travail","de":"KI-Tools: Pegasus Wrapper für Workflows","pt":"Ferramenta Pegasus Wrapper: Crie Workflows com Claude Code","ru":"ИИ Агент Pegasus Wrapper: Создание Рабочих Потоков с Clau...","ar":"أداة Pegasus Wrapper: إنشاء سلاسل عمل مع Claude Code","en":"pegasus-wrapper"},"description":{"zh":"Pegasus Wrapper是一个可重用工具包，用于创建Pegasus WMS工作流，基于Claude Code。它简化了开发流程，提高了效率","ja":"Pegasus Wrapperは、Claude Codeを使用してPegasus WMSワークフローを作成するための再利用可能なツールキットです。開発プロセスを簡素化し、効率を向上させます","ko":"Pegasus Wrapper는 Claude Code를 사용하여 Pegasus WMS 워크플ロー 생성을 위한 재사용 가능한 툴킷입니다. 개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 효율성을 향상시키는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"Pegasus Wrapper es una herramienta reutilizable para crear flujos de trabajo de Pegasus WMS con Claude Code, mejorando la eficiencia y productividad","fr":"Pegasus Wrapper est un outil réutilisable pour créer des flux de travail Pegasus WMS avec Claude Code, améliorant l''efficacité et la productivité","de":"Pegasus Wrapper ist ein wiederverwendbares Tool zum Erstellen von Pegasus-WMS-Workflows mit Claude Code, um Effizienz und Produktivität zu steigern","pt":"A Pegasus Wrapper é uma ferramenta reutilizável para criar workflows de WMS com Claude Code, permitindo uma maior eficiência e produtividade","ru":"Pegasus Wrapper - повторно используемый инструмент для создания рабочих потоков WMS с Claude Code, обеспечивающий повышение эффективности и производительности","ar":"أداة Pegasus Wrapper هي أداة قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لإنشاء سلاسل عمل WMS مع Claude Code، مما يسمح بزيادة الكفاءة والإنتاجية","en":"A reusable toolkit for creating Pegasus WMS workflows with Claude Code. "},"definition":{"en":"A reusable toolkit for creating Pegasus WMS workflows with Claude Code. "},"features":{"zh":["基于Claude Code的Pegasus WMS工作流创建","可重用工具包，简化开发流程","提高效率，减少开发时间","支持多种开发环境","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["Claude Codeを使用したPegasus WMSワークフロー作成","再利用可能なツールキット、開発プロセスを簡素化","効率を向上させ、開発時間を短縮","多種の開発環境をサポート","簡単に使用および統合可能"],"ko":["Claude Code를 사용한 Pegasus WMS 워크플ロー 생성","재사용 가능한 툴킷, 개발 프로세스 간소화","효율성을 향상시키고 개발 시간을 단축","다양한 개발 환경 지원","쉽게 사용 및 통합 가능"],"es":["Creación de flujos de trabajo de Pegasus WMS","Integración con Claude Code","Herramienta de código abierto","Mejora de la eficiencia y productividad","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Création de flux de travail Pegasus WMS","Intégration avec Claude Code","Outil open source","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Erstellung von Pegasus-WMS-Workflows","Integration mit Claude Code","Open-Source-Tool","Steigerung von Effizienz und Produktivität","Flexibilität und Anpassung"],"pt":["Criação de workflows de WMS personalizados","Integração com Claude Code","Ferramenta reutilizável","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных рабочих потоков WMS","Интеграция с Claude Code","Повторно используемый инструмент","Повышение эффективности и производительности","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء سلاسل عمل WMS مخصصة","التكامل مع Claude Code","أداة قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pegasus Wrapper","AI工具","工作流创建","Claude Code","开发效率","如何使用Pegasus Wrapper","Pegasus Wrapper安装","Pegasus Wrapper设置指南"],"ja":["Pegasus Wrapper","AIエージェント","ワークフロー作成","Claude Code","開発効率","Pegasus Wrapperの使い方","Pegasus Wrapperのインストール","Pegasus Wrapperの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Pegasus Wrapper","AI 에이전트","워크플ロー 생성","Claude Code","개발 효율","Pegasus Wrapper 사용법","Pegasus Wrapper 설치","Pegasus Wrapper 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de ai","pegasus wrapper","flujos de trabajo de pegasus wms","claud code","cómo usar pegasus wrapper","alternativas a pegasus wrapper","pegasus wrapper vs competidores","instalación de pegasus wrapper","guía de configuración de pegasus wrapper"],"fr":["outils ia","pegasus wrapper","flux de travail pegasus wms","claud code","comment utiliser pegasus wrapper","alternatives à pegasus wrapper","pegasus wrapper vs concurrents","installation de pegasus wrapper","guide de configuration de pegasus wrapper"],"de":["ki-tools","pegasus wrapper","pegasus-wms-workflows","claud code","wie man pegasus wrapper verwendet","alternativen zu pegasus wrapper","pegasus wrapper vs wettbewerber","installation von pegasus wrapper","einrichtungsanleitung für pegasus wrapper"],"pt":["como usar Pegasus Wrapper","o que é Pegasus Wrapper","Pegasus Wrapper alternativa","Pegasus Wrapper vs Claude Code","instalar Pegasus Wrapper","guia de configuração do Pegasus Wrapper"],"ru":["как использовать Pegasus Wrapper","что такое Pegasus Wrapper","альтернатива Pegasus Wrapper","Pegasus Wrapper vs Claude Code","установить Pegasus Wrapper","руководство по настройке Pegasus Wrapper"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Pegasus Wrapper","ما هي أداة Pegasus Wrapper","بديل أداة Pegasus Wrapper","أداة Pegasus Wrapper مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت أداة Pegasus Wrapper","دليل إعداد أداة Pegasus Wrapper"]}},"owner":"pegasus-isi","repo":"pegasus-workflow-toolkit","repoPath":"pegasus-isi/pegasus-workflow-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.121Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pegasus-wrapper","description":"Generate a wrapper script for a single Pegasus pipeline step","bodyPreview":"# Pegasus Wrapper Script Generator\n\nYou are a Pegasus wrapper script generator. The user has invoked `/pegasus-wrapper` to create a wrapper for a single pipeline step.\n\n## Step 1: Read Reference Materials\n\n1. Read `Pegasus.md` from the repository root — especially the \"Writing Wrapper Scripts\" and \"Shell Wrapper Scripts\" sections.\n2. Read `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` as starting points.\n\n## Step 2: Gather Requirements\n\nAsk the user (skip que","body":"# Pegasus Wrapper Script Generator\n\nYou are a Pegasus wrapper script generator. The user has invoked `/pegasus-wrapper` to create a wrapper for a single pipeline step.\n\n## Step 1: Read Reference Materials\n\n1. Read `Pegasus.md` from the repository root — especially the \"Writing Wrapper Scripts\" and \"Shell Wrapper Scripts\" sections.\n2. Read `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` as starting points.\n\n## Step 2: Gather Requirements\n\nAsk the user (skip questions they''ve already answered):\n\n1. **Tool name**: What tool does this wrapper invoke? (e.g., `samtools sort`, `bwa mem`, a Python library, an API)\n2. **Inputs and outputs**: What files does it read and write? Include filenames or patterns.\n3. **Does the tool produce nested output?** If yes (e.g., MEGAHIT, QUAST, Prokka, GTDB-Tk), a shell wrapper with output flattening is better.\n4. **Python or shell?**\n   - Python (recommended for most cases): subprocess calls, API fetches, pure-Python analysis\n   - Shell (when needed): tools with nested output directories, headless display handling, simple tool chaining\n5. **Does this wrapper need to accept multiple input files?** (For fan-in/merge jobs, use `action=\"append\"` or `nargs=\"+\"`)\n6. **Does this wrapper call support files?** (R scripts, JARs, config files that Pegasus stages into the working directory)\n\n## Step 3: Select Reference Pattern\n\nBased on user answers, read the closest existing example:\n\n| Pattern | Reference |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Subprocess calling a CLI tool | `examples/wrapper_python_example.py` |\n| API fetch (requests) | `examples/workflow_generator_earthquake.py` (see fetch_earthquake_data pattern) |\n| Shell wrapper with output flattening | `examples/wrapper_shell_example.sh` |\n| ML training wrapper | `examples/workflow_generator_soilmoisture.py` (see train_model pattern) |\n| Fan-in merge (multiple inputs) | `examples/workflow_generator_airquality.py` (see merge pattern) |\n\nRead the selected reference before generating code.\n\n## Step 4: Generate the Wrapper\n\n### For Python wrappers:\n\nStart from `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.py` and customize:\n\n1. **Docstring**: Describe what this step does\n2. **argparse arguments**: Must match what the `workflow_generator.py` will pass via `add_args()`\n3. **`os.makedirs`**: Create output subdirectories before writing (any path with `/`)\n4. **Tool invocation**: Use `subprocess.run()` for CLI tools, or call Python libraries directly\n5. **Exit code propagation**: `sys.exit(result.returncode)` after subprocess\n6. **Structured logging**: Use `logging` module with `logger.info()` for inputs, commands, and results\n7. **Output verification**: Check the output file exists before exiting\n\n### For shell wrappers:\n\nStart from `pegasus-templates/wrapper_template.sh` and customize:\n\n1. **`set -euo pipefail`**: Always include\n2. **Argument parsing**: `case` statement to extract named arguments\n3. **Tool execution**: Call the tool with parsed arguments\n4. **Output flattening**: Copy expected output files from nested directories to the working directory root\n5. **Headless handling** (if needed): `unset DISPLAY`, `xvfb-run` fallback\n\n### Critical Rules\n\n1. **Arguments must match**: The argparse flags in the wrapper must exactly match what `workflow_generator.py` passes in `add_args()`. Show the user both sides.\n2. **No directory scanning**: Never use `glob()`, `os.listdir()`, `list.files()`, or `find` to discover input files. Accept them explicitly via arguments.\n3. **Support files via `os.getcwd()`**: If the wrapper needs a support file (R script, JAR), find it with `os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"filename\")` — NOT relative to `__file__`.\n4. **Create subdirectories**: Any output path containing `/` needs `os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output), exist_ok=True)`.\n5. **Print the command**: Always log the command being run — this is essential for debugging via `pegasus-analyzer`.\n\n## Step 5: Show Integration\n\nAfter generating the wrapper, show the user the corresponding code needed in `workflow_generator.py`:\n\n1. **Transformation Catalog entry**: The `Transformation()` registration with correct `pfn`, `is_stageable`, memory, and cores\n2. **Job definition**: The `Job()` with `add_args()`, `add_inputs()`, `add_outputs()` that matches the wrapper''s argparse\n3. **Replica Catalog entry** (if the wrapper uses support files): `rc.add_replica()` for R scripts, JARs, etc.\n\nThis ensures the wrapper and workflow generator stay in sync.\n\n## Full Workflow Repositories\n\nFor complete wrapper scripts beyond the examples:\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/tnseq-workflow (Python wrappers for bioinformatics)\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/earthquake-workflow (API fetch wrappers)\n- https://github.com/pegasus-isi/mag-workflow (shell wrappers with output flattening)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:18.268Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated workflow creation with Pegasus WMS and Claude Code integration.","zh":"适合需要使用Pegasus WMS和Claude Code集成自动化工作流创建的AI代理。","ja":"Pegasus WMSとClaude Codeの統合による自動ワークフローの作成を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Pegasus WMS와 Claude Code 통합을 통해 자동 워크플로우 생성이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan la creación automática de flujos de trabajo con Pegasus WMS y la integración de Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant la création automatisée de flux de travail avec Pegasus WMS et l''intégration de Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die die automatisierte Erstellung von Workflows mit Pegasus WMS und Claude Code-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de criação de fluxo de trabalho automatizada com Pegasus WMS e integração com Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется автоматизированное создание рабочих процессов с помощью Pegasus WMS и интеграции с Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء تدفق عمل آلي مع Pegasus WMS ودمج Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate reusable Pegasus wrapper scripts using Python, leveraging Claude Code for seamless workflow integration and shell wrapper scripts for flexible execution, all while utilizing pegasus-templates for standardized workflow development.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python生成可重用的Pegasus包装脚本的能力，利用Claude Code实现无缝的工作流集成，并使用shell包装脚本实现灵活的执行，同时利用pegasus-templates实现标准化的工作流开发。","ja":"Pythonを使用して再利用可能なPegasusラッパースクリプトを生成し、Claude Codeを利用してシームレスなワークフロー統合を実現し、shellラッパースクリプトを使用して柔軟な実行を実現し、pegasus-templatesを利用して標準化されたワークフローの開発を実現するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Python을 사용하여 재사용 가능한 Pegasus 래퍼 스크립트를 생성하고, Claude Code를 활용하여 무손실의 워크플로우 통합을 구현하며, 쉘 래퍼 스크립트를 사용하여 유연한 실행을 구현하며, pegasus-templates를 활용하여 표준화된 워크플로우 개발을 구현하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar scripts de wrapper de Pegasus reutilizables utilizando Python, aprovechando Claude Code para una integración de flujo de trabajo sin problemas y scripts de wrapper de shell para una ejecución flexible, todo mientras se utilizan pegasus-templates para el desarrollo de flujos de trabajo estandarizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des scripts de wrapper Pegasus réutilisables en utilisant Python, en exploitant Claude Code pour une intégration de flux de travail transparente et des scripts de wrapper shell pour une exécution flexible, le tout en utilisant pegasus-templates pour le développement de flux de travail standardisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, wiederverwendbare Pegasus-Wrapper-Skripte mit Python zu generieren, indem Claude Code für eine nahtlose Workflow-Integration und Shell-Wrapper-Skripte für eine flexible Ausführung genutzt wird, und zwar unter Verwendung von pegasus-templates für die standardisierte Workflow-Entwicklung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar scripts de wrapper reutilizáveis do Pegasus usando Python, aproveitando o Claude Code para integração de fluxo de trabalho sem problemas e scripts de wrapper de shell para execução flexível, tudo isso utilizando pegasus-templates para desenvolvimento de fluxo de trabalho padronizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать многократно используемые обертки Pegasus с помощью Python, используя Claude Code для бесперебойной интеграции рабочих процессов и оберток shell для гибкой реализации, все это при использовании pegasus-templates для стандартизированного развития рабочих процессов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد نصوص برمجية قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام من Pegasus باستخدام Python، مستفيدًا من Claude Code لدمج تدفق العمل دون مشاكل ونصوص برمجية غلاف Shell للتنفيذ المرن، كل ذلك باستخدام pegasus-templates لتطوير تدفق العمل المعياري."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Pegasus WMS workflow creation","Generating wrapper scripts for pipeline steps","Integrating Claude Code with Pegasus workflows"],"zh":["自动化Pegasus WMS工作流创建","为管道步骤生成包装脚本","将Claude Code集成到Pegasus工作流中"],"ja":["Pegasus WMSワークフローの自動化","パイプラインのステップのラッパースクリプトの生成","Claude CodeをPegasusワークフローに統合する"],"ko":["Pegasus WMS 워크플로우 자동화","파이프라인 단계를 위한 래퍼 스크립트 생성","Claude Code를 Pegasus 워크플로우에 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de flujos de trabajo de Pegasus WMS","Generación de scripts de wrapper para pasos de tuberías","Integración de Claude Code con flujos de trabajo de Pegasus"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de flux de travail Pegasus WMS","Génération de scripts de wrapper pour les étapes de pipeline","Intégration de Claude Code avec les flux de travail Pegasus"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Pegasus-WMS-Workflows","Generierung von Wrapper-Skripten für Pipeline-Schritte","Integration von Claude Code in Pegasus-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de fluxo de trabalho do Pegasus WMS","Gerar scripts de wrapper para etapas de pipeline","Integrar Claude Code com fluxos de trabalho do Pegasus"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание рабочих процессов Pegasus WMS","Генерировать обертки для шагов конвейера","Интегрировать Claude Code с рабочими процессами Pegasus"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإن